<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Kyenesis</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mose Kukũ Kasale ee Kyenesis</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kyenesis</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kye</para>
  <para style="mt1">MOSE KUKŨ KASALE,</para>
  <para style="mt2">EE</para>
  <para style="mt1">KYENESIS</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKI OTUO</para>
  <para style="im">Ɔlaa obuɛ wɔ mmle ninle ni kasɔ kakyekɔ yi, diotuo mmle okle di Yaa lakye ni asaa ɔbla kasɔ. Kukũ ko mmle kobuɛ mmle okle di Yaa labla ni kayi, otii kasɔ kakyekɔ, mmle okle di okpile lakye ni kasɔ ku kayi ka mmle dibuo ku mmle okle di Yaa ku otii kasiɛ nte nii. Baafuo kasɔ kakyekɔ kukũ ko mmle ɔsɛ di ɔsaabla akyuu anyɔ:</para>
  <para style="ip">(1) Mmle baabla ni kayi ka mmle ku mmle di batii suoto ɔlaa lakye ni kasɔ. Nnya diakye kasɔ di Adam ku Ewa suoto, Kain ku Abel, Noa ku mmle di ntu layii ni kayi ku Babilon Leyo takale nwu (Disi 1—11).</para>
  <para style="ip">(2) Israel batii bawa lɛma suoto ɔlaa kasɔ kakyekɔ. Ɔkasale ninle Abraham, nwɔ suoto ɔlaa buye ni di ofũ onu nɔɔ suoto ku mmle aakyɔɔ ni Yaa kotoko. Ɔlaa wɔ nintikanko ni ninle obi nɔɔ Isak suoto ɔlaa, ku ɔwa nɔɔ suɔtɔbi Yakob wɔ kafɔɔ manlɛɛ ni Israel ku lefosi babi banyɔ nɔɔ ba niale ni Israel lɛsɔse le ninle ni nfaabi lefosi-nnyɔ. Anu finle latika di obi nɔɔ suɔtɔbi wɔ manlɛɛ ni Yosef suoto, diata alɛ ote Yakob ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bule ku ayo lɛma batii lasifi baalaasiɛ di Egipte. (Disi 12-50).</para>
  <para style="ip">Di obe wɔ di kukũ ko mmle kɔkakatɛ ni di batii suoto yi, diodiki nintuo klekle lɛsaa finle le di Yaa ntɔɔbla nii. Diekye kasɔ diodiki nintuo klekle alɛ Yaa niɛbla kayi, diɛyɛntɛ kafɔɔ ku ntam alɛ Yaa makple andiki antootuo mmle okle ɛɛyɔ nwu ni ole di batii nɔɔ suoto. Di kukũ ko mmle kumuu kamɛ, lɛsaa le diotuo ni ninle mmle di Yaa nkanko, ananfi ni batii ba nimbla ni okpile kootoko anleko ni batii nɔɔ kafɔɔ katũ ankyakaako ma ni, anlolaa ma ni nkpa suoto ɔlaa. Bɛɛkpana saa kukũ ko mmle; bɛɛkpana kale kanwii ofũ onu ɔlaa alɛ baakyakaako ofũ onu nwu nkpo nwɛ nkpa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Mmle di Yaa labla ni kayi ku otii kasɔ kakyekɔ 1.1-2.25</para>
  <para style="io1">Sikpile ku dibuo kasɔ kayekɔ 3.1-24</para>
  <para style="io1">Diayɔ ni di Adam dialase ni di Noa 4.1-5.32</para>
  <para style="io1">Noa ku ntu oyii 6.1-10.32</para>
  <para style="io1">Babilon Leyo Takale nwu 11.1-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Diayɔ ni Sem dialase ni di Abram 11.10-32</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel batii bawa: Abraham, Isak ku Yakob 12.1-35.29</para>
  <para style="io1">Esau banantii 36.1- 43</para>
  <para style="io1">Yosef ku babilɛma suɔtɔbi 37.1- 45.28</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel batii di Egipte kasɔ 46.1-50.26</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kayi Ɔbla Kasɔ Kakyekɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Di kasɔ kakyekɔ Yaa labla osi ku kasɔ. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, kasɔ ditawɛ letembi kuniwii, kaate kafukuti, ditunu latĩi ntu be niate ni kaasɔ nwu anu, ni di Yaa Ninwuna latookyi di ntu nwu anu nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Ni di Yaa labuɛ alɛ &lt;&lt;Ta dikpa&gt;&gt; ni diakpa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Ni di Yaa lanya lɛkpa nwu alɛ dilɛ, ni aasɛ lɛkpa nwu ku ditunu ntɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Ni di Yaa lalɛɛ lɛkpa nwu alɛ &lt;&lt;Dii,&gt;&gt; ni aalɛɛ ditunu nwu kafɔɔ alɛ &lt;&lt;Kakyɛ&gt;&gt; nɛ. Ninfɛ kaale laloo, ni kaasɛ, dii kasale nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Ni di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obo kute di ntu ntɛɛ, kuɛsɛ ntu be ninkpe ni di osi ku kasɔ ntɛɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Nkpo oso Yaa labla obo kuasɛ ntu be ninkpe ni di obo nwu kalɔ ku mbe ninkpe ni di osi ntɛɛ. Ni diawa kaanya nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Ni di Yaa lalɛɛ obo nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kolo&gt;&gt; nɛ. Ni kaale laloo, ni kaasɛ, dii nyɔɔfa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Ninfɛ di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntu be ninkpe ni koolo kalɔ disi di lɛba ninwiii, di kasɔ kosole kadie.&gt;&gt; Ni diawa kaanya nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Ni di Yaa lalɛɛ kakosolekɔ nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kasɔ&gt;&gt;, ni aalɛɛ ntu be niasi ni lɛɛba ninwii alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lekpo&gt;&gt; nɛ. Ni di Yaa lanya alɛ dilɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Ninfɛ di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ta kasɔ kakɔntɔ sɛfa bokoboko, sɛfa se nintika ni abi ku awoso ya nintika ni abi ku abi ninya ate ate kaasɔ.&gt;&gt; Ninfɛ diawa kaanya nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Ni di kasɔ lakɔntɔ sɛfa bokoboko, sɛfa se nintika ni abi ku awoso ya nintika ni awosobi ku abi ninya ate ate nɛ. Ni di Yaa lanya alɛ dilɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Ninfɛ kaale laloo, ni kaasɛ, dii tiɛfa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Ninfɛ di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ta sɛtɔ sidie di kolo suoto, siɛsɛ dii ku kakyɛ ntɛɛ, alɛ aale atuosaa ya nimate antootuo ni obe, ayi ku alɛɛ, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />alɛ siale sɛtɔ di kolo suoto sintɔɔkpa di kasɔ suoto.&gt;&gt; Ni diawa kaanya nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Nioso Yaa labla ɛtɔ kplɛ ɛnyɔ, nnwɔ niemuɔ kulenke ni alɛ kuabla ɔkpɛ di dii kamɛ, nnwɔ niebiibii ni kafɔɔ alɛ kuabla ɔkpɛ di kakyɛ. Aabla kafɔɔ awɛntrɛbi. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Yaa labla ɛtɔ nwu di kolo suoto alɛ siakpa di kasɔ suoto, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />alɛ siabla sɛkpɛ di dii ku kakyɛ kamɛ, sinsɛ lɛkpa ku ditunu ntɛɛ. Ni di Yaa lanya alɛ dilɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Ninfɛ kaale laloo, ni kaasɛ, dii naafa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Ninfɛ di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ta asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa ateate ayii ntu nwu kamɛ, di bakansiɛ baflɛlɛtɛ bafe di kasɔ osi di kolo anu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Nioso Yaa labla ntu kamɛ babɔkɛɛ-kplɛ ku asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa, ankyɛ ni nintu kamɛ ate ate, ku bakansiɛ ate ate ku atembi lɛma. Ni di Yaa lanya alɛ dilɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Ninfɛ di Yaa lawii ma lɛyɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bilofo, biɛkpɛ biyii lekpo ntu kamɛ, bakansiɛ kafɔɔ bakpɛ bayii kayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Ninfɛ kaale laloo, ni kaasɛ, dii nɔɔnle nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Ninfɛ di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ta asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa ate ate adie akye kasɔ kamɛ, babɔkɛɛ sele ku asaa ya ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto ku babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni abe biala ku atembi lɛma.&gt;&gt; Ni diawa kaanya nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Yaa labla babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni abe ku atembi lɛma, babɔkɛɛ sele ku atembi lɛma, ku babɔkɛɛ ba bamuu ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ ku atembi lɛma. Ni di Yaa lanya alɛ dilɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Ninfɛ di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bita bubla otii di letembi loo kanya, aadie wo, aale sɛsaate di lekpo kamɛ kɔkpaku suoto ku bakansiɛ ba ninflɛlɛtɛ ni ku babɔkɛɛ sele di kasɔ kamuu suoto ku babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni abe suoto ku babɔkɛɛ ba bamuu ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Nioso Yaa labla osuɔtɔ di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ letembi kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 1:27">di Yaa letembi kanya aabla nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 1:27">osuɔtɔ ku ɔsanko aabla ma.<verse eid="GEN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Yaa lawii ma lɛyɔɔ ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bilofo biɛkpɛ biyii kayi biele ka sɛsaate. Biele sɛsaate di lekpo kamɛ kɔkpaku ku kɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ bakansiɛ ku asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa ankpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto.<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Ninfɛ di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lɛyɔ ɔfa biala nintika ni abi kaasɔ kamuu suoto ku kowoso biala ninkpe ni abi kaamɛ lɛta ye; alɛ aale ye alesaa. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Kafɔɔ babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni abe bamuu ku bakansiɛ bamuu kɔɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ ku babɔkɛɛ ba bamuu ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto ku asaa amuu ya ninkpe ni nkpa, lɛyɔ sɛfa kɔnle lɛta ma fɛ alesaa.&gt;&gt; Ni diawa kaanya nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Ni di Yaa lanya asaa ya amuu aabla nii alɛ ɛɛtɛ alɛ. Ninfɛ kaale laloo, ni kaasɛ, dii kuɔnle nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Nioso nkpo aaloo osi ku kasɔ ku asaa ya amuu ninsi ni kaamɛ ɔbla nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Di dii kuɛnsinle Yaa laloo ɔkpɛ wɔ aatɔɔbla ni ɔbla, ni aatɛ ɔnyɛɛ di dii kuɛnsinle nwu nkpo suoto di sɛkpɛ nɔɔ ɔbla kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Ni di Yaa lawii dii kuɛnsinle nwu nkpo lɛyɔɔ ni aabla ni klekle nɛ, diekye dii nwu nkpo suoto aatɛ ɔnyɛɛ di ɔkpɛ wɔ omuu aabla ni di asaa ya aabla ni suoto nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adam Ku Ewa Suoto Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Nnya mmle okle diawa ni di obe wɔ baabla ni osi ku kasɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Obe wɔ di SAATE Yaa labla ni kasɔ ku osi yi, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />lepoo kamɛ kowoso kukunwii ditayila kaasɔ ee ɔfa kuonwii ditayila, diekye SAATE Yaa diita kanto anɔɔ akpete ka ee otii kuonwii nnaa abakpɛ ka nii. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Kafɔɔ seklenyii ntaa sinkye kasɔ kamɛ simakpekpete kaasɔ nwu kamuu anu. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Ninfɛ di Saate Yaa layɔ kɔtɛ kaasɔ aabla osuɔtɔ, ni aanwuna nkpa ninwuna aakpete nwɔ di onwu kamɛ, ni di osuɔtɔ nwu lakple otii wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Ninfɛ di Saate Yaa labla kɔba di Eden, di kufĩ katunkɔ, ni aayɔ osuɔtɔ wɔ aabla nii aalaakpee ninfa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Ninfɛ di Saate Yaa lata awoso ate ate ya nikɔlɛ ni onyu, ku n-ya abi ninlɛ kafɔɔ alɛ baale ni lakɔntɔ kaasɔ nwu suoto nɛ. Di kɔba nwu nkpo ntɛɛ yi, nkpa kowoso ku lɛsaatofo kowoso, ɛɛta ni dibiene ku okpile layila.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Okle onwii labiɛ kuakye Eden kuatookpete kɔba nwu ntu; diayɔ ni ninfa kuasɛ kuabla ekle ɛna. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Ɔkasale leyooto ninle Pison, nwu ninle okle wɔ niebiɛ kuokyi ni Hawila kasɔ kamuu suoto, nfũ kooto sɛɛle nkpe ni nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />(Koto sɛɛle nwu kaasɔ nwu suoto lɛtɛ kulɛ. Akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa bɔɔlɛɛ ni bedolas ku afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya bɔɔlɛɛ ni oniks nkpe ninfa.) <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Okle nyɔɔfa leyooto ninle Gison, kuobiɛ kuokyi Kus kasɔ kamuu suoto. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Okle tiɛfa leyooto ninle Tiklis nwu kuobiɛ kuofe di Assur kasɔ suoto di kufĩ katunkɔ. Okle naafa kafɔɔ ninle Eufrate nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Ninfɛ di Saate Yaa layɔ otii aakpee di Eden kɔba nwu kamɛ alɛ akpɛ aatoonyu kũ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Ninfɛ di Saate Yaa lakpee osuɔtɔ nwu kufiofa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Le kowoso biala dibi di kɔba nwu kamɛ fãa. <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />Kafɔɔ kowoso ko ninta ni lɛsaatofo diɛta ni dibiene ku dikpile dibi yi, tanle. Nse fɛɛnwaanii feele, kubio fabakpi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Ninfɛ di Saate Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Diɛlɛ alɛ osuɔtɔ kasiɛ lete nɔɔ. Kamabla kyakaakotɛ wɔ niesiɛko ni ntɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Nioso Saate Yaa layɔ kɔtɛ aabla lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu ku bakansiɛ bamuu ninflɛlɛtɛ ni kɔɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ. Ni aakpaa ma aakyɛnko otii nfũ alɛ anyu mmle okle aata ma ni ayooto nɛ. Nioso mmle okle di otii lalɛɛ ni bɔkɛɛ biala ninkpe ni nkpa, nkpo okle niale ma ayooto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Nioso otii nwu lata babɔkɛɛ sele bamuu ayooto, bakansiɛ ba ninflɛlɛtɛ ni kɔɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu ayooto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:20">Kafɔɔ Adam nnwɔɔ, atawɛ kyakaakotɛ wɔ niesiɛko nwɔ nii. <verse eid="GEN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Nioso Saate Yaa lata osuɔtɔ nwu labuo di sɛkyɔsĩ aasifi kamɛ, di obe wɔ ɔɔkyɔsĩi nii, ni aadiki nwɔ ɔfɛkɛnfɛ-wesee onwii, ni aatĩi lɛba nwu ku suoto sina nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Ninfɛ di Saate Yaa labla ɔsanko aakyeko ɔfɛkɛnfɛ-wesee wɔ aadiki ni di osuɔtɔ kamɛ, ni aakpaa nwɔ aawako osuɔtɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu labuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">&lt;&lt;Mia nfɛ nɛ! Nle mmle ninle dikufi le niekye ni akufi nii kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">ku sina se niekye ni sina nii kamɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">Baalɛɛ nwɔ alɛ &lt;Ɔsanko,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">diekye osuɔtɔ kamɛ beediki nwɔ beekyeko.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Nle mmle oso, osuɔtɔ madie andiɛ ote ku ɔya manaabla onwii ku ɔsɔfɔ, mankple suoto sina sinwii.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Osuɔtɔ nwu ku ɔsɔfɔ, banyɔ lɛma baasiɛ lɛkyɔtɔ, kafɔɔ sinunsɔ ditatɔɔkpɛ ma.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Otii Otokopĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Di obe nwu kamɛ kɔsaanwu labe anu kualenkee babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni kobe bamuu di Saate Yaa labla nii. Ni kuakaalɛ Ɔsanko nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwaako di Yaa lebuɛ alɛ, &lt;Bitanle kowoso kukunwii dibi di kɔba nwu nkpo kamɛ?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ kɔsaanwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Buale kowoso biala dibi di kɔba nwu kamɛ, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />kafɔɔ Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;Bitanle kowoso ko nin-yɛ ni di kɔba nwu ntɛɛ dibi, bitankpanko ni kafɔɔ, nse diele nkpo bibakpi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Ninfɛ di kɔsaanwu nwu latɔkɔ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bilɔbakpi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />&lt;&lt;Diekye Yaa n-ye alɛ nse biele dibi nwu nkpo yi, dibakpa ye minte fɛ Yaa, mintofo dibiene ku dikpile.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Obe wɔ di ɔsanko nwu lanya alɛ kowoso nwu dibi nlɛ alɛ baale ni ku mmle diɔlɛ ni onyu, ku mmle aamiɛ alɛ aawɛ ni ninumbe yi, ni aatɛsɛ lewo aale nɛ. Ni aayɔ lewo kafɔɔ aata ɔsa nɔɔ wɔ niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ aale nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Ninfɛ diakpa akyuu lɛma anyɔ nwu nɛ, ni baatofo alɛ basi lɛkyɔtɔ nɛ. Nioso baakaa kubue afata baakyasa, ni baayɔ baatĩi lɛkyɔtɔ lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Obe wɔ di osuɔtɔ nwu ku ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ lanu ni Saate Yaa lɛkpanko akyɛ ni di kɔba nwu kamɛ di kɔtɔɔfɔ lebe yi, ni baawofa Saate Yaa di awoso kamɛ di kɔba nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Kafɔɔ Saate Yaa lalɛɛ osuɔtɔ nwu aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔfɛ fakpe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lenu fɔ lɛkpanko di kɔba nwu kamɛ, ni lɛyɛkɛ lɛwofasa suoto nɛ. Diekye nsi lɛkyɔtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Ni di Saate Yaa lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Owe niɛtɔkɔ fɔ alɛ fasi lɛkyɔtɔ? Feele kowoso ko dibi lakpee fɔ kufiofa nlɛ tanle niɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔsanko wɔ fɛɛyɔ fɛɛtɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nii ninfũ niatɛɛ kowoso nwu dibi lewo, ni lale nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Ninfɛ di Saate Yaa lakaalɛ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be lɛsaa fɛɛbla nkpo nɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Ni di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɔsaanwu nwu niakyɔnkyɔ mi, ni lale nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Letokonafi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Nioso Saate Yaa latɔkɔ kɔsaanwu nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ta lɛsaa le fɛɛbla ni oso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:14">&lt;&lt;Bɛɛkpaani fɔ balenke babɔkɛɛ sele bamuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu kamɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:14">Kafutu lɛfɔ suoto fabawududu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">fabale kɔtɛ kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">di nkpa lɛfɔ mmuu disiɛbi kamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Kamakpee kakyidi kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">minko ɔsanko nwu ntɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">ku ɔnantii lɛfɔ ku ole nwɔ ntɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:15">ababiɛ fɔ disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">afɔ kafɔɔ fabanu nwɔ lɛnankpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Ɔsanko nwu kafɔɔ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:16">&lt;&lt;Kamata dibuo lɛfɔ mpɔ di babi olofo kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">dibuo kamɛ fabalofo babi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:16">Anu lɛfɔ matika di ɔsa lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">abale sɛsaate di suoto lɛfɔ kafɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Ni aatɔkɔ Adam alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ta faakyɔɔ ni ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ atoko faale ni kowso dibi le lakpee fɔ kufiofa nlɛ, &lt;Tanle ni oso,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:17">&lt;&lt;Lɛkpaani kasɔ ta afɔ oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:17">dibabuo fɔ fiɛ fabale ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:17">di nkpa lɛfɔ mmuu osiɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Siwuu ku akũmii nimakɔntɔ ka di suoto kanta fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:18">fabale kafɔɔ kasɔ ka mmle sɛfa.<verse eid="GEN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Apipi makpɛ fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">fiɛ fabawɛ lelesaa fanle</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:19">diɛlaase di obe wɔ fabakple fansifi ni kɔtɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">diekye nkũ kamɛ beediki fɔ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:19">diekye kɔtɛ fale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">nkũ kamɛ kafɔɔ fabakple fansifi nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Ni di Adam latika ɔsɔfɔ leyooto alɛ Ewa nɛ. Diekye nnwɔɔ nimale batii bamuu kɔya nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Ni di Saate Yaa layɔ kɔbɔkɛɛ kũ aabla akpeele aakpee Adam ku ɔsɔfɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Latososa Adam Ku Ewa Di Edem Kɔba Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Ninfɛ di Saate Yaa labuɛ alɛ &lt;&lt;Osuɔtɔ nwu nfɛ nte fɛ onwii loo, aye ni dibiene ku dikpile. Dinaa alɛ bɛɛtɔɔ osuku ɛɛtɛsɛ nkpa kowoso dibi nwu eele alɛ, aasiɛ nkpa dinaa ni kaloo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Nioso Saate Yaa ladiki nwɔ di Eden kɔba nwu kamɛ alɛ atɔɔkyɛ aalaatɔɔkpɛ kasɔ ka kamɛ bɛɛbla nwɔ beekyeko ni. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Obe wɔ aadiki ni Adam ku Ewa aaloo nii, ni aayɔ kerubim ku ɔtɔ kapamii bembe aase di kufĩ katũnkɔ di Eden kɔba nwu kamɛ, kaatɔɔnwanyi kaatoofe katoo ku kala alɛ kaatoonyu osuku wɔ niefe ni nkpa kowoso nwu katũ.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kain Ku Abel Suoto Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Ni di Adam latenko ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Ewa ni aalaka lɛmɛ aalofo Kain nɛ. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Di Saate lɛkyakaako kamɛ lelofo osuɔtɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Nni kamaa aalofo obilɛma Abel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:2">Ninfɛ di Abel labale babɔkɛɛ setɛ, ni di Kain lale fekpɛntɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Di obe owo sɛmaa, Kain layɔ kofe nɔɔ alesaa awo aabaata asaaɔta aata SAATE nwu. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Abel kafɔɔ layɔ babɔkɛɛ nɔɔ abi kasale ya ninsi ni lɛla aawako. Ni di Abel ku asaaɔta nɔɔ nwu labuo Saate anu nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />Kafɔɔ Kain ku asaaɔta nɔɔ nwu ditabuo Saate anu. Nioso Kain lanya ɔblɔ osie kanya aakatu anu.<verse eid="GEN 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Ninfɛ di Saate lakaalɛ Kain alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be oso fɔɔnya ɔblɔ? Be oso fɛɛkatu anu? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Nse fɛ fambla lɛsaa nwaa nse suoto ntabayɔɔ fɔ. Kafɔɔ feesĩ ni lɛsaa nwaa ɔbla oso yi, okpile nfɛ nsoko fɔ di kayokontũ; kuomiɛ alɛ kulenkee fɔ, kafɔɔ dikpeni feelenkee nwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Nni sɛmaa Kain latɔkɔ obilɛma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ta busifi kofe&gt;&gt; Obe wɔ baawɛ ni koofe, ni di Kain lataka di obilɛma Abel suoto aalo nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lakaalɛ Kain alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔfɛ di obilee suɔtɔbi Abel nkpe?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ &lt;&lt;Nin-ye! Ami ninle obiloo nyuntɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Ni di Saate lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be fɛɛbla nkpo nɛ? Nu lo! Obilee suɔtɔbi ntɔ kɔfaa ninlɛɛ mi kaasɔ suoto. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Nunua yi, batɔɔkpaani fɔ beediki fɔ kafɔɔ di kasɔ ka niabɛ kanya kaanyi ni obilee ntɔ di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ suoto. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Nse fɛɛkpɛ kaasɔ nwu yi, klɔbasinsoo alesaa kata fɔ. Fabakple kɔlalaa fankyɛ fantookyi kasɔ ka mmle suoto.<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Ni di Kain latɔkɔ Saate alɛ, &lt;&lt;Letokonanfi nii nlenke mi nnɛɛ. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Miɛ foodiki mi di kasɔ nwu suoto, kodie fɔ kafɔɔ di anu; kamakple kɔlalaa nkyɛ ntookyi kasɔ ka mmle, olele kafɔɔ niɛnyɛɛ kamalo mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Kafɔɔ Saate nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Diele nkpo; Nse otii owo lelo Kain, babananfi nwɔ kootoko sikuɛnsĩ manlenkeesa.&gt;&gt; Nioso Saate nwu latɛ nwɔ nsũ alɛ otii lele niɛnyɔɔ, alaalo nwɔ. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Nioso Kain ladie di Saate anu aasifi, aalaasiɛ di Nod kasɔ suoto di kufĩ katunkɔ di Eden.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kain Ku Banantii Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kain latenko ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ ni aalaka lɛmɛ, ni aalofo Enok nɛ. Kain latoobudi okpoo, ni aayɔ obi nɔɔ Enok leyooto aatika okpoo nwu nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Ninfɛ baalofo Irad nɛ. Ni di Irad lalofo Mehuyael, ni di Mehuyael lalofo Metusael, ni di Metusael kafɔɔ kolofo Lamek nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lamek layɔ basanko banyɔ, ɔkasale leyooto niale Ada, ɔnyɔɔfa leyooto niale Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada lalofo Yabal, nnwɔɔ niale akpaayo kamɛ basiɛtɛ ku babɔkɛɛ basetɛ bamuu kote nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Obilɛma suɔtɔbi niale Yubal nɛ, nnwɔɔ niale sanku ku kakyukyuee bafɛtɛ bamuu kote nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Sila kafɔɔ lalofo Tuba-Kain, nwɔ niatɔɔbla ni akpɛnsaa ateate aatookyeko ni kupa ku abɔɔsaa kamɛ. Tuba-Kain obilɛma sankobi niale Naama nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lamek latɔkɔ basɔfɔ nɔɔ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">&lt;&lt;Ada ku Sila, bikyɔɔ mi atoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">Lamek basɔfɔ, binu mi ɔlaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Lalo osuɔtɔ onwii diekye aatika mi kakɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">okosopo onwii diekye aatika mi kakɔ.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Nse babatufu otii wɔ nimabla ni Kain lɛsaa lewo koto sikuɛnsĩ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:24">ni otii wɔ nimabla ni Lamek lɛsaa lewo, babatufu nwɔ koto afosi-akuɛnsĩ sikuɛnsĩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Set Ku Enos Lelofo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adam lakple aatenko ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Ewa, ni aalofo obisuɔtɔbi nɛ. Ni di Ewa latɔɔ leyooto alɛ Set nɛ. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yaa lekple ɛɛtɛɛ obi bamba eese Abel kanya. Nnwɔ di Kain lalo nii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Baalofo obisuɔtɔbi kafɔɔ baata Set ni aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Enos nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:26">Obe nwu kamɛ, batii lakye kasɔ baatoosumu SAATE nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Adam Ku Noa Kɔna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Nnya Adam kɔna kukũ ɔlaa ninle nko mmle nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 5:1">Obe wɔ di Yaa labla ni otii yi, aabla nwɔ di nnwɔɔ Yaa letembi kanya. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Osuɔtɔ ku ɔsanko aabla ma, ni aawii ma lɛyɔɔ nɛ. Di dii le aabla ma nii, ni aalɛɛ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Otii&gt;&gt; nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Obe wɔ di Adam lafũ ni alɛɛ kɔlafa afosi atiɛ yi, ni aalofo obisuɔtɔbi wɔ niadie nwɔ ni di letembi nɔɔ kanya, ni aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Set nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Baalofo Set baaloo ni kamaa, Adam lafũ alɛɛ alafa anɛ, ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babi sankobi bamba nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Adam lasiɛ nkpa aafũ alɛɛ alafa anaasĩ afosi atiɛ fiɛ aakpi.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Obe wɔ di Set lafũ ni alɛɛ kɔlafa alɛɛ anɔɔ, ni aalofo Enos nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Di obe wɔ aalofo Enos aaloo nii, Set lafũ alɛɛ alafa anɛ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ, ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Set lasiɛ nkpa aafũ alɛɛ alafa anaasĩ lefosi-anyɔ fiɛ aakpi.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Obe wɔ di Enos lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi anaasĩ, ni aalofo Kenan nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Di obe wɔ aalofo Kenan aaloo nii, aafũ alɛɛ alafa anɛ lefosi-anɔɔ ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enos lafũ alɛɛ alafa anaasĩ alɛɛ anɔɔ fiɛ aakpi.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Obe wɔ di Kenan lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi akuɛnsĩ, ni aalofo Mahalalel nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Di obe wɔ aalofo Mahalalel aaloo nii, aafũ alɛɛ alafa anɛ afosi ana ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kenan lasiɛ nkpa alɛɛ alafa anaasĩ alɛɛ lefosi fiɛ aakpi.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Obe wɔ di Mahalalel lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi akuɔ alɛɛ anɔɔ, ni aalofo Yared nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Obe wɔ aalofo Yared aaloo nii, Mahalalel lafũ alɛɛ alafa anɛ afosi atiɛ, ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalalel lasiɛ nkpa alɛɛ alafa anɛ afosi anaasĩ alɛɛ anɔɔ fiɛ aakpi.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Obe wɔ di Yared lafũ ni alɛɛ kɔlafa afosi akuɔ alɛɛ anyɔ yi, ni aalofo Enok nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Obe wɔ aalofo Enok aaloo nii, Yared lafũ alɛɛ alafa anɛ, ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yared lasiɛ nkpa alɛɛ alafa anaasĩ afosi akuɔ alɛɛ anyɔ fiɛ aakpi.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Obe wɔ di Enok lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi akuɔ alɛɛ anɔɔ yi, ni aalofo Metusela nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Obe wɔ aalofo Metusela aaloo nii, Enok lasũmu Yaa osie kanya alɛɛ alafa atiɛ, ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Enok lafũ alɛɛ alafa atiɛ afosi akuɔ alɛɛ anɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Mmle okle di Enok lasũmu ni Yaa oso, aayɛ, diekye Yaa lakpaa nwɔ aasifiko.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Obe wɔ di Metusela lafũ ni alɛɛ kɔlafa afosi anɛ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ yi, ni aalofo Lamek nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Obe wɔ aalofo Lamek aaloo nii, Metusela lafũ alɛɛ alafa akuɛnsĩ afosi anɛ alɛɛ anyɔ, ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Di nkpa nɔɔ mmuu osiɛ kamɛ, Metusela lasiɛ nkpa alɛɛ alafa anaasĩ afosi akuɔ alɛɛ anaasĩ fiɛ aakpi.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Obe wɔ di Lamek lafũ ni alɛɛ kɔlafa afosi anɛ alɛɛ anyɔ yi, ni aalofo obisuɔtɔbi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Ni aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Noa nɛ. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obi wɔ mmle makpee wo kɔnɛɛ kaafutu di ɔkpɛ ku dibuo le buɔnya ni kaasɔ ka mmle di Saate lɛkpaani nii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Aalofo Noa aaloo nii, Lamek lafũ alɛɛ alafa anɔɔ afosi anaasĩ alɛɛ anɔɔ ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Di nkpa nɔɔ mmuu osiɛ kamɛ, Lamek lasiɛ nkpa alɛɛ alafa akuɛnsĩ afosi akuɛnsĩ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ fiɛ aakpi. <verse eid="GEN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Obe wɔ di Noa lafũ ni alɛɛ alafa anɔɔ sɛmaa, ni aalofo Sem, Ham ku Yafet nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Batii Sikpile Ɔbla Kaayi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Obe wɔ baatii lakyako ni ɔpɔ kaayi ka mmle kamɛ baalofo basankobi baata ma nii, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />ni di Yaa babisuɔtɔbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anwuna awo aale aate fɛ Yaa babisuɔtɔbi</char></note> bawo lanya mmle okle di batii babisankobi nwu nkpo n-lɛ sekpeele, ni baayɔ mba ninlɛ ma. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Ni di Saate labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ninwuna nii dilɔbasinsiɛ di otii kamɛ dinaa ni kaloo, diekye suoto sina ninkpe nwɔ, alɛɛ nɔɔ ninkpa kamɛ male kɔlafa afosi anyɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Batii ba niayefe ni kasɔ baakyokyodikyo ni lawɛ kaayi di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ ku nni sɛmaa. Di obe wɔ di Yaa babisuɔtɔbi layɔ ni batii babisankobi nwu nkpo baalofo babi baata ma ni oso, mma niale saa basientɛ nwu ku mba niafũ ni leyooto nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Obe wɔ di Saate lanya mmle okle di otii disi osie ntɔɔpɔ ni kaayi ka mmle kamɛ ku mmle okle di otu nɔɔ dibiesaa nimuu nle ni dikpile lete obe lele yi, <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />diabuo Saate suoto alɛ aabla otii akpee kaayi ka mmle kamɛ, nioso aatoonu dibuo di otu nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Nioso Saate labuɛ alɛ &lt;&lt;Kamawɔɔsa otii wɔ lɛbla ni ndiki kaayi ka mmle kamɛ, otii ku babɔkɛɛ ku asaa ya ninkyɛ ni kaasɔ ka mmle suoto ku bakansiɛ ba ninflɛlɛtɛ nii, diekye diebuo mi suoto alɛ lɛbla ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Kafɔɔ Noa labuo Saate anu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Noa Suoto Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Nnya Noa banantii ɔlaa ninle nwɔ mmle nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 6:9">Noa lale otii tinini, lɛpɔɔ olo kuninwii ditatika nwɔ di suoto di batii ba kamɛ aasiɛ ni di obe nwu kamɛ. Aasumu Yaa. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Noa lalofo babi batiɛ. Sem, Ham ku Yafet.<verse eid="GEN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Kayi nfɛ labalalaa di Yaa anu, kaayii pɔ ku amumu ɔbla. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Yaa lanya mmle okle di kayi ntɔɔlalaa kate nii, diekye batii bamuu kaayi ntɔɔlalaasa lɛkyɛmbi lɛma. <verse eid="GEN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Nioso Yaa latɔkɔ Noa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kamawɔɔsa batii ba mmle bamuu, diekye kasɔ kamuu ntooyii pɔ ku amumu lɛma ɔbla. Nioso mawɔɔsa ma ku kasɔ nwu. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Nioso yɔ sewoso siene fawola lɛlakaa fata suoto faasɛ kamɛ ku ayo, faayɔ kɔmaa fatĩi kamɛ ku kayi. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Nnya mmle okle faawola nini. Lɛlakaa nwu lɛkaana dibla nkpaa alafa ana afosi anɔɔ. Lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ dibla nkpaa afosi akuɛnsĩ nkpaa nnɔɔ, lɛɛtaka kafɔɔ dibla nkpaa afosi ana nkpaa nnɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Faaba ni, faadiki obo kɔkpaa kunwii ku ɔfã di osi. Faadiki kayoko di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo ɔlɔɔkɔ, faabla ni sitika sitiɛ, kalɔ, ntɛɛ ku osi. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Diekye kamata ntu n-yii kasɔ ka mmle suoto ninlalaasa lɛsaa biala ninkpe nkpa koolo ko mmle kalɔ. Lɛsaa biala kaasɔ ka mmle makpi. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Kamanii kanya ku afɔ, fababuo di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo kamɛ, minko babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ ku ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ ku babisɔfɔ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Kpaa babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni nkpa bamuu banyɔ banyɔ ɔsanko ku osuɔtɔ fakpee di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo kamɛ alɛ baawɛ nkpa ku afɔ. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Bakansiɛ biala ku atembi lɛma, babɔkɛɛ biala ku atembi lɛma ku asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa ankpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto ku atembi lɛma banyɔ banyɔ fawako ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ alɛ baawɛ nkpa. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Afɔ yi, siisa alesaa biala manle ni fakpee kaamɛ alɛ aale afɔ ku mma alesaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nioso Noa labla lɛsaa biala fɛ mmle okle di Yaa latɔkɔ nwɔ nii.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yaa Lata Ntu Layii kasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Ninfɛ di Saate latɔkɔ Noa alɛ &lt;&lt;Buo di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo kamɛ, afɔ ku leyo lɛfɔ batii bamuu, diekye lete lɛfɔ lɛnya nlɛ fale otii tinini di akyɛnfɔɔle lee ya mmle kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Kpaa babɔkɛɛ ba nieklekle ni biala ɔsa ku ɔsɔfɔ akyuu akuɛnsĩ, ku mba ninanklekle ni biala ɔsa ku ɔsɔfɔ akyuu anyɔ. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Bakansiɛ biala kafɔɔ, kpaa ma ɔsa ku ɔsɔfɔ akyuu akuɛnsĩ, alɛ obiala lɛma ku atembi lɛma kawɛ nkpa kaasɔ ka mmle suoto. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Diekye diɛyɔ ni di miɛ diesifi ni dii kuɛnsinle, mata kanto nnɔɔ kaasɔ suoto ayi afosi ana nkyɛ afosi ana, nwɔɔsa lɛsaa biala ninkpe ni nkpa lɛbla ni kaasɔ ka mmle suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nioso Noa labla lɛsaa biala di Saate latɔkɔ nwɔ nii.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Obe wɔ di kanto lanɔɔ aayii ni kasɔ yi, Noa ntoofũ alɛɛ alafa akuɔ. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Di kanto kamanɔɔ an-yii ni kasɔ ka mmle oso, Noa ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ku ɔsɔfɔ ku babisɔfɔ nɔɔ labuo di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Babɔkɛɛ ba nieklekle ni ku mba ninanklekle ni akyuu anyɔ, bakansiɛ ku asaa ya amuu ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />basuɔtɔ ku basanko lawa Noa nfũ, baabuo di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo kamɛ fɛ mmle okle di Yaa latɔkɔ ni Noa. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Di ayi akuɛnsĩ sɛmaa ntu oyii nwu lawa kaasɔ ka mmle suoto.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Di Noa nkpa kamɛ, lɛlɛɛ le aafũ ni alɛɛ alafa akuɔ di lefosi dii kuɛnsinle di kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ, dii nwu nkpo ni di kasɔ kamɛ ntu mmuu lataa, ni di osi ntu n-yoko lasɛkɛtɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Ni di kanto lanɔɔ aakpete di kasɔ suoto ayi afosi ana ku nkyɛ afosi ana nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Dii nwu nkpo kale ni di Noa ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ, Sem, Ham ku Yafet diɛkyakaa ni di ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ batiɛ nwu basɔfɔ labuo di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Manko lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ ku atembi lɛma ku babɔkɛɛ sele bamuu ku atembi lɛma ku asaa ya ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ ku atembi lɛnya ku bakansiɛ bamuu ku atembi lɛma ku lɛsaa biala le ninkpe ni afoko. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Kabɔkɔbii biala ninwuna nsi ka ni ku letembi nɔɔ akyuu anyɔ lɛma labuo di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ ku Noa. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Babɔkɛɛ ba niabuo ni di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ lale osuɔtɔ ku ɔsanko ku lɛsaa biala ninkpe ni nkpa, fɛ mmle di Yaa latɔkɔ ni Noa. Ni di Saate lasɛɛ nwɔ aakpee kaamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Ntu latooyii kasɔ suoto ayi afosi ana, di ntu nwu latɔɔpɔ nii, diakɛnkɛ lɛlakaa nwu nkpo diatika di ntu nwu osi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Di ntu nwu latooyii diatɔɔpɔ ni kaasɔ suoto, ni di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo latika di ntu nwu osi diatookyi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Ntu nwu latɛ diayii kasɔ nwaa, diatĩi abokote takale amuu di kolo kalɔ. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Ntu nwu layii diatĩi abokote nsintɛɛ diakyofo dialenkee nkpaa afosi anyɔ. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Lɛsaa biala niawɛ ni nkpa kaasɔ suoto, bakansiɛ, babɔkɛɛ sele, lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ, asaa ya amuu ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto ku batii bamuu lawɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Lɛsaa biala ninnwuna di anwufie kamɛ di nkpa lasiɛ nini di kasɔ kosole suoto lakpi. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Baawɔɔsa lɛsaa biala niawɛ ni nkpa kaasɔ suoto. Batii ku babɔkɛɛ ku asaa ya ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto ku bakansiɛ, baawɔɔsa ma kaasɔ suoto. Noa ku batii ba niasiɛ ni di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ lete niabu.<verse eid="GEN 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Ntu layii kasɔ suoto ayi kɔlafa afosi anɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ntu Oyii Nwu Lasɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Kafɔɔ Yaa lanya Noa ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu ku babɔkɛɛ sele ba niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ nyaami, ni aata kɔfɛɛfɔ lafɛ kaasɔ suoto ni di ntu lakyako ɔsɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Ni di kasɔ kamɛ ntu ku osi n-yoko ntu lasɛɛ nɛ, ni di kanto ladiɛ ɔnɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />Ntu nwu lakyako ɔsɔɔ kaasɔ suoto buɛbuɛ, di ayi kɔlafa afosi-anɔɔ sɛmaa ntu nwu lasɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Di kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle lefosi dii kuɛnsinle kamɛ, ni di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo lalatika di Ararat kobokote suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Ntu nwu nkpo lakple diatɔɔsɔɔ osie kanya dialaadu kɔwɛntɛ fosile kamɛ, di kɔwɛntɛ fosile nwu dii kasale kamɛ kobokote nwu nkpo osi lakyɔɔ klekle.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Di ayi afosi ana sɛmaa Noa lasɛkɛtɛ sɛfele wɔ aadiki ni di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo suoto. <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />Ni aadiki kwakwalobi onwii aasifi kayi nɛ, ni aatɔɔflɛlɛtɛ aatoofe katoo ku kala dialaase di obe wɔ di ntu nwu nkpo laloo ni ɔsɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Ninfɛ aadiki ablonuma aasifi kayi alɛ oonyu nse ntu nwu ntɔɔsɔɔ di kasɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Kafɔɔ ablonuma nwu nkpo ditawɛ lɛba aasoo, diekye ntu late di kasɔ kamuu suoto, nioso aakple aasifi lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ di Noa nfũ. Ni aakyɔɔ kɔnɛɛ aakpaa nya aakpee di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Aasoko ayi akuɛnsĩ sɛmaa ni aakple aadiki ablonuma nwu di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Obe wɔ di ablonuma nwu lakple aawa ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ku kɔtɔɔfɔ yi, aatũ nnɔnyi kowoso lɛfata kɔɔnle di kanya! Ninfɛ di Noa latofo alɛ ntu nwu ntɔɔsɔɔ kaasɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Ninfɛ aakple aasoko ayi akuɛnsĩ kafɔɔ nɛ, ni aakple aadiki ablonuma nwu nɛ, kafɔɔ atasinkple aawa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Dii le di Noa lafũ ni alɛɛ alafa akuɔ lɛlɛɛ ninwii di kɔwɛntɛ kasale dii kasale yi, ni di ntu nwu lasɔɔ dialoo kaasɔ suoto nɛ. Ninfɛ di Noa latikiti lɛlakaa nwu nkpo nsintɛɛ aanyu, ni aanya alɛ kasɔ ntookoso nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Di ayi afosi anyɔ dii kuɛnsĩnle di kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ ni di ntu nwu laloo ɔsɔɔ kaasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Ninfɛ di Yaa latɔkɔ Noa alɛ, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />&lt;&lt;Die di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ, afɔ ku ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ ku basɔfɔ lɛma. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Faadiki lɛsaa biala le ninkpe ni nkpa di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ. Bakansiɛ, babɔkɛɛ ku asaa ya amuu ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto alɛ baalofo mankpɛ man-yii kasɔ suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Nioso Noa ladie ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ku ɔsɔfɔ ku babisɔfɔ nɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Babɔkɛɛ bamuu ku asaa ya ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto ku bakansiɛ bamuu ku lɛsaa biala ninkyɛ ni kaasɔ suoto ladie di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo kamɛ, akudi akudi ku atembi lɛma.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Ninfɛ di Noa lapɛ oleɔta akyikye aata Saate nɛ. Ninfɛ aayɔ babɔkɛɛ ba nieklekle ni bamuu bawo ku bakansiɛ ba nieklekle nii, ni aayɔ aata ɔfiɛ asaaɔta aata Saate ole di ninya suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Di Saate lanu ni ɔkɔnɔ biene nwu nkpo yi, ni aabuɛ di otu nɔɔ kamɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Diidii namasinkpaani kasɔ ka mmle ta otii oso, kuntɛ otii otu kamɛ dibiesaa nle dikpile diɛyɔ ni bia sibisɔ nɔɔ yi, diidii namasinwɔɔsa asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa amuu fɛ mmle okle labla nii.<verse eid="GEN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />&lt;&lt;Diɛyɔ ni di obe wɔ kaasɔ mate nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">asaa ɔpɛbee ku ofiɛlɛbee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">lɛwɔɔfɔ ku difila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">kɔkyɛɛ ku kabiene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">kakũ ku kakyɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">dilɔbaloo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lanii Kanya Ku Noa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Ninfɛ di Yaa lawii Noa ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ lɛyɔɔ, ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bilaalofo biɛkpɛ biyii kasɔ ka mmle suoto. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Lɛta babɔkɛɛ bamuu kaayi ku bakansiɛ bamuu ku lɛsaa biala ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ suoto ku kɔkpaku di lekpo kamɛ nlɛ babayɛkɛ ye. Nioso lɛyɔ ma lekpee ye ninnɛɛ. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Lɛsaa biala ninkpe nkpa ninkyɛ ni, lɛyɔ nya amuu lɛta ye nlɛ aale ye alesaa. Fɛ mmle okle layɔ sɛfa kɔɔnle lata ye nii, nunua ntɔɔyɔ lɛsaa biala lɛta ye.<verse eid="GEN 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />&lt;&lt;Kafɔɔ bitanle sina se di ntɔ nɔɔ nsi ni kaamɛ, diekye mmi kamɛ di nkpa nɔɔ nsi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Otii lele niediki owo nɔɔ nkpa, kamakaalɛ kanya didiki di otii nwu nkpo nfũ. Bɔkɛɛ lele nielo otii, kamakaalɛ kanya didiki nkyeko ɔkyɛ nɔɔ. Kamakaalɛ kanya didiki kafɔɔ nkyeko otii lele nielo owo nɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />&lt;&lt;Otii lele niewii owo nɔɔ ntɔ kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:6">otii kafɔɔ mawii nwɔ ntɔ kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:6">diekye, Yaa letembi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:6">di Yaa labla otii.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Aye yi, bilofo biɛkpɛ kaasɔ ka mmle suoto, bikpɛnsa kaasɔ ka mmle suoto bieyii ka pɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Ninfɛ di Yaa latɔkɔ Noa ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nwu alɛ, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />&lt;&lt;Lenii kanya ku aye ku banantii lee ba nimawa ni sɛɛmaa lee <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />ku lɛsaa biala niawɛ ni nkpa di ɔkyɛ lee, bakansiɛ ku babɔkɛɛ sele ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu ku mba bamuu niadie ni di lɛlakaa nwu nkpo kamɛ ku aye, ku lɛsaa biala ninkpe ni nkpa kaasɔ suoto. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Lenii kanya ku aye nlɛ, diidii namasinwɔɔsa asaa ya amuu ninkpe ni nkpa ku ntu oyii. Diidii ntu dilasin-yii kasɔ dilalaasa asaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Ni di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnya nle mmle ninle dituosaa le nimate ni di kanya ka konii ni munkofɔ ntɛɛ ku lɛsaa biala ninkpe ni nkpa ku banantii lɛfɔ bamuu ba nimawa ni. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Ntɔɔta kolosansa nii lɛtaa koolo, nni nimale dituosaa le nimasiɛ ni munko kasɔ ntɛɛ di kanya ka lenii ni nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Nse diɛwa alɛ kosiisa alokonkyɛ koolo di kolosansa lɛtaa yi, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />ni kamanyuma kanya ninii le ninsi ni munkoye ntɛɛ ku asaa amuu ninkpe ni nkpa ku atembi lɛnya. Diidii kafɔɔ ntu dilɔbasin-yii dilalaasa asaa ya amuu ninkpe ni nkpa. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Obe lele di kolosansa lɛtaa di alokonkyɛ suoto yi, kamanya kũ nnyuma kanya ninii le ninaa ni kaloo ninsi ni di Yaa ku asaa ya amuu ninkpe ni nkpa ntɛɛ ku atembi lɛnya kaasɔ suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Ninfɛ di Yaa latɔkɔ Noa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nle mmle ninle dituosaa le kanya ka lenii ni di ami ku asaa ya amuu ninkpe ni nkpa ntɛɛ kaasɔ nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Noa Banantii Lasamii Baabuo Kaayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Noa babisuɔtɔbi ba niadie ni di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ niale Sem, Ham ku Yafet, (Ham nialofo Kanaan.) <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Mma mmle niale Noa babisuɔtɔbi batiɛ nwu nɛ. Mma kamɛ di batii ladie basamii baabuo kaasɔ suoto nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Noa lakye kasɔ aatɔɔkpɛ kofe, ni aakpɛ awosobi ya mambla ni nta kofe nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Obe wɔ aanyi ni awosobi nwu nta nwo, aasiɛ, ni aate lɛkyɔtɔ di lɛkpaayo nɔɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Ham wɔ nialofo ni Kanaan, lakyɛ aalaanya ote lɛkyɔtɔ, ni aakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi banyɔ bule kaayi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Kafɔɔ Sem ku Yafet baayɔ dibula baatika di amuusi lɛma baakyɛ sɛmaa, sɛmaa baayɔ baalaatĩi ote lɛma lɛkyɔtɔ. Baamunikĩisa anu baakpee di ɔlɔɔkɔ alɛ balaanya ote lɛma lɛkyɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Obe wɔ diakpa ni Noa di lɛtasiɛ nɔɔ nwu kamɛ, aanu ni lɛsaa le di obi bisɔnle nɔɔ labla nii, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />ni aabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">&lt;&lt;Bɛɛkpaani Kanaan!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">Abale ɔlanle yɛntɛle niɛwa ni kasɔ alenke ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">anta babilɛma suɔtɔbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Aakple aabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">&lt;&lt;Baatansa Saate wɔ ninle ni Sem Yaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaan ale Sem ɔlanle.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Yaa ata Yafet kasɔ kamuɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Yafet asiɛ di Sem akpaayo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">di Kanaan ale nwɔ ɔlanle.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Di ntu layii kasɔ dialoo nii, Noa lakple aafũ alɛɛ alafa atiɛ afosi anɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Noa lafũ alɛɛ alafa anaasĩ afosi anɔɔ fiɛ nfɛ aakpi.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Noa Babisuɔtɔbi Banantii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Nle mmle ninle Noa babisuɔtɔbi suoto ɔlaa nɛ, Sem, Ham ku Yafet. Baalofo babisuɔtɔbi baata ma di ntu layii kasɔ dialoo ni sɛmaa.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yafet Banantii.</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Yafet babisuɔtɔbi ninle</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:2">Gomer, Magog, Madai, Yawan, Tubal, Mesek ku Tiras.<verse eid="GEN 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Gomer babisuɔtɔbi ninle:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:3">Askenas, Rifat ku Togama.<verse eid="GEN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Yawan babisuɔtɔbi ninle:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:4">Elisa, Tarsis, Kitim batii ku Dodanim batii <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />(Batii ba mmle kamɛ di nnle be ninsiɛ ni di lekpo kotoko ladie baakye nɛ, ku nfaabi lɛma ku sele ate ate nɛ.)<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ham Banantii</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Ham babisuɔtɔbi ninle:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:6">Kus, Misraim, Put ku Kanaan.<verse eid="GEN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Kus babisuɔtɔbi ninle:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:7">Seba, Hawila, Sabta, Raama ku Sabteka.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 10:7">Raama babisuɔtɔbi ninle:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:7">Seba ku Dedan.<verse eid="GEN 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kus lalofo Nimrod wɔ niataka aabale ni kpɛtɛ siene kaasɔ ka mmle suoto. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Aabale kpantɛ sientɛ di Saate anu. Nkpo oso mambuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpantɛ sientɛ di Saate anu fɛ Nimrod okle nɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Sɛka nɔɔ ole kasɔ kakyekɔ niale Babel, Erek, Akad ku Kalne di Sinar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinar ninle Babel kasɔ nɛ</char></note> kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Aadie kaasɔ nwu suoto aasifi Asiria, nfa aalaabudi sekpoo se mmle nɛ. Niniwe, Rehobot-Ir, ku Kala <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />ku Resen wɔ ninte ni di Niniwe ku Kala obo ninle ni okpoo kplɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misraim lalofo</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:13">Ludi batii, Anami batii, Lehabi batii ku Naftuhi batii, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Patrusi batii, Kasluhi batii, mma kamɛ di Filisti batii ladie nii ku Kaftorit batii.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanaan lalofo</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:15">obi nɔɔ kasale Sidon ku Het, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />ku Yebusi batii, Amori batii, ku Girgasi batii, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />ku Hiwi batii, Arki batii, Sini batii, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />ku Arwadi batii, Semari batii ku Hama batii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:18">Nni sɛmaa, Kanaan batii kafaabi labakpɛ. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Kanaan batii kɔmɛ layɔ di Sidon dialaafe di Gerar ku Gasa, diasifi dialaafe di Sodom ku Gomora, Adma ku Seboim, diasifi dialaadu Lasa.<verse eid="GEN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Nnya mma mmle ninle Ham babisuɔtɔbi di nfaabi lɛma kanya ku sele, di nsɔ ku nnle lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Sem Banantii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Baalofo babisuɔtɔbi kafɔɔ baata Sem, nnwɔ niale ni Eber babi bamuu ɔwa ku Yafet obilɛma nɔɔfole.<verse eid="GEN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Sem babisuɔtɔbi ninle:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:22">Elam, Asur, Arfasad, Lud ku Aram.<verse eid="GEN 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Aram babisuɔtɔbi ninle</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:23">Us, Hul, Geter ku Mas<verse eid="GEN 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arfasad lalofo Sela,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:24">ni di Sela kolofo Eber nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Babisuɔtɔbi banyɔ baalofo baata Eber:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:25">Ɔkasale leyooto niale Peleg, diekye di obe nɔɔ kamɛ baasɛ nsɔ nɛ. Obilɛma leyooto ninle Yoktan nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yoktan lalofo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:26">Almodad, Selef, Hasarmawet, Yera, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoram, Usal, Dikla, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obal, Abimael, Seba <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofir, Hawila ku Yobab. Mma mmle bamuu niale Yoktan babisuɔtɔbi nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Kasiɛkɔ lɛma ladie bia Mesa dialaase di Sefar abokote di kufĩ katunkɔ.<verse eid="GEN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Nnya mma mmle ninle Sem babisuɔtɔbi di nfaabi lɛma kanya ku sele, di nsɔ ku nnle lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Nnya mma mmle ninle Noa babisuɔtɔbi, di nfaabi lɛma di banantii lɛma kanya, di nnle lɛma kamɛ nɛ. Di mma mmle kamɛ di nnle ladie diasamii kaasɔ suoto di ntu oyii sɛmaa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Leyo Takale Otofo Di Babel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Di obe owo nintɔbafe ni kamɛ; batii bamuu kaasɔ latobuɛ sele sinwii ku lɛkakatɛbi ninwii. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Diabawa alɛ baakyako ɔkyɛ ofe kufĩ katunkɔ, ni baalaanya kasɔ lakataa kosole kanwii di Sinar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinar ninle Babel kasɔ nɛ</char></note> kasɔ suoto, ni basiɛ ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Ni baatɔkɔ bawo alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bita bubudi atenkudi, buofiɛ nya aawɛ osie.&gt;&gt; Ni baayɔ atenkudi, nse baayɔ ni afuɔ, ni baayɔ kɔmaa, nse baayɔ ni kɔtɛ nwɔtɔle nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Ni baabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Biwa, biɛta bubudi okpoo buta suoto. Buotofo leyo takale diɛlaasũ koolo buofũ leyooto, munasamii ni kafɔɔ di kasɔ kamuu suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Nioso Saate nwu lasoo aawa kasɔ aabanyu okpoo wɔ ku leyo takale nwu baatii kotofo nii. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Ni di Saate labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyu, batii ba mmle lɛbla onwii, bamuu lɛma boobuɛ sele sinwii kafɔɔ. Ni batookye kasɔ bɔɔbla nle mmle nɛ. Nioso lɛsalɛsaa kuniwii nnaa babatɔkɔ alɛ bɔɔbla ni, manamafuo ni ɔbla. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Bita busoo bukyɛ nfa, buɔlaakpɔkpɔtɔsa ma sele alɛ kuonwii dilaasinnu owo nɔɔ kasɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Nioso Saate lasamiisa ma ninfa aakpete di kasɔ kamuu suoto, ni baadiɛ okpoo nwu obudi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Nkpo oso manlɛɛ nfa alɛ Babel, diekye nfa di Saate lakpɔkpɔtɔsa sele di kayi kamuu nɛ. Nfa nfɛ di Saate lasamiisa ma aakpete kaasɔ kamuu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diɛyɔ Ni Di Sem Banantii Diɛlaase Ni Di Abram.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Nnya mma mmle ninle Sem banantii nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 11:10">Alɛɛ anyɔ sɛmaa di ntu layii ni kayi, Sem lafũ alɛɛ kɔlafa ni aalofo Arfasad nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Aalofo Afasad aaloo nii, Sem lafũ alɛɛ alafa anɔɔ ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Obe wɔ di Arfasad lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi atiɛ alɛɛ anɔɔ yi, ni aalofo Sela nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Aalofo Sela aaloo nii, Arfasad lafũ alɛɛ alafa ana alɛɛ atiɛ ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Obe wɔ di Sela lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi atiɛ yi, ni aalofo Eber nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Aalofo Eber aaloo nii, Sela lafũ alɛɛ alafa ana alɛɛ atiɛ ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Obe wɔ di Eber lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi atiɛ alɛɛ ana yi, ni aalofo Peleg nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Aalofo Peleg aaloo nii, Eber lafũ alɛɛ alafa ana afosi atiɛ ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Obe wɔ di Peleg lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi atiɛ yi, ni aalofo Reu nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Aalofo Reu aaloo nii, Peleg lafũ alɛɛ alafa anyɔ alɛɛ anaasĩ ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Obe wɔ di Reu lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi atiɛ alɛɛ anyɔ yi, ni aalofo Serug nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Aalofo Serug aaloo nii, Serug lafũ alɛɛ alafa anyɔ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Obe wɔ di Serug lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi atiɛ yi, ni aalofo Nahor nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Aalofo Nahor aaloo nii, Serug lafũ alɛɛ alafa anyɔ ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Obe wɔ di Nahor lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi anyɔ alɛɛ anaasĩ yi, ni aalofo Tera nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Aalofo Tera aaloo nii, Nahor lafũ alɛɛ kɔlafa lefosi alɛɛ anaasĩ ni aakple aalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi bamba nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Obe wɔ di Tera lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi akuɛnsĩ yi, ni aakple aalofo Abram, Nahor ku Haran nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tera Banantii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Nnya mma mmle ninle Tera banantii nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 11:27">Tera lalofo Abram, Nahor ku Haran. Ni di Haran lalofo Lot nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Haran lakasa ote Tera okpi di Ur okpoo di nfũ baalofo nwɔ nii, di Kyadea kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Kafɔɔ Abram ku Nahor mma baayɔ basanko. Abram ɔsɔfɔ leyooto niale Sarai nɛ. Nahor kafɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ leyooto niale Milka, Haran obisankobi aale. Milka ku Iska, Haran nialofo ma. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Sarai ɔlɛma aale, obi ditawɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Ninfɛ di Tera lakpaa obi nɔɔ Abram ku ɔwa nɔɔ Lot ninle ni Haran obisuɔtɔbi ku obi sɔfɔ nɔɔ Sarai, ninle ni obi nɔɔ Abram ɔsɔfɔ baadie di Ur di Kyadea kasɔ suoto alɛ boosifi Kanaan kasɔ suoto nɛ. Kafɔɔ baadu ni Haran okpoo, baasiɛ ninfa.<verse eid="GEN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tera lafũ alɛɛ alafa anyɔ alɛɛ anɔɔ, ninfɛ aakpi di Haran okpoo nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lalɛɛ Abram.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Ni di Saate latɔkɔ Abram alɛ, &lt;&lt;Die di kale lɛfɔ ku batii lɛfɔ ku teefɔ leyo, faatɔɔkyɛ kasɔ ka matuofɔ ni suoto.<verse eid="GEN 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />&lt;&lt;Kamabla fɔ kale kplɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">kamawii fɔ lɛyɔɔ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:2">Mata leyooto lɛfɔ ntaka katoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">fankple lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Mba niewii fɔ ni lɛyɔɔ, kamawii ma lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">olele kafɔɔ niɛkpaani fɔ, kamakpaani nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:3">afɔ suoto babafe kafɔɔ manwii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">kayi batii bamuu lɛyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Nioso Abram ladie fɛ mmle di Saate latɔkɔ nwɔ nii; Lot kafɔɔ latikanko nwɔ. Obe wɔ di Abram ladie ni di Haran aasifi nii, atoofũ alɛɛ afosi-akuɛnsĩ alɛɛ anɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Aakpaa ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Sarai ku maatɛ nɔɔ obi Lot ku asaawɛ lɛma amuu ku batii ba baawɛ ni di Haran, ni baadie alɛ boosifi Kanaan kasɔ suoto, ni baalaabuo Kanaan kasɔ suoto nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abram lakyi kasɔ nwu nkpo suoto aalaadu Morek kowoso kplɛ ɔlɔɔkɔ di Sikem. Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ Kanaan batii lawɛ kaasɔ nwu nkpo suoto. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Ninfɛ di Saate ladiki suoto aatuo Abram ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Mayɔ kasɔ ka mmle nta banantii lɛfɔ.&gt;&gt; Nioso aapɛ oleɔta akyikye ninfa aata Saate wɔ niadiki suoto aatuo nwɔ nii.<verse eid="GEN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Aadie ninfa aasifi kabokotee osi di Betel kufĩ katunkɔ aalaapɛ lɛkpaayo ninfa, Betel lawɛ di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ, Ai lawɛ di kufĩ katunkɔ. Ni aapɛ oleɔta akyikye ninfa aata Saate nɛ, ni aalɛɛ Saate leyooto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Nkpo oso Abram ladie aatoofe nkpaalɔ kasɔ.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abram Lakyɛ Egipte.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Kɔka latɔɔkpɛ di kasɔ nwu nkpo suoto, ni di Abram lasifi Egipte alɛ ɔɔlaasiɛ ninfa kɛɛkɛ nɛ. Diekye kɔka nwu lawɛ osie. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Ditoobu kɛɛkɛ ababuo ni Egipte ni aatɔkɔ ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Sarai alɛ, &lt;&lt;N-ye nlɛ fɛtɛ fale ɔsanko wɔ ninlɛ ni sekpeele. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Nse Egipte batii lɛnya fɔ, bababuɛ alɛ, &lt;Nnya ɔsɔfɔ nɛ.&gt; Babalo mi, mandiɛ fɔ fansiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Nioso buɛ falɛ obiloo sankobi fale, ni babalolaa mi manklee ta afɔ oso, mantɛɛ kafɔɔ nsiɛ nkpa ta afɔ oso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Obe wɔ di Abram labuo ni Egipte, Egipte batii lanya alɛ ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ nle ɔsanko wɔ niɛtɛ alɛ ni sekpeele. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Obe wɔ di Farao banɔɔfotii lanyɔɔ nii, baatansa nwɔ baata Farao, ni baakpaa ɔsanko nwu baasifiko Farao leyo nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Nioso baalolaa Abram baaklee ta ɔsanko nwu nkpo oso, aatɔɔ bafoso kpinwu ku banankyue ku babɔkɛɛ ba mantuka ni atoo, basanko ku basuɔtɔ ku balanle-suɔtɔ ku basanko ku kapu bapɔnkɔ.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Kafɔɔ Saate lata sifiɛ kpile lapɛ Farao ku leyo nɔɔ batii ta Abram ɔsɔfɔ Sarai oso. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Nioso Farao lata baalɛɛ Abram baatɔɔ. Ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lɛ oso fɛɛbla mi nkpo? Be oso fatatɔkɔ mi falɛ ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ ale? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Be oso faabuɛ falɛ, &lt;Obiloo sankobi ale,&gt; fɛɛtɛɛ lɛkpaa nwɔ fɛ ɔsɔfɔ nii? Yioo! Nnya ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ. Kpaa nwɔ biɛtɔɔkyɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Nioso Farao ladiki batii aata alɛ bakpaa Abram ku ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ ku asaa ya amuu niawɛ nwɔ ni baalaatɛ nwɔ osuku aasifi.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abram Ku Lot Labla Baawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Nioso Abram ku ɔsɔfɔ ladie di Egipte ku lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ nimuu, Lot kafɔɔ latikanko ma baasifi Kanaan nkpaalɔ kasɔ. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Abram labakple saawɛntɛ kplɛ. Aawɛ babɔkɛɛ sele ku koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle.<verse eid="GEN 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Diadie ni di nkpaalɔ kasɔ nwu aakyi aalaadu Betel, di lɛba le ninsi ni di Betel ku Ai obo nfũ aapɛ ni lɛkpaayo nɔɔ kasale <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />ku lɛba le aapɛ ni oleɔta akyikye kasale. Nfa di Abram lasumu Saate nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Lot wɔ niatɔɔkyɛ ni ku Abram, kafɔɔ lawɛ bafoso, banankyue ku akpaayo. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Nioso kasɔ nwu nkpo ditapɔ kaata banyɔ lɛma alɛ baasiɛ mankaako bawo, diekye lɛsaawɛ lɛma lapɔ kpinwu alɛ batafuo osiɛ ɔkaako bawo. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Nioso kalɔ labuo di Abram babɔkɛɛbakpatɛ ku Lot babɔkɛɛbakpatɛ ntɛɛ. Kanaan batii ku Perisi batii kafɔɔ lasiɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto di obe nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Nioso Abram latɔkɔ Lot alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tanta kalɔ kukanwii lasiɛ di munko fɔ ntɛɛ, ee kaasiɛ di babɔkɛɛbakpatɛ lɛfɔ ku bale mi ntɛɛ, diekye banwii bule. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Sɛɛ diele kasɔ nwu kamuu ninte di anu lɛfɔ nɛ? Ta bubla baawo. Nse feediki ɔmɛntukyɛ yi, kamayɔ oletanɛɛkyɛ; nse feediki oletanɛɛkyɛ yi, kamayɔ ɔmɛntukyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Lot latakatɛsa anu aanyu kasɔ lakataa nwu di Yordan, koofe ni Soar, ntu lawɛ fɛ nka ninte ni di SAATE nwu kɔba fɛle Egipte kasɔ. (Diekye obe nwu SAATE nwu diiwɔɔsa Sodom ku Gomora). <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Nioso Lot ladiki kasɔ lakataa nwu kamuu ninte ni di Yordan, ni aadie aasifi nfa di kufĩ katunkɔ nɛ. Nkpo nfɛ di batii ba mmle banyɔ ntɛɛ lasɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abram lasiɛ di Kanaan kasɔ suoto, ni di Lot lasiɛ sekpoo se niawɛ ni di kasɔ lakataa ntɛɛ nwu aatɔɔpɛ akpaayo nɔɔ aakaakosa Sodom nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Sodom batii kafɔɔ lale batii kpile baatɔɔbla sikpile kpinwu di Saate suoto.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abram Ladie Aasifi Hebron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Obe wɔ di Lot ntɔɔbla ni di Abram suoto eeloo nii, ni di Saate latɔkɔ Abram alɛ, &lt;&lt;Takatɛsa anu ninfũ fayɛ ni faanyu katoo ku kala, kufĩ katunkɔ ku kamɛɛkɔ. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Kamayɔ kasɔ ka kamuu fɛɛnya ni nta fɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Kamata banantii lɛfɔ mpɔ fɛ kudu kaasɔ, alɛ nse otii owo lefuo kudu nwu ɔka yi, ni babafuo fɔ banantii kafɔɔ ɔka nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Taka, faalaakyɛ di kasɔ nwu nkpo kanɛ ku lɛblɛfɛ suoto, diekye afɔ kɔyɔ ka nta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Nioso Abram lakpa akpaayo nɔɔ, ni aasifi aalaasiɛ di Mamre awoso kplɛ ɔlɔɔkɔ di Hebron, ni aapɛ oleɔta akyikye ninfa aata Saate nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abram Lafũ Lot Nkpa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Obe onwii kamɛ diawa alɛ Amrafel Sinar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinar ninle Babel kasɔ nɛ</char></note> batii ɔka, Ariok Elasar batii ɔka, Kedorlaomer Elam batii ɔka ku Tideal Goim batii ɔka <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />lataka kakpɛ di Bera Sodom batii ɔka, Birsa Gomora batii ɔka, Sinab Adma batii ɔka, Semeber Seboim batii ɔka ku Bela (okpoo wɔ nfɛ bɔɔlɛɛ ni Soar) batii suoto. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Baka ba mmle bamuu lalaasi di Sidim ɔtaata nfa ninle (mba lekpo nɛ). <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Lefosi alɛɛ anyɔ amu baasiɛ di ɔka Kedorlaomer kalɔ, kafɔɔ di lefosi lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa kamɛ baataka baayila nwɔ di suoto.<verse eid="GEN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Di lefosi lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ yi, ɔka Kedorlaomer ku baka bamba ba niabla ni onwii lakyɛ baalalenkee Refait batii di Astero Karnaim, Susit batii di Ham, Emit batii di Sawe Kiriataim <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />ku Hori batii di kobokote okpoo di Seir dialaase bia El Paran diɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni ɔfaafuu. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Ninfɛ baamunikĩi basifi En Mispat (nfɛ bɔɔlɛɛ ni Kades), ni baalenkee ntɛɛ nwu sekpoo simuu ninle ni Amalek batii ku Amori batii ba niasiɛ ni di Hasason Tamar kafɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Ninfɛ di Sodom batii ɔka, Gomora batii ɔka, Adma batii ɔka, Seboim batii ɔka ku Bela batii ɔka (nfɛ bɔɔlɛɛ ni Soar) ladie baawa kakpɛkɔ di Sidim Ɔtaata nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />Baayila di Kedorlaomer Elam batii ɔka, Tidal Goim batii ɔka, Amrafel Sinar batii ɔka ku Ariok Elasar batii ɔka suoto, baka bana ba mmle latɔkpɛko baka banɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Di Sidim Ɔtaata nwu nkpo suoto yi, ama abiɔ kpinwu late. Nioso obe wɔ di Sodom ku Gomora baka latootoso ni yi, batii lɛma bawo lakpa baabuo kaamɛ, bayɛntɛle latoso baasifi kobokotee osi. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Baka bana nwu nkpo layɔ Sodom ku Gomora batii asaa amuu ku alesaa lɛma baasifiko. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Baamufũ Abram maatɛ nɔɔ obi Lot wɔ niasiɛ ni kafɔɔ di Sodom, baayɔ asaa nɔɔ amuu baasifiko.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Otii onwii niafe ni labatɔkɔ Abram, Hebri otii nwu ɔlaa wɔ mmle. Di obe nwu kamɛ Abram lasiɛ di Mamre wɔ niale ni Amori otii awoso kplɛ ɔlɔɔkɔ, aale ni Eskol ku Aner obilɛma, baabla kanya kanwii ku Abram. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Obe wɔ di Abram lanu alɛ beemufũ ni ɔnantii nɔɔ yi, ni aasiisa batii alafa atiɛ lefosi banɛ ba baalofo ni di leyo nɔɔ, aatuo ma ni kakpɛ ni aati ma aalaadu Dan okpoo nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Obe wɔ kaakyɛ lawo nii, Abram lasɛ batii nwu di akudi, baabuo ma di suoto, baati ma baakpɛ ma baalaadu Hoba di Damaskos osuku kaatoo. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Aafũ asaa ya amuu baayɔ nii, aakpaa ɔnantii nɔɔ Lot kafɔɔ ku asaa nɔɔ amuu, kuɛ basanko ku batii bule aawako.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Obe wɔ di Abram ntɔlaalenkee ni Kedorlaomer ku baka ba niabla ni onwii ku nnwɔɔ, ookple anwa ni leyo yi, Sodom ɔka lakyɛ aalaakyakako nwɔ di Sawe Ɔtaata(manlɛɛ ni Ɔka Ɔtaata).<verse eid="GEN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melkisedek Lawii Abram Lɛyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Ninfɛ di Melkisedek Salem ɔka layɔ bloblo ku nta aawako nwɔ nɛ. Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni oletatɛ aale. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Ni aawii Abram lɛyɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 14:19">&lt;&lt;Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni ɛɛbla ni osi ku kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:19">awii Abram lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Biwii Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:20">nnwɔ niɛyɔ balo lɛfɔ eekpee fɔ ni ninnɛɛ kamɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Ninfɛ di Abram layɔ asaa nwu amuu lefosile aatɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Ninfɛ di Sodom ɔka latɔkɔ Abram alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɔ batii nwu fatɛɛ, faata asaa nwu awɛ di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Kafɔɔ Abram latɔkɔ Sodom ɔka alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntookplesa nnɛɛ katoo lɛka ntam lɛta Saate, Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni ɛɛbla ni osi ku kasɔ <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />nlɛ, namafũ lɛsaa le ninle fɔ ni lele kuninwii nkyeko ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ, bia okũ ee katokota, fiɛ faababuɛ falɛ &lt;Ami niɛbla Abram saawɛntɛ.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Namafũ lɛsalɛsaa, diediki alesaa ya baatii nii lale ni ku basuɔtɔ ba niakyɛ ni kakpɛ ku ami, dile ni Aner, Eskol ku Mamre. Mma yi, yɔ kalekɔ lɛma fata ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Labuɛ Aatɛ Alɛ Abata Abram Obi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Di obe owo sɛmaa, Saate nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Abram di odiki otuo kamɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 15:1">&lt;&lt;Abram, tanyɛkɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">Ami ninle fɔ kubidifũnsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">letota lɛfɔ kamapɔ kpinwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Kafɔɔ Abram labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Oo! SAATE Kplɛ, be leetota nwu nkpo kamabla mi di obe wɔ nnaa ni obi? Otii wɔ nimale mi ni atesaa ninle Elieser, Damaskos otii nwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Ni di Abram labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Faatɛɛ obi kuonwii, kpɛmblatɛ nii leeyo nimale mi atesaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Ninfɛ di Saate latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle dilɔbale fɔ atesaa, kafɔɔ afɔ omu kafutu lɛfɔ kamɛ obi nimale fɔ atesaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Ni aakpaa nwɔ aasifiko kayi ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Takatɛsa anu faanyu osi, faaka awɛntrɛbi nse fabafuo ɔka. &lt;&lt;Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkpo di banantii lɛfɔ mapɔ nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Abram lafũ aanu, ni di Saate nwu lanya alɛ ale otii tinini nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Ni aakple aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle <char style="nd">Saate </char> wɔ niakpaa fɔ lakyeko ni Ur ku Kaldean, nlɛ kɔyɔ kasɔ ka mmle nta fɔ kanle fɔ atesaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Kafɔɔ Abram labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Oo Saate wɔ ninsiko ni suoto, be nimale dituosaa alɛ kabale mi atesaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Nioso Saate latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɔ nankyue sanko sɛɛle wɔ nintoofũ ni alɛɛ atiɛ, tie sanko wɔ nintoofũ ni alɛɛ atiɛ, dikũnumuu le nintoofũ ni alɛɛ atiɛ, ablonuma ku lɛlaapɔɔbi fawakoe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Abram layɔ asaa nwu amuu aawako nwɔ, aablasa ma di akyuu anyɔ, aayɔ kakyɛ biala aatɛ di kawo ɔlɔɔkɔ, kafɔɔ bakansiɛ nwu mma, atablasa ma di nkyɛ nnyɔ. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Ninfɛ di bakansiɛ ba ninkyɔkyɔfɛ ni sina labatoosoo di sina nwu suoto nɛ, kafɔɔ Abram latososa ma.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Obe wɔ nfɛ di kufĩ kofe ni kamɛɛkɔ, ni di Abram labuo di sɛkyɔsĩ, aakyɔsĩi aasifi kamɛ, ni di ditũnu kplɛ yɛkɛle latĩi nwɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Ninfɛ di Saate latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɔtafɔ fantofo nwaa nlɛ, banantii lɛfɔ male bafɔɔ di kasɔ ka ninanle ma ni kale suoto, bababla balanle mambla ma amumu alɛɛ alafa ana. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Kafɔɔ mananfi kale nwu nkpo batii babasumu ni fɛ balanle kootoko, ninni sɛmaa babadie ninfa ku lɛsaawɛ kplɛ. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Kafɔɔ afɔ yi, fabasifi waawa anɛ nfũ ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole, fababe, fankpasɔ, fiɛ fabakpi. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Di kɔna naafa kamɛ fiɛ babakple manwa nfũ, diekye Amori batii sikpile diidu nfũ kananfi ma ni kootoko.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Obe wɔ di kufĩ ntɔɔmɛɛ kaayi ntɔɔwɔfɔ ni yi, dibukii ku ɔtɔ kɔɔyɔ kodie ni ku atɔkɔnii lakyɔɔ diabafe di sina nwu baatɛ ni sebo. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Dii nwu nkpo di Saate lanii kanya ku Abram aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Banantii lɛfɔ lɛyɔ kasɔ ka mmle lɛta diɛyɔ ni di Nil okle kotoko di Egipte, diɛlaase ni di Eufrate okle kplɛ nwu kotoko. <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Nka ninle kasɔ ka di Keni batii, Kenisi batii, Kadmoni batii, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Hiti batii, Perisi batii, Refait batii, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Amori batii, Kanaan batii, Girgasi batii ku Yebusi batii nsi nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Hagar Ku Ismael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Sarai, Abram ɔsɔfɔ diiloolofo obi kuonwii ata ni Abram, kafɔɔ aawɛ Egipte ɔlanle sankobi onwii baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Hagar. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Ni aatɔkɔ Abram alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyu! SAATE nwu dilɔɔtɛɛ obi nlofo. Tɔɔkyɛ falaayɔ ɔlanle sankobi nii nwu: loobia mawɛ babi bawo nklee.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:2">Abram latũna di Sarai ɔlaa nwu suoto. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Nioso obe wɔ di Abram ntoosiɛ ni di Kanaan kasɔ suoto di alɛɛ lefosi sɛmaa, ni di Abram ɔsɔfɔ Sarai layɔ Egipte ɔlanle sankobi nɔɔ nwu Hagar aata ɔsa alɛ ayɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Ni aatenko Hagar, ni aalaka lɛmɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:4">Obe wɔ aatofo alɛ nfɛ alaka ni lɛmɛ, ni aakyako ɔya nwu onyu nyakatãa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Ninfɛ di Sarai latɔkɔ Abram alɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɔ ninkyɛnko oso oonyu mi nyakatãa. Ami niayɔ ɔlanle sankobi nii lata fɔ, nunua nfɛ aye alɛ alaka ni lɛmɛ, ninfɛ oonyu mi nyakatãa nɛ. Saate nwu aka ɔlaa wɔ mmle ata munko fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Ninfɛ di Abram latɔkɔ Sarai alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyu lo! ɔlanle lɛfɔ ale. Bla nwɔ mmle fɛɛnya falɛ dilɛ ni.&gt;&gt; Ninfɛ di Sarai lakyako nwɔ okukuo nɛ, ni aatoso aasifi nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Saate tɔkyɛntɛ lanya Hagar di ntu kataakɔ kanwii di ɔfaafuu, diale ntu kataakɔ ka niakaako ni Sur osuku nwu. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Ninfɛ aakaalɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Hagar, Sarai ɔlanle fɛ feekye, ɔfɛ foofe kafɔɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Otoso kotoso nkye ɔyaafɔ nii Sarai nfũ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Ninfɛ di Saate tɔkyɛntɛ nwu nkpo latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kple fatɔɔkyɛ ɔyaafɔ lɛfɔ nfũ faawakosa suoto kasɔ fatɔɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Ninfɛ di tɔkyɛntɛ nwu nkpo labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kamata banantii lɛfɔ mpɔ kpinwu alɛ blɔbafuo ma ɔka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />SAATE nwu tɔkyɛntɛ nwu kafɔɔ labuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">&lt;&lt;Nfɛ falaka lɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">fabalofo obisuɔtɔbi kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">Faatika nwɔ leyooto Ismael,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">diekye SAATE nwu ntoonu sɛnyaami lɛfɔ se faawi fakpe nwɔ ni di dibuo lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Abasiɛ nkpa yakayaka di otii kuonwii dilɔbafuo ni oklee, obe lele abakyɛ antookyi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">abataka anyila di otii biala suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">otii biala kafɔɔ mataka anyila nwɔ di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:12">abasiɛ ɔblɔ nkpa amblasa suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">di batii nɔɔ bamuu suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Ni aayɔ leyooto le mmle aata Saate wɔ niakakatɛko nwɔ ni alɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɔ ninle Yaa wɔ niɛnyɛɛ nii,&gt;&gt; diekye aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntɔɔnya Otii wɔ ninnyɛɛ nii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Nkpo oso bɔɔlɛɛ ntu kataakɔ nwu nkpo alɛ, Beer Lahai Roi. Diekple dite di Kades ku Bered obo.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Nioso Hagar lalofo obisuɔtɔbi aata Abram, ninfɛ di Abram latika osuɔtɔbi nwu aalofo ni leyooto alɛ Ismael nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Abram lafũ alɛɛ afosi anɛ alɛɛ akuɔ di obe wɔ di Hagar lalofo Ismael aatɔɔ nii.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Suoto Ɔkyɛlɛnsa Kanya Onii Ɔsaabla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Obe wɔ di Abram lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi anaasĩ alɛɛ anaasĩ yi, Saate nwu ladiki suoto aatuo nwɔ ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle Yaa wɔ Ninkpe osie nlenke nii, nu mi ɔlaa alɛ faawo nimu. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Ni kamata nlɛ kanya nii onii nsiɛ di munkofɔ ntɛɛ nta banantii lɛfɔ mpɔ kpinwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Ninfɛ di Abram lafuusa anu kaasɔ, ni di Yaa latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />&lt;&lt;Konii kanya ka mmle ku afɔ. Fabale nnle kpinwu kote. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Blɔbasinlɛɛ fɔ Abram, leyooto lɛfɔ nfɛ ninle Abraham, diekye ntɔɔbla fɔ nnle kpinwu kote. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Mata banantii lɛfɔ mpɔ kpinwu, mabla fɔ nnle kpinwu, baka madie mankye kamɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Kamanii kanya ka mmle di munkofɔ ntɛɛ ku banantii lɛfɔ ntɛɛ. Kabale kanya ninii le ninaa ni kaloo nimate kanta ni kayi kamaa banantii lɛfɔ kpinwu. Kanya ninii nwu ninle alɛ kamale fɔ Yaa ku banantii lɛfɔ ba nikɔwa ni sɛɛmaa Yaa. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Kanaan kasɔ nwu suoto kamuu fale ni ɔfɔɔ, kamayɔ ka nta afɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ kanle ye atesaa ya ninaa ni kaloo; male ma kafɔɔ Yaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Ninfɛ di Yaa latɔkɔ Abraham alɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɔ yi, mufũ kanya ninii nwu nkpo faklee, afɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ ba nikɔwa ni kaayi kamaa yi, biklee kanya ninii nwu nkpo. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Nle mmle ninle kanya ninii le konii ni munko fɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ bamuu, biamufũ minklee ni nɛ: Dikpeni osuɔtɔ biala kaamɛ lee lɛkyɛlɛnsa suoto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.10</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lebudi lɛsɔkɔsɔkɔ </char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Dikpeni bɛɛkyɛlɛnsa nwɔ suoto fɛ nsũ lɛtɛsaa di kanya ninii le ninsi ni munko fɔ ntɛɛ. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Banantii lɛfɔ ba babalofo ni kaayi kamaa, obisuɔtɔbi biala nintoofũ ayi anɛ dikpeni bɛɛkyɛlɛnsa nwɔ suoto, diɛkyakaa ni di mba beelofo ni di leyo lɛfɔ ee mba baaya ni ku koto fɛ balanle mananle fɔ ni banantii. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Mba beelofo ni leeyo lɛfɔ woo, mba faaya ni ku koto, dikpeni bɛɛkyɛlɛnsa ma suoto, alɛ kanya ninii nsũ ɔtɛ wɔ mmle katika ye di suoto dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Osuɔtɔ lele ninankyɛlɛnsa suoto, eesĩ alɛ ɔlɔɔkyɛlɛnsa suoto yi, baadiki nwɔ di batii nɔɔ kamɛ; diekye eesĩ kanya ninii nwu ɔbla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Yaa lakple aatɔkɔ Abraham alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ Sarai nnwɔɔ yi, disinnaa alɛ faalɛɛ nwɔ falɛ Sarai; leyooto nɔɔ nfɛ ninle Sara. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Kamawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ, nwaako abalofo obisuɔtɔbi anta fɔ. Kamawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ aamakple nnle kpinwu kɔya; baka madie mankye kamɛ nɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Abraham lafuusa anu kaasɔ; ni aama aabuɛ kaamɛ nɔɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Baalofo obisuɔtɔbi manta otii wɔ nintoofũ ni fɛ alɛɛ kɔlafa? Sara kafɔɔ kamalofo obi di obe wɔ atoofũ ni alɛɛ afosi anaasĩ? <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Ninfɛ di Abraham latɔkɔ Yaa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni ta Ismael asiɛ di lɛyɔɔ lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Ninfɛ di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwaako, ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ Sara malofo obisuɔtɔbi anta fɔ, fantika nwɔ leyooto falɛ Isak. Kamanii kanya ku nnwɔɔ ku banantii nɔɔ ba nimawa ni kaayi kamaa dinnaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Di Ismael suoto kafɔɔ yi, ntoonu fɔ ɔlaa: Nwaako kamawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ, matɔɔ anlofo anwɛ banantii kafɔɔ ampɔɔsa. Abale lefosi baka banyɔ kote, mabla nwɔ kafɔɔ anle kale kplɛ. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Kafɔɔ kanya ninii nii nka yi, Isak suoto dibatika, obi wɔ di Sara kamalofo anta fɔ ni lɛlɛɛmba naakpa wɔ okle.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Obe wɔ di Yaa ntooloo ni Abraham ɔkakatɛko yi, aasifi osi aadiɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Dii nwu nkpo kale ni di Abraham lakpaa obi nɔɔ Ismael ku batii ba bamuu baalofo ni leeyo nɔɔ ee mba aaya ni ku koto nɔɔ, osuɔtɔ biala di leyo nɔɔ aakyɛlɛnsa ma suoto, fɛ mmle di Yaa latɔkɔ nwɔ ni nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Abraham lafũ alɛɛ afosi anaasĩ alɛɛ anaasĩ fiɛ aakyɛlɛnsa suoto. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Obi nɔɔ Ismael kafɔɔ lafũ lefosi alɛɛ atiɛ. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Abraham ku obi nɔɔ Ismael, dii ninwii nwu kale baakyɛlɛnsa banyɔ lɛma nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Osuɔtɔ biala di Abraham leyo ku mba baalofo ni leeyo nɔɔ ee baaya baakyeko ni bafɔɔ nfũ, baakyɛlɛnsa ma suoto ku nnwɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Saate Labuɛ Atɛ Alɛ Abata Abraham Obisuɔtɔbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Saate ladiki suoto aatuo Abraham di Mamre kowoso kplɛ nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ wɔ aasiɛ ni di lɛkpaayo nɔɔ kayoko di kakũ lebe. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Di Abraham latakatɛsa anu aanyu nii, ni aanya basuɔtɔ batiɛ banwii layila batakyo nwɔ ni. Obe wɔ aanya ma nii, ni aapɛsɛwa aakye lɛkpaayo nɔɔ kayoko nwu aalaakyakako ma, ni aapɛ akunkyi aase katũ kaasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Ni aatɔkɔ onwii lɛma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate nse faale mi sibualɛ yi, ni tanwaalɛ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ faafe. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Bitɛɛ nwako ye ntu kɛɛkɛɛ, di bamuu lee bifoto nkpaa biɛtɛ ɔnyɛɛ di kowoso ko mmle kalɔ. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Biɛtɛɛ nwako ye alesaa awo bile, biekpee suoto ɔnyɛɛ fiɛ biesifi di obe wɔ bitɔɔwa ni kpɛmblatɛ lee nfũ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lafe! Bla fɛ mmle feebuɛ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Nkpo oso Abraham lapɛsɛwa aasifi Sara nfũ di lɛkpaayo nwu kamɛ. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Pɛsɛwa faakusii nnaafũ muɛmuɛ lɛfɔ nwu nkpo ɛkɛkɛ etiɛ faanwɔtɔ fafiɛ bloblo owo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Ninfɛ di Abraham latoso aasifi banankyue nɔɔ kamɛ, ni aamufũ lɛnankyuebi le ninlɛ nii, aayɔ aata kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ aalo aafiɛ ni diabe nwaa. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Ninfɛ aayɔ nankyue nnyɛɛntu kpɛnkpɛ ku mbe niate ni kyololo aakyakaa di nankyue sina fiɛle nwu nkpo aabase ma kaatũ nɛ. Kafɔɔ nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ aayila ma di ɔlɔɔkɔ koowoso nwu kalɔ di obe wɔ baatoole ni alesaa nwu.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Ninfɛ baakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔfɛ di ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ Sara nkpe?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi di lɛkpaayo nwu kamɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Ninfɛ di onwii lɛma latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwaako kamakple nwa ni ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ lɛlɛɛmba naakpa okle, ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ Sara kamalofo obisuɔtɔbi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Sara kafɔɔ latoonu ɔlaa nwu di lɛkpaayo nwu nkpo kayoko di osuɔtɔ nwu sɛmaa. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Abraham ku Sara ntoobe kofokofoko batɔɔkyɛ sitũ nwaa kafɔɔ di alɛɛ kamɛ. Sara kafɔɔ ntoofe kolofo. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Nioso Sara lama di suoto nɔɔ kamɛ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntoobe lɛkpasɔ ni mmle di saate nii kafɔɔ ntooobe nii, kamakple nnya ɔmɛnɛfɛ di bawo otenko kamɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Ninfɛ di Saate lakaalɛ Abraham alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be oso di Sara kɔma ambuɛ alɛ, &lt;Kamafuo obi olofo nwaako, nua wɔ mmle ntoobe ni?&gt; <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Lɛsaa lewo nkpe osie dilenke Saate nwu ku ɔbla? Lɛlɛɛmba naakpa okle kamakple nwa ni ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ Sara kamalofo obisuɔtɔbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Sara latɔɔyɛkɛ, nioso aalaa aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaoo nimma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Kafɔɔ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kubio, fɛɛma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abraham Latikiti Lekoto Di Sodom Disi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Obe wɔ di basuɔtɔ nwu nkpo lataka alɛ boosifi ni, baakyɔɔ anu Sodom, ni di Abraham lakpeeko ma nkpaa alɛ ɔɔtɛ ma osuku nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Ninfɛ di Saate nwu nkpo labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kayɔ lɛsaa le kamabla ni nkookaa Abraham? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Diekye nwaako Abraham kamale kale kplɛ ku nka ninkpe ni osie, babawii nnle mmuu kafɔɔ lɛyɔɔ kaasɔ ka mmle suoto diefe ni di suoto nɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Diekye lediki nwɔ nlɛ aatuo babi nɔɔ ku leyo nɔɔ batii alɛ baakyɔɔ Saate ɔlaa atoko mambla asaa tinini ku n-ya niewo nii, alɛ Saate mata alɛ lɛsaa le aabuɛ aatɛ alɛ abata ni Abraham kawa kanya nintɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Nioso Saate latɔkɔ Abraham alɛ. &lt;&lt;Ntoonu asaakuu ya batoobuɛ beekyeko ni Sodom ku Gomora batii suoto. Sikpile lɛma ntoosii ɔpɔ. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Nkpo oso kosoo nkyɛ nfa ninaanyu nse asaakuu ya lanu alɛ bɔɔbla ni nte nkpo. Nse kute nkpo, ee kuote nkpo kamatofo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Ni di basuɔtɔ nwu banyɔ lamunikĩi baakyako Sodom otoofe nɛ. Kafɔɔ Abraham lakple aayila di Saate anu. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Ninfɛ di Abraham lakpukuti atɛɛtɛɛ nwɔ ni aakaalɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni fabawɔɔsa batii ba ninte ni tinini ku bakpiletɛ fankpɔtɔɔsa? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Ni nse batii afosi anɔɔ nte tinini di okpoo nwu, faawɔɔsa nwu? Flaanya nwu nyaami ta batii afosi anɔɔ nwu oso? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Ninfũ nnu nlɛ fababla nkpo alɛ, faawɔɔsa batii ba ninte ni tinini ku bakpiletɛ fankpɔtɔɔsa. Lɛ oso fiɛ faananfi batii ba ninte ni tinini ku bakpiletɛ kootoko kyɛkyɛ. Ninfũ nnu nlɛ fababla nkpo! Otii wɔ ninle ni kayi kamuu kantɛ dilaabla lɛsaa di osuku kanya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nse lɛwɛ batii ba ninte ni tinini afosi anɔɔ di Sodom okpoo yi, kamanya nwu nyaami ta mma oso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Ninfɛ di Abraham lakple aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nunua ntɔɔwɛ sɛkambi kɔkakatɛko Saate, nu ninanle lɛsalɛsa kafɔɔ kudu ku ntɔ̀ yi, <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />ni nse batii banɔɔ ledie di batii tinini afosi anɔɔ kamɛ mɔ? Fabawɔɔsa okpoo nwu nkpo omuu ta batii banɔɔ oso?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Ninfɛ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nse lɛwɛ batii afosi ana batii banɔɔ yi, namawɔɔsa nwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Ni aakple aakaalɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni nse fɛɛwɛ batii afosi ana ninfa mɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Ni aabuɛ alɛ &lt;&lt;Ta batii afosi ana nwu oso namawɔɔsa nwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Ninfɛ aakple aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate, lekoto tannya ɔblɔ faakpeekoe lo! Tɛɛ nkple nkakatɛ. Ni nse fɛɛwɛ batii afosi atiɛ mɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Namawɔɔsa nwu nse lɛwɛ batii afosi atiɛ ninfa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Abraham labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nunua ntɔɔwɛ sɛkambi kɔkakatɛko ni Saate, ni nse fɛɛwɛ batii afosi anyɔ ninfa mɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ta batii afosi anyɔ nwu nkpo oso, namawɔɔsa nwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Ninfɛ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate lekoto tannya ɔblɔ faakpeekoe lo! Tɛɛ nkple nkakatɛ ninwii pɛ. Ni nse fɛɛwɛ batii lefosi mɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Ni aabuɛ alɛ &lt;&lt;Ta batii lefosi nwu nkpo oso, namawɔɔsa nwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Obe wɔ di Saate nwu ntɔɔkakatɛko Abraham eeloo nii, aasifi aadiɛ nwɔ, ni di Abraham lasifi leyo nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Sodom Ku Gomora Batii Asaakuu Ɔbla.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Obe wɔ di Yaa batɔkyɛntɛ banyɔ nwu nkpo labuo ni Sodom ku kɔtɔɔfɔ lebe, Lot lasiɛ di okpoo nwu nkpo kayoko. Obe wɔ aanya ma nii, ni aataka aalaakyakako ma, ni aapɛ akunkyi aafuusa anu kaasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Basaate nii, lekoto biwa biɛbasoosa di kpɛmblatɛ lee leyo. Ninta ye ntu bifoto nkpaa biete di ɔkyɛ nii, nse kale lɛsɛ yi, biasifi osuku lee.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Oowo, bubate di okpoo wɔ mmle lɛkpaka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Kafɔɔ aabunka ma osie kanya ni baatuna baalaasosa di leyo nɔɔ nɛ. Ni aata baawa alesaa baata ma nɛ. Aata baafiɛ bloblo wɔ di lɛnyakasaa diesi ni aata ma baale. <verse eid="GEN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Fiɛ nfɛ babasifi manaate nii, basuɔtɔ bamuu di Sodom okpoo nwu kakɔ biala, bakosopo ku banɔɔfo labamana leyo nwu baakyi. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Baalɛɛ Lot osie kanya baakaalɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Fɛ di basuɔtɔ ba niebabuo fɔ ni kɔfɔɔ ku kakyɛ ka nkpe? Dieko ma fawako wo buotenko ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Lot ladie aakyɛ ɔkyɛ lɛma kaayi, ni aasɛɛ leyo sɛɛmaa nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />Ni aalaatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Oowo, basiɛwo! Bitambla okpile wɔ mmle okle. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Binyu, nkpe babisankobi banyɔ, manan-ye ni osuɔtɔ diidii. Bitɛɛ nkpaa ma nwako ye lele bilɛ biɔbla ma yi, biɛbla ma. Kafɔɔ bitambla basuɔtɔ ba mmle lɛsalɛsaa, diekye ami beebuo kɔfɔɔ, dikpenii nnyu nlɛ lɛsalɛsaa diɛbla ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɛwo dianu wla, afɔ ɔfɔɔ akpa! Afɔ owe fabatɔkɔ wo lɛsaale dikpeni buɔbla ni. Kyɛwo dianu wla! Nse diele nkpo, bubabla fɔ lɛsaa munlenkee bia bafɔɔ lɛfɔ nwu. Ni baatukusa Lot baafenko sɛmaa baakyɛ alɛ bɔɔlaabiɛ kokloo nwu nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Kafɔɔ basuɔtɔ nwu leeyo kamɛ ladie baananfi Lot baakpee leeyo nwu kamɛ baasɛɛ kokloo. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Ninfɛ baata anu lawɔfɔ basuɔtɔ nwu nkpo niayila ni di leyo nwu kayoko nɛ, bakosopo ku banɔɔfo nwu, mmle okle manaasinya ni kayoko nwu nkpo.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lot Ladie Di Sodom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Ninfɛ di basuɔtɔ nwu nkpo banyɔ latɔkɔ Lot alɛ, &lt;&lt;Batii lɛfɔ bawo lekple bakpe ninfũ, dile ni balɔ ee babisankobi ee otii bamba owo di okpoo wɔ mmle kamɛ? Kpaa ma fadieko. <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />Diekye buɔwa nfũ mmle ɔwɔɔsa. Saate ntoonu asaakuu ya baatii ba mmle kɔbla nii, ni eekpee wo alɛ bubawɔɔsa Sodom nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Nioso Lot lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ balɔ nɔɔ ba niakaalɛ nwɔ babisankobi nɔɔ alɛ bɔɔyɔ ni alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bipɛsɛwa biedie ninfũ, diekye Saate nfɛ mawɔɔsa okpoo wɔ mmle!&gt;&gt; Kafɔɔ balɔ nɔɔ nwu nkpo lanyu alɛ kɔkyɔ ookpee.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Kolesɛtũ kaale nfɛ masɛ ni, Yaa batɔkyɛntɛ nwu nkpo lapɛko Lot sɛwa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Pɛsɛwa! Faakpaa ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ ku babisankobi lɛfɔ nwu banyɔ ninkpe ni ninfũ, nse diele nkpo ni bibawɔɔ nse bɛɛnanfi okpoo wɔ mmle kootoko.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Kafɔɔ Lot latooku nkpaa. Ninfɛ di basuɔtɔ nwu nkpo lamufũ nwɔ kɔɔnɛɛ, baamufũ ɔsɔfɔ ku babisankobi nɔɔ nwu banyɔ kafɔɔ n-le baananfi ma baadiki di okpoo nwu kamɛ, diekye SAATE nwu lanya ma nyaami. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Di obe wɔ baakpaa ma baadieko nii, ni di onwii lɛma latɔkɔ Lot alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitoso biefũ suoto nkpa! Bitanyu sɛmaa, bitanyila kafɔɔ kaakɔkaakɔ di ɔtaata nwu. Bitoso bisifi abokote nwu suoto, se diele nkpo bibawɔɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Kafɔɔ Lot labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Oowo, Basaate nii, lekoto, bitambla wo nkpo! <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Feele mi sibualɛ fɛɛnyɛɛ nyaami feediki mi nkpa. Kafɔɔ namafuo otoso odu abokote nwu fiɛ kaawɔɔ nwu mawa, ni kamakpi. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Nyu lo, nya okpoo onwii ninkpe ninfa kuɔtɛɛtɛɛ ni, tɛɛ ntoso nsifi nfa. Okpoo biibii ko kule, nioso tɛɛ osuku nintoso nsifi nfa ninwɛ nkpa. Sɛɛ, diele okpoo biibii ko kule?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Ninfɛ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kulɛ, kamatuna nta fɔ, namawɔɔsa okpoo nwu nkpo foobuɛ nii. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Kafɔɔ toso nkyenkye, diekye nɔmafuo lɛsalɛsa ɔbla nse fayidu nfa.&gt;&gt; (Nioso baalɛɛ okpoo nwu nkpo alɛ Soar).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.22</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diekye lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ biibii. </char></note> nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baawɔɔsa Sodom Ku Gomora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Obe wɔ di Lot labuo ni Soar kufĩ ntootũ. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Ninfɛ di Saate lata amã ku ɔtɔ lanɔɔ kuakye osi di Saate nfũ kuakpete di Sodom ku Gomora kasɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Ni aawɔɔsa sekpoo nwu nkpo ku sɛtaata nsɔ nwu mmuu ku okpoo nwu nkpo kamɛ basiɛtɛ ku lɛsaa biala niakɔntɔ ni kaasɔ nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Kafɔɔ Lot ɔsɔfɔ lanyu sɛmaa ni aakple mmba dituu nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Ku kolesɛtũ Abraham lataka aakple aakyɛ lɛba le aayila ni di Saate anu. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Ni aanyu aasooko diofe ni Sodom ku Gomora ku sɛtaata nsɔ nwu, ni aanya kɔyɔ kplɛ kɔtaka kaasɔ nwu suoto fɛle lɛfɛnku kɔyɔ.<verse eid="GEN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Nioso obe wɔ di Yaa lawɔɔsa ni sɛtaata nsɔ nwu nkpo di Lot lasiɛ nii, aanyuma Abraham ni aadiki Lot aakyeko kawɔɔ nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moab Batii Ku Amon Batii Kakyekɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Lot ku babisankobi nɔɔ nwu banyɔ ladie di Soar baasifi baalaasiɛ di abokote osi. Diekye aatɔɔyɛkɛ alɛ aasiɛ di Soar. Manko babisankobi nɔɔ nwu banyɔ baasiɛ di ofuɔntuu kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Dii ninwii ɔsankobi nɔɔfole latɔkɔ maatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teewo ntoobe, osuɔtɔ kuonwii nnaa ninfũ aatenko wo nii, fɛ mmle dite ni kaayi kamuu. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Ta buta teewo nta anyi asiɛ alɛ aatenko wo munlaka amɛ munlofo babi, alɛ teewo kɔna dilaawɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Dii nwu nkpo kakyɛ baata ote lɛma nta aanyi, ni di ɔsankobi nɔɔfole lakyɛ aalate nwɔ di ɔkyɛ nɛ. Kafɔɔ ote ditatofo obe wɔ aabate nwɔ ni di ɔkyɛ ku obe wɔ aataka nii.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Kaleesɛ ɔsankobi nɔɔfole latɔkɔ maatɛle alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɔsa kakyɛ late di teemi nfũ. Kakyɛ ka kafɔɔ ta bukple butɔɔ nta anyi, di afɔ kafɔɔ faalaate di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ alɛ munkofɔ bualofo babi di teewo suoto.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Nioso baata ote lɛma nta aanyi kakyɛ nwu nkpo kafɔɔ, ni di ɔsankobi bisɔnle kafɔɔ lalaate nwɔ di ɔkyɛ nɛ. Nni nkpo kafɔɔ atatofo obe wɔ abate ni ku obe wɔ aadie nii.<verse eid="GEN 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Nioso Lot babisankobi nwu banyɔ lalaka amɛ di ote lɛma suoto. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Ɔsankobi nɔɔfole lalofo obisuɔtɔbi ni aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Moab nɛ. Nnwɔɔ ninle miɛ Moab batii ɔwa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Ɔsankobi bisɔnle kafɔɔ lalofo obisuɔtɔbi ni aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Ben-Ami. Nnwɔɔ ninle miɛ Amon batii ɔwa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abraham Ku Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Abraham ladie di Mamre aasifi kasɔ ka di kalakasɔ, ni aalaasiɛ di Kades ku Sur obo nɛ. Ni aasiɛ di Gerar kɛɛkɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Ninfɛ di Abraham labuɛ di ɔsɔfɔ Sara suoto alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obiloo sankobi ale.&gt;&gt; Nioso Abimelek, Gerar ɔka lata baakpaa Sara baawako nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Kafɔɔ Yaa lasɛɛsa Abimelek kɔlaafɔ ku kakyɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Fɔɔwa ɔbakpi di ɔsanko nwu fɛɛkpaa ni suoto, diekye santɛ ale.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Kafɔɔ di obe nwu kamɛ Abimelek diitenko nwɔ. Nioso aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate, ni fabawɔɔsa kale ka ninankpi ni lɛpɔɔ? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Nnwɔɔ niatɔkɔ mi alɛ, &lt;Obiloo sankobi ale&gt;, ni di ɔsanko nwu kafɔɔ labuɛ alɛ, &lt;Obiloo suɔtɔbi ale nɛ.&gt; Otu biene kamɛ labla nle mmle, ninkpi lɛpɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Ninfɛ di Yaa latɔkɔ nwɔ kɔɔlaafɔ kamɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwaako, n-ye nlɛ otu biene kamɛ faabla nle mmle, nioso ninanta fɔ fabla okpile di suoto nii nɛ. Nioso ninanta fɔ fatenko nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Nioso kplesa ɔsanko nwu nkpo fata ɔsa, diekye Yaa ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ ale. Abapɛ ɔlaa anta Yaa diisi lɛfɔ faanwɛ nkpa. Kafɔɔ nse faakplesa nwɔ fatɔɔ, ni kɔtafɔ fantofo nlɛ minko asaa lɛfɔ amuu bibakpi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Abimelek lataka ku kolesɛtũ aalɛɛ banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ni aatɔkɔ ma lɛsaa le niawa ni fɛɛ nɛ. Nioso banɔɔfotii nwu layɛkɛ baafensa. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Ninfɛ di Abimelek lalɛɛ Abraham ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be lɛsaa fɛɛbla wo nkpo nɛ? Ɔmɛnkpile lɛbla fɔ fiɛ fɔɔta okpile kplɛ wɔ mmle nwa di suoto nii ku sɛka kalekɔ nii suoto? Lɛsaa le manambla nii, nni fɛɛbla mi nɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Ninfɛ di Abimelek lakaalɛ Abraham alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be lɛsaa oso fɛɛbla lɛsaa le mmle nwu nkpo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Ninfɛ di Abraham ladiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lenyu nlɛ Yaa lɛyɛkɛ nnaa di lɛba le mmle, ni babalo mi ta ɔsɔfɔ nii oso. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Nwaako kafɔɔ, obiloo sankobi ale, teemi obisankobi ale, kafɔɔ diele yaami obi ale, fiɛ ale mi ɔsɔfɔ. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Obe wɔ di Yaa latɔkɔ mi alɛ ndie ni di teemi leyo nintɔɔkyɛ ni ɔfɔɔkpoo yi, ni latɔkɔ nwɔ nlɛ, &lt;Nyɛɛ nyaami, kakɔ lele buɔkyɛ yi, faabuɛ falɛ, &lt;&lt;Obiloo suɔtɔbi ale.&gt;&gt; &gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Ninfɛ di Abimelek layɔ bafoso ku banankyue ku balanle suɔtɔ ku basanko aata Abraham nɛ. Ni aakplesa ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Sara kafɔɔ aatɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Ni di Abimelek latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kasɔ nii ninle nka nɛ, siɛ kaakɔ lele ninlɛ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ Sara alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɔyɔ koto fututu kakpe nta nnwɔ falɛ ale ni obilee suɔtɔbi fɛ ntu kokpeesato di batii lee bamuu anu, diotuo alɛ faakpi ni lɛpɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Ninfɛ di Abraham lapɛ ɔlaa aata Yaa di Abimelek ku ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ ku balanle sankobi nɔɔ asi alɛ Yaa kafukuti ma selofofɔtɔ alɛ baakple manlofo nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Diekye Saate lanii olofofɔtɔ biala di Abimelek leyo alɛ kulaabudi obi ta Abraham ɔsɔfɔ Sara oso.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Isak Lelofo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Saate nwu lanyuma kanya ka aanii ni ku Sara, ni di Saate nwu labla aata Sara fɛ mmle okle aatɔkɔ nwɔ ni nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Sara labalaka lɛmɛ ni aalofo obisuɔtɔbi aata Abraham di obe wɔ atoobe ɛɛkpasɔ nii, di obe wɔ kamɛ tutuutu di Yaa labuɛ aatɛ nii. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Ni di Abraham latika obisuɔtɔbi wɔ di Sara lalofo aatɔɔ ni leyooto alɛ Isak nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Obe wɔ di Isak lafũ ni ayi anɛ, ni di Abraham lakyɛlɛnsa nwɔ suoto fɛ mmle di Yaa lakpee nwɔ ni kufiofa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Abraham lafũ alɛɛ kɔlafa fiɛ baalofo obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Isak baatɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Ninfɛ di Sara labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yaa ntɔɔtɛɛ sɛma, otii lele kafɔɔ nienu ɔlaa wɔ mmle kamamankoe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Abuɛ aakyakaa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Owe niate aasɛ kɔlaafɔ di Abraham suoto alɛ Sara kata obi lɛnyɛɛ annyɛɛfu? Kafɔɔ ntoolofo osuɔtɔbi lɛtɔɔ di obe wɔ atoobe ɛɛkpasɔ nii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abraham Latososa Hagar Ku Ismael.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Obisɔ nwu lamuɔ aabudi lɛnyɛɛ, dii le di Isak labudi ni lɛnyɛɛ yi, Abraham lale dii kplɛ ninwii aatɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Kafɔɔ Sara lanya alɛ obi wɔ di Hagar, Egipte otii nwu lalofo aata ni Abraham latɔɔma nwɔ nii, <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />ni aatɔkɔ Abraham alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tososa ɔlanle sanko nwu ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nwu. Diekye ɔlanle sanko nwu obi dilɔbale atesaa ku obi nii Isak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Ɔlaa nwu ditamɛnɛmɛnɛ Abraham ta obisuɔtɔbi nwu oso. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Kafɔɔ Yaa latɔkɔ Abraham alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tanta ɔlaa nwu labuo fɔ suoto ta obisuɔtɔbi nwu ku ɔlanle sanko nwu oso. Nu ɔlaa lele di Sara lɛtɔkɔ fɔ, diekye diefe ni di Isak suoto di banantii lɛfɔ makye. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Ɔlanle sanko obi nwu kafɔɔ, mata kale ndie kankye kamɛ nɔɔ, diekye obi lɛfɔ ale.<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Abraham lataka ku kolesɛtũ aayɔ alesaa awo, aakpete ntu di dikuuku aata Hagar, ni aayɔ aatika nwɔ di nimuusi nɛ. Ni aadiki nwɔ osuku ku obi nwu nɛ. Ni aasifi aalaatookyikyii Beerseba ɔfaafuu nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Obe wɔ di ntu ntooloo ni di dikuuku nwu yi, ni aayɔ obi nwu aalaatensa di kawesee kanwii kalɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Ni aasifi aalaasiɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ fɛ okuma lɛtaa lekyo nɛ. Ni aabuɛ aatɔkɔ suoto alɛ, &lt;&lt;Namafuo osiɛ onyu obi nwu akpi.&gt;&gt; Obe wɔ aasiɛ ni ninfa ni aafaa kaku nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Yaa lanu obi nwu kaku, ninfɛ di Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ lalɛɛ Hagar di osi aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be lɛsaa dile Hagar? Tanyɛkɛ; Yaa ntoonu obi nwu kaku di obe wɔ ate ni ninfa. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Laakɛnkɛ obi nwu faklee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ, diekye kamabla nwɔ kale kplɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Ninfɛ di Yaa latikiti Hagar anu ni aanya ditubiɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ aakyɛ aalaadu ntu aakpete di dikuuku nwu kamɛ, ni aata obi nwu lanyi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Yaa lasiɛko obisɔ nwu nkpo aamuɔ, aasiɛ di ɔfaafuu nwu aabakple kpantɛ kplɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Obe wɔ aasiɛ ni di Paran ɔfaafuu nwu kasɔ, ɔya lamiɛ ɔsanko di Egipte kasɔ suoto aatɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abraham Ku Abimelek Labla Onwii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ, ni di Abimelek ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ ɔnɔɔfo Fikol labatɔkɔ Abraham alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yaa nsiko fɔ di lɛsaa biala fɔɔbla kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Ka ntam ninfũ fatɛɛ di Yaa anu falɛ flabakyɔnkyɔ mi diidii ku babi nii ku banantii nii, alɛ fabale mi sifutulɛ ku kasɔ ka mmle suoto fasi ni fɛ ɔfɔɔ, fɛ mmle okle lale fɔ ni sifutulɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Ninfɛ di Abraham labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lɛka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Ninfɛ di Abraham lakakatɛ di ditubiɔ le di Abimelek bakpɛmblatɛ lafũ ni ku suoto osie aatɔkɔ Abimelek nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Ninfɛ di Abimelek labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nin-ye otii wɔ niabla ni lɛsaa nwu nkpo. Diidii faditɔkɔ mi, miɛ ko konu ɔlaa wɔ mmle nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Nioso Abraham layɔ bafoso ku banankyue aata Abimelek, ni di akyuu lɛma anyɔ baanii kanya nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Ninfɛ di Abraham ladiki bafoso sanko bakuɛnsĩ aase lete nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Ni di Abimelek lakaalɛ Abraham alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bafoso sanko bakuɛnsĩ nwu feediki feese ni lete kasɔ mɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Fũ bafoso bakuɛnsĩ nwu nkpo fakyeko ɔkyɛ nii, dietuo fɛ kamaadiyilasaa alɛ ami niakutu ditubiɔ nwu nkpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Nkpo oso bɔɔlɛɛ lɛba nwu nkpo alɛ Beerseba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ kanya ninii dibiɔ.</char></note> nɛ. Diekye lɛba nwu nkpo di akyuu lɛma anyɔ baanii kanya nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Di obe wɔ batooloo ni kanya onii nwu nkpo di Beerseba, Abimelek ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔfo nɔɔ Fikol lakple baasifi Filisti batii kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ni di Abraham lasɔ kowoso ko manlɛɛ ni tamarisk di Beerseba, ni aalɛɛ Saate, Yaa wɔ Ninaa ni Kaloo leyooto ninfa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Ninfɛ di Abraham lasiɛ di Filisti batii kasɔ suoto aaklɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s1">Saate Lasɔ Abraham Ofũ Onu Aanyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Obe owo sɛmaa, Yaa lasɔ Abraham aanyu. Alɛɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Abraham!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Aatuna alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnyɛɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Yaa latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɔ obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ nwu, obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ onwii nwu Isak wɔ fambɔmbɔ ni, faatɔɔkyɛ Moriak kasɔ suoto. Faayɔ nwɔ falaabla asaa ofiɛ oleɔta di abokote ya matuo fɔ ni kunwii suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Kolesɛtũ Abraham lataka aabudi oleɔta ntɔɔni nwo ni aanii atoo aatika di bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo suoto, ni aakpaa obi nɔɔ Isak ku bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ banyɔ aakyakaa di suoto nɛ. Ni baayefe osuku baasifi lɛba le di Yaa latɔkɔ nwɔ ni nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Di dii tiɛfa suoto, Abraham latakatɛsa anu aanyu katoo ni aanya lɛba nwu fanfa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bisiɛ ninfũ bisokoe ku bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo. Munko obi nii buɔkyɛ nfa munasumu Yaa munkple munwa ye ɔkyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Abraham layɔ asaa ofiɛ oleɔta ntɔɔni nwu nkpo aatukasa obi nɔɔ Isak, ninfɛ di nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aaklee ɔtɔ ku kapamii nɛ. Obe wɔ di batii lɛma banyɔ nfɛ nkyɛ boosifi nii, <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isak lalɛɛ ote Abraham alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teete!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Abraham latũna alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obi!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Ni di Isak lakaalɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bukle ɔtɔ ku ntɔɔni ninfũ, ni lefosobi le bubayɔ munta ni asaa ofiɛ oleɔta mɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abraham ladiki kanya aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obi nii, Yaa omu nimata lefosobi nwu munta asaa ofiɛ oleɔta nwu.&gt;&gt; Ninfɛ di banyɔ lɛma baakyɛ baasifi nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Obe wɔ baadu ni lɛba le di Yaa latɔkɔ nwɔ nii, ninfɛ di Abraham lapɛ oleɔta akyikye ninfa, ni aayɔ ntɔɔni aatitika nɛ. Ninfɛ aanii obi nɔɔ Isak, aayɔ nwɔ aatika di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto di ntɔɔni osi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Ninfɛ aayɔ kapamii alɛ oolo obi nwu nkpo nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Kafɔɔ Saate tɔkyɛntɛ lalɛɛ nwɔ aakyeko di osi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Abraham! Abraham!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnyɛɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Ni di tɔkyɛntɛ nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tankpanko obisɔ nwu, tambla nwɔ lɛsalɛsaa. Mmia nfɛ lɛnya nlɛ fɔɔyɛkɛ Yaa nɛ. Diekye faasĩ mi obi lɛfɔ onwii nwu lete ɔyɔ ɔta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Ninfɛ di Abraham latakatɛsa anu aanyu, ni aanya dikũnumuu lekpee akya di dikumii ninwii diyɛ nwɔ di ɔlɔɔkɔ ni aakyɛ aalaadiki ni aayɔ aata asaa ofiɛ oleɔta di obi disi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Nioso Abraham latika lɛba nwu leyooto alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate Kamata.&gt;&gt; Bia mmiɛ batii mbuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Di Saate kobokote osi suoto, babata.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Ni di Saate tɔkyɛntɛ lakple aalɛɛ Abraham aakyeko osi lɛnyɔɔfa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate alɛ lɛka di suoto nii, ta fɛɛbla ni nle mmle, fanansĩ nwɔ ni obi lɛfɔ onwii nwu lete ɔyɔ ɔta yi, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />kamanyu nlɛ lewii fɔ lɛyɔɔ, lɛta banantii lɛfɔ lɛpɔ fɛ awɛntrɛbi di osi ku lekpo ɔtɛnsĩa. Banantii lɛfɔ mafũ balo lɛma sekpoo sinkple ma sele. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Diefe ni baanantii lɛfɔ suoto babawii nnle mmuu lɛyɔɔ, diekye feenu mi ɔlaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Ninfɛ di Abraham lakple aasifi bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nfũ, ni di bamuu lɛma baakple baasifi Beerseba nɛ. Ni di Abraham lasiɛ di Beerseba nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nahor Banantii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Sɛlaa se mmle sɛmaa, baatɔkɔ Abraham alɛ, &lt;&lt;Milka kafɔɔ ntoolofo babisuɔtɔbi ɛɛta obilee Nahor: <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Us niale obi kasale, Bus niale obilɛma, Kemuel (Aram ote), <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kesed, Haso, Pildas, Yidlaf ku Betuel.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betuel lalofo Rebeka. Milka lalofo babisuɔtɔbi ba mmle banɛ aata Abraham obilɛma Nahor. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Nahor ɔsɔnɔ wɔ baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Reuma kafɔɔ lalofo babisuɔtɔbi bana: Ayooto lɛma niale Teba, Gaham, Tahas ku Maaka nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s1">Sara Kukpi Ku Okookaa Nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sara lasiɛ nkpa aafũ alɛɛ kɔlafa afosi anyɔ akuɛnsĩ. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Aakpi di Kiriat Arba (ninle ni Hebron) di Kanaan kasɔ suoto. Ninfɛ di Abraham lakyɛ alɛ ɔɔlaawi nwɔ, ni aawi kaku di Sara suoto nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Ninfɛ di Abraham lataka di ɔsɔfɔ kpi ɔlɔɔkɔ ni aakyɛ aalatɔkɔ Hiti batii alɛ, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />&lt;&lt;Ɔfɔɔ nle nsi ye kaamɛ. Bisunsũ kakookaasɔ kawo bitɛɛ nin-yɔ ɔsɔfɔ nii kpi naakookaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Ninfɛ di Hiti batii latɔkɔ Abraham alɛ, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />&lt;&lt;Ɔnɔɔfo, nu ɔlaa loo wɔ buobuɛ ni. Ɔnɔɔfotii fale fiɛ fasi wo kaamɛ. Nyu ɔkya lele ninlɛ fɔ faakookaa nwɔ kaamɛ. Kuonwii loo dilabasĩ ata fɔ alɛ tankookaa ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ kpi di ɔkya nɔɔ kamɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Ninfɛ di Abraham lataka awakosa suoto kasɔ aata kasɔ nwu nkpo batii ninle ni Hiti batii nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nse bietuna bilɛ nkookaa otii nii ninfũ yi, ni binu mi ɔlaa bietikiti Efron Sohar obi lekoto bitɛɛ, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />ni aayɔ Makpela ofuɔntuu wɔ ninle nwɔ ni ole kute ni di kofe nɔɔ kayɛntɛkɔ asunsũ atɛɛ. Bitɔkɔ nwɔ aasunsũ atɛɛ fɛ mmle boosunsũ ni nintɔɔ koto alɛ kawɛ batii kakookakɔ kaamɛ lee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Kafɔɔ Efron Hiti otii nwu lasiɛ di batii lɛma nwu kamɛ, ni aadiki kanya aabuɛ aatɔkɔ Abraham di Hiti batii ba niawa ni di okpoo nwu nkpo kayoko lanu alɛ. <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />Aabuɛ alɛ &lt;&lt;Oowo, saate nii, nu ɔlaa wɔ kobuɛ ni; Lɛyɔ kasɔ nwu kamuu ku ofuɔntuu nwu nkpo lɛta fɔ di batii nii anu. Kookaa kpi lɛfɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Ninfɛ di Abraham lakple aawakasɔ di kasɔ nwu nkpo batii anu, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />ni aabuɛ aatɔkɔ Efron, batii nwu bamuu lanu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nu mi ɔlaa, faatuna, ninta fɔ kasɔ nwu koto, faafũ ninkookaa ɔsɔfɔ nii kpi ninfa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Ninfɛ di Efron ladiki Abraham kanya alɛ, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />&lt;&lt;Nu mi ɔlaa, saate nii, kasɔ nwu kɔya kafũ koto fututu alafa ana, ɔlaa wɔ mmle diele ɔlaa kuonwii di munko fɔ ntɛɛ fiɛ! Kookaa ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ ninfa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Abraham latũna di Efron ɔlaa nwu suoto, ni aakadi koto ko aabuɛ di Hiti batii lanu ni aatɔɔ di anu lɛma nɛ: Koto fututu onutũ alafa ana niale koto ko baatoofũ ni di asaa basunsũtɛ kamɛ di obe nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Nkpo oso Efron kofe nwu di Makpela diɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni Mamre labakple Abraham kole. Kofe nwu ku ofuɔtuu ku awoso ya niayila ni kɔɔmɛ suoto, <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />labakple Abraham ale di Hiti batii bamuu niawa ni okpoo nwu kayoko anu. <verse eid="GEN 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Nni sɛmaa, Abraham lakookaa ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Sara kpi di ofuɔtuu kofe di Makpela wɔ niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni Mamre di Hebron di Kanaan kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Nioso Hiti batii ladiɛ kofe nwu ku ofuɔntuu nwu nkpo baata Abraham diakple nwɔ batii kakookaakɔ.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s1">Isak Layɔ Rebeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Abraham labe aafũ alɛɛ kpi, Saate kafɔɔ lawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ di asaa amuu suoto. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Ninfɛ di Abraham latɔkɔ leyo nɔɔ kamɛ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔfole, nnwɔ niayila nwɔ ni di asaa amuu kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɔ kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ fatika mi di kutĩ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nle mmle kotuo ntam ɔka</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Komiɛ nlɛ ka ntam fatɛɛ di Saate wɔ ninle ni osi ku kasɔ Yaa leyooto kamɛ falɛ, flabayɔ ɔsanko di Kanaan batii basankobi ba kamɛ nsi ni fata obisuɔtɔbi nii. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Kafɔɔ fabakyɛ okpoo nii di ami omu batii nii kamɛ fanaayɔ ɔsanko ninfa fanta obi nii Isak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Ninfɛ di kpɛmblatɛ nwu lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni nse ɔsanko nwu dilootuna alɛ ootikankoe anwa kasɔ ka mmle mɔ? Ni kakplesa obi lɛfɔ nwu nkyesee kasɔ ka fɛɛkye ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Ninfɛ di Abraham latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyu falɛ faakplesa obi nii fakyesee nfa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />&lt;&lt;Saate Yaa di osi, nnwɔ niadiki mi ni di teemi leyo ku okpoo nii niakakatɛkoe aabuɛ aatɛ ku ami alɛ, &lt;Banantii lɛfɔ mayɔ kasɔ ka mmle nta,&gt; abakyesee Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ nɔɔ nleko fɔ katũ alɛ faawɛ ɔsanko ninfa fanta obi nii. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Nse ɔsanko nwu dietuna alɛ ootikanko fɔ aan-wa yi, ni nnɛɛ lɛfɔ aku nkpaa lɛfɔ aku. Kafɔɔ tankplesa obi nii faakyesee nfa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Nioso kpɛmblatɛ nwu nkpo layɔ kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ aatika di saate nɔɔ Abraham kutĩ, ni aaka ntam aatɔɔ di ɔlaa wɔ mmle suoto nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Ninfɛ di kpɛmblatɛ nwu nkpo layɔ saate nɔɔ Abraham kapu bapɔnkɔ lefosi ku asaa nɔɔ biene ate ate, ninfɛ aayefe osuku aasifi Mesopotamia di Nahor okpoo nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Ninfɛ aata kapu bapɔnkɔ nwu nkpo lapɛ akunkyi di ditubiɔ ninwii ɔlɔɔkɔ di okpoo lɔɔkɔ nɛ. Kɔtɔɔfɔ diale, di obe wɔ di basanko nkyɛ ni katu.<verse eid="GEN 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Ni aapɛ ɔlaa aata Yaa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Oo SAATE, saate nii Abraham Yaa, lekoto, ta diwa kaanya ditɛɛ miɛ wɔ mmle, faale saate nii Abraham sifutulɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Nyu, n-yɛ di ntu kataakɔ ka mmle ɔlɔɔkɔ, di okpoo wɔ mmle basanko kɔwa ni ntu odu. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Ta diwa alɛ kakpeelebitɛ ka kamatɔkɔ nlɛ, &lt;Lekoto tikɛɛ ntu nnyi&gt;, ababuɛ ni alɛ, &lt;Nyi, kamadu nta kapu bapɔnkɔ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ mannyi ni yi&gt;- nnwɔɔ nimale ɔsanko wɔ feediki fɛɛta ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Isak nɛ. Nle mmle nimatɛɛ ntofo nlɛ feele saate nii sifutulɛ nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Fiɛ aaloo ni ɔlaa ɔpɛ ɔta Yaa, ni di Rebeka lakye aakyɔɔ aatika dibukii di nimuusi. Betuel obisankobi aale, nwɔ niale ni Abraham obilɛma suɔtɔbi Nahor ku ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Milka obi. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Ɔsankobi nwu latɛ aalɛ sekpeele di osuɔtɔ kuonwii diitenko ni diidii. Ni aakyɛ ntu kataakɔ nwu aalaadu ntu ku dibukii nɔɔ aakple nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Ninfɛ di kpɛmblatɛ nwu nkpo lapɛsɛwa aalaadu nwɔ ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lekoto, tikɛɛ ntu kɛɛkɛ di dibukii lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ nnyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate nii, nyi.&gt;&gt; Ninfɛ aapɛsɛwa aasoosa dibukii nwu nkpo aaklee ninnɛɛ kamɛ aatɔɔ ntu aanyi nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Obe wɔ aatɔɔ ntu aanyi aaloo nii, ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kamadu ntu nta kapu bapɔnkɔ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ mannyi, ninaase di obe wɔ di bamuu lɛma beeloo ni onyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Nioso aapɛsɛwa aanyɛɛnɛ ntu bule aakpete di babɔkɛɛ ntu ninyinsaa kamɛ, ni aatoso aasifi ditubiɔ nwu aalaadu ntu aakyakaa nɛ. Nioso aadu ntu aata kapu bapɔnkɔ nɔɔ nwu bamuu. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Kpɛmblatɛ nwu nkpo ditabuɛ ɔlaa kuonwii, aayila aatoonyu nwɔ alɛ, oonyu nse Saate nwu lɛta osuku nwu lɛlɛ nwɔ ɔkyɛ.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Di obe wɔ di kapu bapɔnkɔ nwu ntooloo ni ntu onyi yi, ni di osuɔtɔ nwu ladiki koto sɛɛle onwu lɛkɔnii aakpee nwɔ di onwu, ni aayɔ koto sɛɛle nnɛɛtũ nkɔnii aakpee nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Ninfɛ aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Owe obisankobi fale? Lekoto tɔkɔ mi, leyo nkpe di teefɔ leyo munko batii nii bubate ni kakyɛ ka mmle?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Betuel obisankobi nle, dile ni obisuɔtɔbi wɔ di Milka lalofo aata ni Nahor.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Ni aabuɛ aakyakaa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bukpe sɛsɔ ku babɔkɛɛ aku kpi diɛta kapu bapɔnkɔ lɛfɔ, ayo kafɔɔ nkpe biate nii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu lapɛ akunkyi aasumu Saate nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Baatansa Saate, saate nii Abraham Yaa wɔ ninansĩ ni sifutulɛ ku onukwale nɔɔ odiki otuo saate Abraham. Diekye Saate nwu lɛkpaa mi ɛɛwako saate nii banantii nɔɔ nfũ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Ɔsankobi nwu latoso aalaatɔkɔ ɔya anɛ leyo kamɛ batii sɛlaa se mmle. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Rebeka lawɛ obilɛma suɔtɔbi onwii baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Laban, ni aapɛsɛwa aadie aakyɛ osuɔtɔ nwu nfũ di ntu kataakɔ nwu katũ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Obe wɔ aanya ɔnya onwu lɛkɔnii ku nnɛɛtũ nkɔnii di obilɛma sankobi nnɛɛtũ, fiɛ aanu ɔlaa wɔ di Rebeka labuɛ alɛ osuɔtɔ nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ nii, ni aadie aakyɛ osuɔtɔ nwu nfũ aalaanyɔɔ ayɛ di kapu bapɔnkɔ nɔɔ nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ di ntu kataakɔ nwu katũ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Wa, afɔ wɔ di Saate lewii ni lɛyɔɔ, be oso fayɛ kaayi ninfũ?&gt;&gt; Ntoololaa leyo lɛta fɔ ku lɛba kafɔɔ lɛta kapu bapɔnkɔ lɛfɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Nioso osuɔtɔ nwu lasifi leyo nwu, ninfɛ baatekete atoo di kapu bapɔnkɔ nwu suoto nɛ, ni baata ma sɛsɔ ku babɔkɛɛ aku baawee nɛ. Ni baakusii ntu baata Abraham kpɛmblatɛ nwu nkpo ku batii nɔɔ baafoto nkpaa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Ni baase ma alesaa alɛ bale nɛ; Kafɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Namale alesaa diɛlaase di obe wɔ ntoobuɛ lɛsaa le oso nkyɛ nii.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Ninfɛ di Laban labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni tɔkɔ woɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Abraham kpɛmblatɛ nle. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Saate lewii saate nii Abraham lɛyɔɔ osie kanya atookple saawɛntɛ. Ɛtɔɔ bafoso ku banankyue, koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle, balanle sanko ku basuɔtɔ, kapubapɔnkɔ ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Saate nii ɔsɔfɔ Sara lalofo obisuɔtɔbi aatɔɔ di obe wɔ atoobe ɛɛkpasɔ nii, ni ɛɛyɔ atesaa nɔɔ amuu ɛɛta obi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Ninfɛ di saate nii latɛɛ laka ntam labuɛ nlɛ, &lt;&lt;Flabayɔ ɔsanko fata obisuɔtɔbi nii di Kanaan batii basankobi kamɛ, batii ba kasɔ nsi nii. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Tɔɔkyɛ teemi leyo kamɛ di kafaabi nii kamɛ, falaayɔ ɔsanko ninfa fata obisuɔtɔbi nii.&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />&lt;&lt;Ninfɛ lakaalɛ saate nii nlɛ, &lt;Ni nse ɔsanko nwu dietũna alɛ ootikankoe anwa mɔ?&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />&lt;&lt;Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;Saate wɔ anu ntɔɔkyɛ nii, kamakyesee fɔ Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ nɔɔ anta osuku nwu ɔkyɛ nlɛ kunta fɔ. Alɛ faawɛ ɔsanko fanta obisuɔtɔbi nii di ami omu kafaabi di teemi leyo kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Ni nse fɛɛkyɛ kafaabi nii kamɛ ni fatoodie di ntam be fɛɛka fɛɛtɛɛ nii, nse kuntɛ beesĩ ɔsanko nwu nkpo ɔyɔ ɔta fɔ yi, ni fatoodie di ntam nwu fɛɛka fɛɛtɛɛ ni kamɛ.&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />&lt;&lt;Nioso obe wɔ lɛwa ni ntu kataakɔ nwu katũ miɛ, ni lɛpɛ ɔlaa lɛta Yaa lebuɛ nlɛ, &lt;O Saate, afɔ ninle saate nii Abraham Yaa, nse dilɛfɔ, lekoto faata osuku wɔ nkyɛ ni kulɛ kutɛɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Nya n-yɛ ninfũ di ntu kataakɔ ka mmle katũ, nse kakpelebitɛ lɛwa ntu odu lɛtɔkɔ nwɔ nlɛ, &lt;&lt;Lekoto tikɛɛ ntu kɛɛkɛ di dibukii lɛfɔ nnyi&gt;&gt; yi, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />nse ɛɛtɔkɔ mi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyi, kamadu kafɔɔ nta kapu bapɔnkɔ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ mannyi&gt;&gt; yi, ni faatɔɔ ale nnwɔ di Saate lediki ɛɛta ni saate nii obisuɔtɔbi.&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />&lt;&lt;Fiɛ laloo ni ɔlaa ɔpɛ ɔta Yaa di otu nii kamɛ, ni di Rebeka lakyɔɔ aatika dibukii di nimuusi. Ni aasifi ntu kataakɔ nwu katũ aalaadu ntu nɛ. Ni latɔkɔ nwɔ nlɛ, &lt;Lekoto tikɛɛ ntu nnyi.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />&lt;&lt;Nfanwu, ni aasoosa dibukii nwu aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;Nyi, kamadu ntu nwu nta kapu bapɔnkɔ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ mannyi.&gt; Nioso lanyi, ni aadu ntu nwu kafɔɔ aata kapu bapɔnkɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 24:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Ninfɛ lakaalɛ nwɔ nlɛ, &lt;Owe obisankobi fale?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">&lt;Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, Betuel, obisuɔtɔbi wɔ di Milka lalofo aata ni Nahor obisankobi nle.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">Ninfɛ layɔ lɛkɔnii lasaka nwɔ di onwu, layɔ nnɛɛtũ nkɔnii kafɔɔ lakpee nwɔ di nnɛɛtũ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Ninfɛ lapɛ akunkyi kaasɔ lasũmu SAATE nɛ. Latansa SAATE nwu, saate nii Abraham Yaa wɔ nialeko mi ni katũ di osuku biene suoto lɛwɛ saate nii obilɛma suɔtɔbi ɔwa sankobi lɛta ni obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Nioso nunua nse bibale saate nii sifutulɛ minle onukwale mintɔɔ yi, ni biɛtɔkɔ mi. Nse bilootuna kafɔɔ yi, biɛtɔkɔ mi, nintofo mmle nfɛ kabla ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Ninfɛ di Laban ku Betuel labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔlaa wɔ mmle Saate nfũ kuokye; nioso ɔlaa kuonwii nnaa wo buabuɛ nii. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Nyu lo, nnya Rebeka nin-yɛ nɛ, kpaa nwɔ fasifiko aalaayɔ saate lɛfɔ obisuɔtɔbi fɛ mmle okle di Saate lebuɛ ni.<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Di obe wɔ di Abraham kpɛmblatɛ lanu ɔlaa wɔ baabuɛ nii, ni aapɛ akunkyi di Saate anu nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Ninfɛ di kpɛmblatɛ nwu nkpo ladiki koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu anyɛnɛ ku abula ya niafũ ni kɔya aata Rebeka nɛ. Ninfɛ aayɔ asaa ya niafũ ni kɔya aata obilɛma suɔtɔbi ku ɔya kafɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Mmia nfɛ di Abraham kpɛmblatɛ nwu nkpo ku basuɔtɔ ba niakyɛ ni lale alesaa baanyi, ni baate ninfa kale lasɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">Obe wɔ baataka ni ku olesɛ, ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bidiki mi osuku nintɔɔkyɛ saate nii nfũ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Ninfɛ di Rebeka obilɛma suɔtɔbi ku ɔya labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitɔɔ asiɛ di ɔkyɛ loo fɛ ayi lefosi fiɛ aasifi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Kafɔɔ aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitanfũ mi biasiɛsa ninfũ di obe wɔ di Saate ntɔɔta osuku lɛlɛ mi ni ɔkyɛ. Bidiki mi osuku nintɔɔkyɛ saate nii nfũ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Ninfɛ baabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bita bulɛɛ ɔsankobi nwu nkpo buɔkaalɛ nwɔ nwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Nioso baalɛɛ Rebeka ni baakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Footikanko osuɔtɔ nwu fansifi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yii kosifi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Nioso baadiki obilɛma sankobi Rebeka osuku aasifi ku ɔsanko wɔ nianyu nwɔ ni ku sibisɔ ku Abraham kpɛmblatɛ nwu ku basuɔtɔ nwu baasifi. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Ninfɛ baawii Rebeka lɛyɔɔ baabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">&lt;&lt;Obi loo sankobi Rebeka, lofo fase, faasaa fase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">di nkpe kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">di babi lɛfɔ bafũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">balo lɛma nsɔ babla nle ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Ninfɛ di Rebeka ku ɔsanko kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ lalolaa suoto baasiɛ kapu bapɔnkɔ lɛma baasifi ku basuɔtɔ nwu nkpo nɛ. Nioso kpɛmblatɛ nwu nkpo lakpaa Rebeka aasifiko.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Di obe nwu Isak lakye Beer Lahai Roi ditubiɔ katũ aawa, diekye aasiɛ di Kanaan nkpaalɔ kasɔ. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Dii ninwii kɔtɔɔfɔ Isak ladie aasifi lepoo alɛ ɔɔlaabu sɛlaa sewo disi. Obe wɔ aatakatɛsa anu aanyu nii, aanya kapu bapɔnkɔ kɔwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Rebeka kafɔɔ latakatɛsa anu aanyu ni aanya Isak nɛ. Ni aasoo di kapu pɔnkɔ nɔɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />Ni aakaalɛ Abraham kpɛmblatɛ nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Owe ninle osuɔtɔ nwu ninkye lepoo ɔɔwa wo ni ɔkyakako?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Ninfɛ di kpɛmblatɛ nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate nii dile. &lt;&lt;Nioso aayɔ anuditĩisaa aatĩi anu.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Ninfɛ di kpɛmblatɛ nwu latɔkɔ Isak lɛsaa biala le aabla ni nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Nioso Isak lakpaa nwɔ aasifiko ɔya Sara lɛkpaayo kamɛ, ni aayɔ Rebeka aakple nwɔ ɔsɔfɔ nɛ. Aabɔmbɔ nwɔ kafɔɔ nɛ. Nioso Isak otu nfɛ labate di ɔya kukpi suoto.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s1">Abraham Banantii Bamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Abraham lakple aayɔ ɔsanko bamba, leyooto nɔɔ niale Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Aalofo babi ba mmle aatɔɔ. Mma niale Simran, Yoksan, Medan, Midian, Isbak ku Sua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yoksan lalofo Seba ku Dedan. Dedan banantii niale Asuri batii, Letusi batii ku Leumi batii. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Midian babisuɔtɔbi niale Efa, Efer, Hanok, Abida ku Eldaa. Mma mmle bamuu niale Ketura banantii nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abraham layɔ lɛsaa biala niawɛ nwɔ ni aata Isak. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ aawɛ ni nkpa, aata ɔsɔnɔ nɔɔ babi atasaa, ni aatososa ma di Isak suoto aasifiko kufĩ katũnkɔ kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Alɛɛ ya amuu di Abraham lafũ ni niale alɛɛ kɔlafa afosi akuɛnsĩ alɛɛ anɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Abraham labe aakpasɔ aafũ alɛɛ kpi fiɛ aakpi aasifi bawa nɔɔ anɛ nfũ. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Isak ku Ismael lakookaa nwɔ di Mekpela ofuɔntuu nwu niatɛɛtɛɛ ni Mamre, di Efron obisuɔtɔbi Sohar Hiti otii nwu kofe. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Kofe ko di Abraham laya ni di Hiti otii nwu nfũ. Nfa baakookaa Abraham ku ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Sara nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Di Abraham kakpimaa yi, Yaa lawii obi nɔɔ Isak lɛyɔɔ, aasiɛ di Beer Lahai Roi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya Ismael Banantii Ninle Mma Mmle Nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Nnya mma mmle ninle Ismael, Abraham obisuɔtɔbi wɔ di Egipte ɔsanko Hagar, Sara ɔlanle lalofo aata ni Abraham banantii nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Nnya Ismael babisuɔtɔbi ayooto ninle n-ya mmle di mmle kanya baalofo ma ni nɛ. Nebaiot niale obi kasale, fiɛ di Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Misma, Duma, Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadad, Tema, Yetur, Nafis ku Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Mma mmle niale Ismael babisuɔtɔbi ku ayooto lɛma nɛ. Lefosi nfaabi nnyɔ baka baale, di nsiɛkɔ lɛma ku akpaayo lɛma mpɛkɔ kanya. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ismael labe aafũ alɛɛ kɔlafa afosi atiɛ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ fiɛ aakpi aasifi bawa nɔɔ anɛ nfũ. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Banantii nɔɔ lasiɛ diayɔ ni di Hawila ntɛɛ nwu dialaase di Sur, diɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni Egipte kɔmɛ diofe ni Asur. Baasiɛ nkpa yakayaka di babilɛma bamuu suoto.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau Ku Yakob Lelofo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Nnya nle mmle ninle Isak, Abraham obisuɔtɔbi banantii ɔlaa nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:19">Abraham lalofo Isak. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Obe wɔ di Isak lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi ana ni aayɔ Rebeka, Betuel obisankobi nɛ, aale ni Aram otii wɔ niakye ni Padan Aram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mosopotamia</char></note> dile ni Laban ɔsankobilɛma.<verse eid="GEN 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Isak lapɛ ɔlaa aata Saate di ɔsɔfɔ disi, diekye ɔlɛma aale. Ni di Saate nwu latũna nwɔ nɛ. Ni di ɔsɔfɔ Rebeka lalaka lɛmɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Babifɔɔle nwu latɔkpɛko bawo kaafutu, ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be oso di nle mmle kɔwa mi di suoto nkpo?&gt;&gt; Ni aakyɛ aalaawolaa kamɛ di Saate nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Ni di Saate latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">&lt;&lt;Nnle nnyɔ ninsi fɔ di olofofɔtɔ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">batii banyɔ ba mmle niekye ni kamɛ lɛfɔ mabla baawo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">onwii kamawɛ osie anlenkee owo nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">ɔnɔɔfo le kafɔɔ kamasumu obisɔnle.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Obe wɔ di obe lawo alɛ aalofo nii, atabi suɔtɔbi niasiɛ nwɔ di olofofɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Ɔkasale wɔ niadie ni lasɛɛ bɔmbɔ, suoto nɔɔ simuu kafɔɔ late fɛle sinwini akpeele, nioso baatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Nni kamaa, baalofo obilɛma aaklee Esau di lɛnankpo kpinkpi; nioso baatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Yakob. Isak lafũ alɛɛ afosi akuɔ fiɛ di Rebeka lalofo ma.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Obe wɔ di babi nwu nkpo labamuɔ nii, Esau labakple kpantɛ kplɛ, obe lele asi leepoo kamɛ. Kafɔɔ Yakob labla obi buɛɛ obe lele asi leeyo. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Isak labɔmbɔ sina owee nioso aabɔmbɔ Esau, kafɔɔ Rebeka labɔmbɔ Yakob.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Dii ninwii Yakob latɔɔwa alesaa, ni di Esau lakye lepoo kamɛ aawa, aatookpi kɔka. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Ni aatɔkɔ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Pɛsɛwa faatikɛɛ alesaa sɛɛle lɛfɔ nwu awo nle! Kokpi kɔka!&gt;&gt; (Nkpo oso baakple baatɔɔlɛɛ nwɔ alɛ Edom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lɛsɔdiki ninle lɛsɛɛle</char></note> nɛ.)<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Ninfɛ di Yakob latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Sunsũ selofo nɔɔfo lɛfɔ fatɛɛ fiɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Ni di Esau labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnya okpi nfɛ kokpi nɛ, be ninle selofo nɔɔfo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Kafɔɔ Yakob labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka ntam fatɛɛ fiɛ.&gt;&gt; Nioso aaka ntam aatɔɔ, ni aasunsũ selofo nɔɔfo nɔɔ aata Yakob nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Ninfɛ di Yakob latɔɔ kayoonkyɛɛ ku sũkũ aale nɛ. Ni aale, aanyi, ni aataka aasifi nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:34">Nioso Esau ditabu selofo nɔɔfo nɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s1">Isak Ku Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Kɔka kunwii lakpɛ di kasɔ nwu nkpo suoto, fɛ nko niakpɛ ni di Abraham obe kamɛ. Nioso Isak lasifi Filisti batii ɔka Abimelek nfũ di Gerar. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Ninfɛ di Saate ladiki suoto aatuo Isak, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tandie faasifi Egipte, siɛ di kasɔ ka suoto lɛtɔkɔ fɔ nlɛ siɛ ni. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Siɛ kaasɔ ka mmle suoto kɛɛkɛ, kamasiɛko fɔ, n-wii fɔ lɛyɔɔ. Diekye afɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ kamayɔ nsɔ be mmle mmuu nta. Kamabla di ntam be laka lata ni teefɔ Abraham. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Kamata banantii lɛfɔ mpɔ fɛ awɛntrɛbi di kolo, kamayɔ nsɔ be mmle mmuu nta ma, diefe ni baanantii lɛfɔ suoto babawii nnle mmuu lɛyɔɔ kaasɔ ka mmle suoto. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Diekye Abraham lakyɔɔ mi ɔlaa atoko, aale mi kufiofa aakyɛ di sisuku se latuo nwɔ ni, asaa otuo ku sɛlaa se latɔkɔ nwɔ nii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Nioso Isak lasiɛ di Gerar.<verse eid="GEN 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Obe wɔ di basuɔtɔ ba niawɛ ni ninfa lakaalɛ nwɔ ni ɔsɔfɔ disi yi, aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔsankobi loo ale,&gt;&gt; diekye aatɔɔyɛkɛ alɛ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔsɔfɔ nii ale.&gt;&gt; Diekye aanyu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Basuɔtɔ nwu di lɛba le mmle malo mi ta Rebeka oso, diekye alɛ sekpeele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Obe wɔ di Isak ntoosiɛ ninfa diɛklɛ nii, dii ninwii, Abimelek Filisti batii ɔka lanya aafenko di sɛfle mmle okle di Isak ku ɔsɔfɔ Rebeka latookpee ni kɔkyɔ. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Nioso Abimelek lakpee Isak otii aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwaako ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ ale! Obe oso foobuɛ falɛ, &lt;Obiloo sankobi ale&gt;?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Ninfɛ di Isak ladiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Diekye lenyu nlɛ babalo mi ta nnwɔɔ oso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Ninfɛ di Abimelek labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obe lɛsaa fɛɛbla wo nkpo? Nse osuɔtɔ owo ntabatenko ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ ninkple wo dibuo kplɛ di suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Nkpo oso Abimelek lakpee batii nwu bamuu kufiofa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Otii lele niɛbla osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle ee ɔsɔfɔ amumu, nwaako babalo nwɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Ni di Isak lapɛ asaa di kasɔ nwu nkpo suoto lɛɛlɛɛ nwu nkpo kamɛ nɛ, aafee asaa nwu nkpo lɛɛpɔ kamɛ, diekye Saate lawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle labakple saawɛntɛ, lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ sitũ ko diatoofe dialaase di obe wɔ aabakple ni saawɛntɛ kplɛ. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Aawɛ kafɔɔ bafoso, banankyue ku bakpɛmblatɛ kpinwu diata alɛ diabakple Filisti batii onunsɛɛ di suoto nɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Nioso ntu abiɔ ya amuu di ote bakpɛmblatɛ lakutu ni di obe wɔ di Abraham lawɛ ni nkpa, Filisti batii lakyɛ baalaakutu kɔtɛ baatĩi nya.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Ninfɛ di Abimelek latɔkɔ Isak alɛ, &lt;&lt;Die wo kaasɔ fasifi; diekye fatoosii osie ɔwɛ olenkee wo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Nioso Isak ladie ninfa aasifi aalaapɛ akpaayo di Gerar ɔtaata kasɔ aasiɛ ninfa. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Ni di Isak lakple aalaadiki ntu abiɔ ya baakutu ni di obe wɔ di ote Abraham lawɛ nii, di Filisti batii latĩi nya ni di ote Abraham kakpimaa. Ni aakple aata nya ayooto ya di ote lata nya ni nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Isak bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ lakutu ditubiɔ di ɔtaata nwu ni baatũ ntu biene nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Kafɔɔ Gerar babɔkɛɛbakpatɛ labalɔnko Isak babɔkɛɛbakpatɛ baabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntu nwu nkpo nle wo dile!&gt;&gt; Nioso Isak latika ditubiɔ nwu leyooto alɛ, Esek,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.20</char><char style="ft" closed="false">lɛsɔdiki ninle kalɔ</char></note> diekye baalɔ ku nnwɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Ni baakple baakutu ditubiɔ bamba nɛ, kafɔɔ baakple baalɔ di nni nkpo suoto kafɔɔ. Nioso aatika ni leyooto alɛ Sitna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.21</char><char style="ft" closed="false">lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ ɔtaka oyila di suoto</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Aadie ninfa aakple aalaakutu ditubiɔ bamba, nni nkpo kuonwii ditalɔ niini suoto. Ni aatika ni leyooto alɛ Rehobot,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.22</char><char style="ft" closed="false">osuku ɔta</char></note> aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nunua SAATE nwu ntɔɔta wo osuku alɛ dialɛ wo kaasɔ nwu suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Aadie ni ninfa, ni aasifi Beerseba nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Kakyɛ nwu nkpo SAATE nwu ladiki suoto aatuo nwɔ, ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle teefɔ Abraham Yaa nwu nɛ. Tanyɛkɛ, diekye nsiko fɔ; kamawii fɔ lɛyɔɔ, nta banantii lɛfɔ kafɔɔ mpɔ ta kpɛmblatɛ nii Abraham oso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Nioso Isak lapɛ oleɔta akyikye ninfa ni aalɛɛ Saate leyooto ninfa nɛ. Ninfɛ aapɛ lɛkpaayo, ni di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ lakutu ditubiɔ ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Mmia kafɔɔ, Abimelek ku Ahusat otii wɔ ninka nwɔ nii ku Fikol wɔ niale nwɔ ni bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ nɔɔfo, lakye Gerar baakyɛ Isak nfũ. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Ninfɛ di Isak lakaalɛ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be oso biɛwa mi ɔkyɛ, di obe wɔ biɛtaka bieyila mi ni di suoto bietososɛɛ ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Ninfɛ baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Butɔɔnya buɔtɛ nsũ bulɛ Saate nsiko fɔ. Nioso buabuɛ bulɛ, &lt;Dikpeni alɛ, buɔka bawo ntam.&gt; Buonii kanya ku afɔ, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />alɛ flababla wo amumu, fɛ mmle okle di awoo butabla fɔ ni amumu, kafɔɔ bualolaa fɔ buaklee obe lele fiɛ buadiki fɔ ni osuku di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ. Nunua kamɛ ntɔɔkpa klekle alɛ Saate nwu ntoowii fɔ lɛyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Nioso Isak lata baawa alesaa baatũ ma opunu, baale baanyi. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Kaleesɛ ku kuyitatũ, baaka ntam baata baawo. Ni di Isak ladiki ma osuku, ni baasifi di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Dii nwu nkpo kale, Isak bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ lawa babatɔkɔ nwɔ ɔlaa di dibiɔ le baakutu ni alɛ, &lt;&lt;Butootũ ntu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Ninfɛ aatika ditubiɔ nwu leyooto alɛ Seba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.33</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seba lɛsɔdiki ninle ni alɛ, ntam ee akuɛnsĩ.</char></note> nɛ. Nioso bɔɔlɛɛ okpoo nwu Beerseba <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.33</char><char style="ft" closed="false">lɛsɔdiki ninle atubiɔ ntam ee atubiɔ akuɛnsĩ</char></note> bia miɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Obe wɔ di Esau lafũ ni alɛɛ afosi ana, ni aayɔ Hiti otii Beeri obisankobi Yudit ku Elon, Hiti otii obisankobi Basemat nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Esau basɔfɔ ba mmle lata nkpa lawɛ osie diata Isak ku Rebeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s1">Isak Lawii Yakob Lɛyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Obe wɔ di Isak ntoobe ɛɛkpasɔ eebiɛ anu onosinya nii, ni aalɛɛ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nɔɔfole Esau aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obi nii&gt;&gt;,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">ni aatuna alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnyɛɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Ninfɛ di Isak latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntoobe, nin-ye dii le kamakpi nii. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Nioso lolaa suoto, faayɔ akpakyaa lɛfɔ, kɔtaa ku kubi, faatɔɔkyɛ lepoo kamɛ falaalo bɔkɛɛ fawakoe. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Faabawa alesaa ya nimbɔmbɔ ni nwaa fawakoe nle, nin-wii fɔ lɛyɔɔ fiɛ ninkpi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Di Isak latɔɔtɔkɔ ni obi nɔɔ Esau ɔlaa nwu nkpo yi, Rebeka lanu. Nioso obe wɔ di Esau lasifi ni lepoo kamɛ alɛ ɔɔlaakpa anwa nii, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />ninfɛ di Rebeka latɔkɔ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lanu teefɔ kɔtɔkɔ obilee Esau alɛ, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />&lt;Laalo bɔkɛɛ faabawa alesaa ya nimbɔmbɔ ni fawakoe nle, nin-wii fɔ lɛyɔɔ di Saate anu fiɛ ninkpi.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Nioso obi nii, nu ɔlaa wɔ kɔtɔkɔ fɔ ni faabla nkpo: <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Tɔɔkyɛ babɔkɛɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ, faalaamufũ kutiebii ko ninlɛ ni kɔnyɔ fawakoe ninwa alesaa ya di teefɔ mbɔmbɔ ni ntɔɔ, fɛ mmle okle ammiɛ alɛ bɛɛwa nya ni. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Ni faayɔ fakyɛnko teefɔ ale, aawii fɔ lɛyɔɔ fiɛ aakpi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Ninfɛ di Yakob latɔkɔ ɔya Rebeka alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kafɔɔ obiloo Esau sinwini otii ale, kafɔɔ ami suoto nii nte plɔplɔ. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Loobia teemi makpanko mi suoto annyu. Ni dibawa alɛ ɔkyɔnkyɔ kɔkyɔnkyɔ nwɔ, naafũ lɛkpaani di obe wɔ komiɛ ni lɛyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Ninfɛ di ɔya latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obi nii, lɛkpaani nwu nkpo diwa mi di suoto. Afɔ bla di ɔlaa wɔ kɔtɔkɔ fɔ ni suoto. Tɔɔkyɛ falaamufũ ma fawakoe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Nioso aasifi aalaamufũ ma aawako ɔya, ni aawa alesaa ya di ote mbɔmbɔ ni aatɔɔ nɛ. Fɛ mmle okle ammiɛ alɛ bɛɛwa nya ni nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Ninfɛ di Rebeka layɔ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nɔɔfole Esau akpeele biene ya niate ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ leeyo aakpee obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bisɔnle Yakob nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Ninfɛ aayɔ batie akũ nwu ku sinwini aatĩi nwɔ nnɛɛ ku simu aba ya niaplɔplɔ ni nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Ninfɛ aayɔ alesaa biene nwu aata obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yakob ku bloblo wɔ aabla ni nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Ninfɛ di Yakob lakyɛ ote nfũ aalaabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teete nii.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Ni aatuna alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obi nii, afɔ ɔmɛnle lɛma fale?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Ni di Yakob labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami obi nɔɔfo lɛfɔ Esau dile. Fɛ mmle faatɔkɔ mi nii, nni ntɔɔlaabla nɛ. Lekoto taka fasiɛ, faawee lepoo kamɛ sina, faawii mi lɛyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Ninfɛ di Isak lakaalɛ obi nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lɛ diɛpɛ fɔ sɛwa nkpo obi nii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate Yaa lɛfɔ nwu niɛkyakaakoe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Ninfɛ di Isak latɔkɔ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpukuti fatɛɛtɛ mi ninkpanko fɔ nnyu, obi nii, ninnyu nse nwaako obisuɔtɔbi nii Esau dile ɛɛ, diele nnwɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Ninfɛ di Yakob lakpukuti aatɛɛtɛɛ ote Isak nɛ, ni aakpanko nwɔ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yakob sɛlɔ sile, kafɔɔ nnɛɛ mmi, Esau nnɛɛ dile.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Atatofo nwɔ, diekye nnɛɛ nɔɔ layila sinwini fɛ obilɛma Esau nle; nioso aawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwaako obi nii Esau dile?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yii, ami dile.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Ninfɛ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obi nii, wakoe lepoo kamɛ sina lɛfɔ nwu sewo nwee, nin-wii fɔ lɛyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:25">Ninfɛ di Yakob lawako nwɔ sina nwu aawee nɛ; ni aawako nwɔ nta nwo kafɔɔ aanyi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Ninfɛ di ote Isak latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Wa ninfũ obisuɔtɔbi nii, fabafĩfiɔ mi kokpoo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Nioso aakyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ni aafĩfiɔ nwɔ kokpoo nɛ. Di obe wɔ di Isak lanu nwɔ ni akpeele nwu ofũfũ yi, ni aawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">&lt;&lt;Awo, obi suɔtɔbi nii lekpete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">nte fɛ kofe ko di</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">Saate nwu lewii ni lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Yaa ata fɔ oblokyi di osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">aata kasɔ lɛfɔ kalɛ asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">aata fɔ atitabi ku nta fɔle kpinwu.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Nnle basumu fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">baatii kafɔɔ bawa kasɔ bata fɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Faale sɛsaate di babilee suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">yaafɔ babi kafɔɔ baawa kasɔ bata fɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Mba niɛkpaani fɔ nii, bakpaani ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">mba kafɔɔ niewii fɔ ni lɛyɔɔ, bawii ma lɛyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Di obe wɔ di Isak laloo oloo Yakob lɛyɔɔ owii, di Yakob ladie di ote anu aasifi ni yi, ni di obilɛma Esau kafɔɔ lakye kakpankɔ aawa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aalaawa alesaa biene, ni aayɔ aakyɛnko ote nɛ. Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teete nii, taka fasiɛ faawee lepoo kamɛ sina sewo, faawii mi lɛyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Ninfɛ di ote Isak lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɔ owe fale?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ kasale Esau nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Isak layɛkɛ aakyako otũtũkũ ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni owe ninle kpantɛ wɔ niɛlaakpa ɛɛwakoe ni lepoo kamɛ sina, ntoowee simuu kafɔɔ lewii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ fiɛ fatɔɔwa? Nwaako kafɔɔ babawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Obe wɔ di Esau lanu ni ote ɔlaa wɔ aabuɛ nii, ni aafaa kaku ku kudu osie kanya aatɔkɔ ote alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teete, amii, wii mi lɛyɔɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Kafɔɔ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obilee lɛwa ɛɛbakyɔnkyɔ mi eefũ fɔ lɛyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nle mmle ninle lɛnyɔɔfa ɔɔtafaa mi ni nɛ. Diɛɛbla ɔkpɛ alɛ leyooto nɔɔ ninle Yakob. Eefũ mi selofo nɔɔfo, nunua kafɔɔ atookple eefũ mi lɛyɔɔ. Ninfɛ aakaalɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni faabu lɛyɔɔ kuniwii fatɛ mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Ninfɛ di Isak latɔkɔ Esau alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntɔɔbla nwɔ saate di suoto lɛfɔ, ntɔɔbla banantii nɔɔ bamuu kafɔɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ. Lɛyɔ atitabi ku nta kafɔɔ lɛtɔɔ. Ni be nfɛ kamakple nfuo fɔ ɔbla ɔta, obi nii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Ninfɛ di Esau lakaalɛ ote alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teete nii, ni lɛyɔɔ ninwii ko ninkpe fɔ? Amii wii mi lɛyɔɔ teete! Ninfɛ di Esau lawi kaku osie kanya nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Ninfɛ di ote Isak latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">&lt;&lt;Kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">kamakyo di kasɔ ka mmle lɛlɛ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">kankyo di osi oblokyi suoto.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Kapamii lɛfɔ suoto fabasiɛ nkpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">fabale obilee kpɛmblatɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Nse fɛɛtaka feeyila nwɔ di suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">fabadie nwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">kaalɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakob Latoso Aasifi Laban Nfũ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Esau lakpee Yakob di otu kamɛ ta lɛyɔɔ le di ote layɔ aatɔɔ ni oso. Ninfɛ aabuɛ di otu nɔɔ kamɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teemi okpibee diesinkyo, nse nfɛ busi kaku yi, ni kamalo Yakob.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Di obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Rebeka ɔlaa wɔ di obi nɔɔ nɔɔfole Esau labuɛ nii, ninfɛ aakpee baalɛɛ Yakob baatɔɔ ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyu lo, obilee Esau ntɔɔbla disibu alɛ abalo fɔ. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Nioso obi nii, nu ɔlaa wɔ kɔtɔkɔ fɔ ni: Toso wla fasifi obiloo suɔtɔbi Laban nfũ di Haran. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Falaasiɛ ninfa kɛɛkɛ, diɛlaase di obe wɔ di obilee ɔblɔ mayɔɔ ni. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Nse obilee ɔblɔ ntɔɔyɔɔ nwɔ atoodiɛ lɛsaale faabla nwɔ ni yi, kamatika fɔ kanya fankple fanwa. Obe oso di banyɔ lee biakpi mi di dii ninwii nkpo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Ninfɛ di Rebeka latɔkɔ Isak alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkpa osiɛ ntootuudi mi ta Esau basɔfɔ, Hiti basanko nwu nkpo oso. Nse Yakob lediki ɔsanko di kasɔ ka mmle suoto di Hiti basanko kamɛ fɛ mma mmle, ni diesinsiɛko alɛ kasiɛ nkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="s1">Isak Lawii Yakob Lɛyɔɔ Aadiki Nwɔ Osuku Aasifi Laban Nfũ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Nioso Isak lalɛɛ Yakob aawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ, ni aakpee nwɔ kufiofa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tan-yɔ Kanaan batii ɔsanko. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Pɛsɛwa faatɔɔkyɛ Padan Aram <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.2</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mesopotamia </char></note> di ɔwa lɛfɔ Betuel leyo kamɛ faalaadiki ɔsanko ninfa, di ɔfa lɛfɔ Laban basankobi kamɛ fayɔ. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Yaa wɔ ninlenke ni awii fɔ lɛyɔɔ, aata fɔ falofo fakpɛ dilaase di obe wɔ feekple ni nnle kpinwu kote. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Aawii afɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ lɛyɔɔ fɛ mmle okle aawii ni Abraham lɛyɔɔ, faafũ kasɔ ka mmle suoto fasi ni fɛ ɔfɔɔ kakple fɔ atesaa, kasɔ ka di Yaa lɛyɔ ɛɛta ni Abraham.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Ninfɛ di Isak ladiki Yakob osuku aasifi Padan Aram, dile ni Betuel Aram obisuɔtɔbi Laban nfũ, nnwɔ ninle ni, Rebeka obilɛma suɔtɔbi ale ni Yakob ku Esau ɔfa.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau Lakple Aayɔ Ɔsanko Bamba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Di obe wɔ di Esau latofo alɛ Isak ntoowii ni Yakob lɛyɔɔ, aakyesee nwɔ ni Padan Aram alɛ aalaadiki ni ɔsanko ninfa, aatofo kafɔɔ alɛ di Isak lawii nwɔ ni lɛyɔɔ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tan-yɔ ni Kanaan batii ɔsanko&gt;&gt; yi, <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />aatofo kafɔɔ alɛ Yakob lanu ote ku ɔya ɔlaa aasifi Padan Aram. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Nioso Esau latofo alɛ ni Kanaan batii basanko diɛlɛ ote Isak. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Nioso aasifi aalaayɔ Nebaiot obilɛma sankobi Mahalat ninle ni Abraham obisuɔtɔbi Ismael obisankobi aakyakaa di basɔfɔ suoto nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakob Lasɛ Kɔlaafɔ Di Betel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakob ladie di Beerseba ni aayefe osuku aasifi Haran nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Obe wɔ aadu ni lɛba ninwii, kaale ntooloo nii, ni aate nfa nɛ, diekye kufĩ lamɛɛ. Ni aayɔ difuɔ ninwii ninfa, aayɔ disi aatika, ni aate nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Ni aasɛ kɔlaafɔ aanya nkyɔdiɛ nnwii lakye osi diabase kaasɔ nɛ. Ni aanya Yaa batɔkyɛntɛ layie baatoosoo nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Ninfɛ aanya Saate n-yɛ nwɔ di anu, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle ɔwa lɛfɔ Abraham ku Isak Yaa. Kamayɔ kasɔ ka mmle suoto fate ni nta afɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Banantii lɛfɔ kamapɔ fɛle kasɔ ka mmle kudu, bibakpɛ minaadu kufĩ katũnkɔ ku kamɛɛkɔ, katoo ku kala kasɔ. Diefe ni di afɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ suoto babawii batii bamuu kaasɔ ka mmle lɛyɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Nsiko fɔ, kakɔ lele kafɔɔ fabakyɛ kamanyu fɔ, kamakplesa fɔ kafɔɔ nwako kasɔ ka mmle suoto. Namadiɛ fɔ nnɛɛ diɛlaase di obe wɔ ntɔɔbla lɛsaa le labuɛ nlɛ kamabla nta fɔ nii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Obe wɔ di Yakob lasɛnkɛ ni sɛɛkyɔsĩ, ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwaako Saate nsi ninfũ mmle, kafɔɔ nintofo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Nioso lɛyɛkɛ lapɛ nwɔ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lɛba le mmle lɛyɛkɛ nsi! Yaa leyo ninle nfũ; Yaa kafa kayoko kale.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Kaleesɛ ku kuyitatũ Yakob lataka, ni aayɔ difuɔ le aayɔ aatika ni disi, aase fɛ nsũ lɛtɛsaa, ninfɛ aanyɛɛnɛ nnɔnyi aakpete ni di suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Ninfɛ aalɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Betel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.19</char><char style="ft" closed="false">lɛsɔdiki ninle Yaa leyo</char></note> nɛ. Saa, okpoo nwu nkpo baatɔɔlɛɛ Lus nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Ninfɛ di Yakob laka ntam aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nse Yaa kamasiɛkoe annyu mi di osuku wɔ kofe nii, antɛɛ alesaa nle antɛɛ aklesaa nii kafɔɔ, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />nkple nwa teemi leyo buɛɛ yi, ni Saate nwu kamale mi Yaa. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Ni nsũ lɛtɛsaa difuɔ le mmle lese ni ninfũ, kamale lɛba le babasũmu fɔ nii. Ni asaa ya amuu fɛtɛɛ ni kafɔɔ kamata fɔ dikyuu fosile nɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yakob Lakyɛ Aalaabuo Laban Leyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Yakob layefe osuku aasifi ni aalaadu kufĩ katunkɔ batii nsɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Ni aanya ditubiɔ ninwii late di kasɔ nwu suoto, bafoso akyuu atiɛ nte ni di ɔlɔɔkɔ; diekye ditubiɔ nwu kamɛ mandu ntu manta bafoso nwu nkpo nnyi nɛ. Difuɔ dibinte latĩi ditubiɔ nwu kanya. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Obe lele nse bafoso nwu nkpo bamuu ntɔbasi yi, nse bafosobakpatɛ nwu ntoomunusa difuɔ nwu di ditubiɔ nwu kanya bɛɛta bafoso nwu ntu beenyi. Nse batookple beemunusa difuɔ nwu beetĩi ditubiɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakob lakaalɛ bafosobakpatɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Babiloo, ɔfɛ biekye?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Buokye Haran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Ninfɛ aakaalɛ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Biye Laban, Nahor ɔwa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yii, buye nwɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Ninfɛ di Yakob lakaalɛ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Sikpe nwɔ osie?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yii, sikpe nwɔ osie, nnya obisankobi nɔɔ Rahel nikɔwa ku bafoso nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Ninfɛ di Yakob labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Binyu, kale diiloo biakpee ni bafoso nwu. Bita ma ntu banyi biekplesa ma bisifiko baalawee sɛfa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Ninfɛ baadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bulɔbafuo ɔbla nkpo diɛlaase di obe wɔ di bafoso nwu bamuu ntoosi ni fiɛ bubamunusa difuɔ nwu di ditubiɔ nwu kanya munta ma ntu mannyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Di obe wɔ ayɛ ɔɔkakatɛko ma nii, ni di Rahel lakye aawa ku ote bafoso nɛ, diekye ɔsanko bafosokpatɛ aale. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Di obe wɔ di Yakob lanya ni ɔfa nɔɔ Laban obisankobi Rahel ku bafoso nɔɔ yi, ni aakyɛ aalaamunusa difuɔ nwu di ditubiɔ nwu kanya aata ɔfa nɔɔ bafoso ntu baanyi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Ninfɛ di Yakob lafĩfĩɔ Rahel akpoo nɛ, ninfɛ aakyako kaku owi nɛ, ta suoto lɛyɔɔ oso. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ Rahel alɛ, teefɔ ɔnantii nle, Rebeka obisuɔtɔbi nle. Nioso Rahel latoso aasifi aalaatɔkɔ ote.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Nfanwu, di Laban lanu ni Yakob ɔlaa wɔ mmle alɛ obilɛma sankobi obisuɔtɔbi ale nii, ni aapɛsɛwa aalaakyakako nwɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ aaminiko nwɔ, aafĩfĩɔ nwɔ akpoo, ni aakpaa nwɔ aasifiko leyo nɛ. Nfa nfɛ di Yakob latɔkɔ nwɔ sɛlaa se mmle simuu nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Ninfɛ di Laban latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami omu ntɔ fale.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 29:14">Yakob Layɔ Lea Ku Rahel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:14">Obe wɔ di Yakob lasiɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ kɔwɛntɛ, <verse eid="GEN 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />ni di Laban latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Di ami omu ɔnantii fale nii, faabla ɔkpɛ fantɛɛ kasakasa? Tɔkɔ mi lɛsaa le fabafũ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Laban lawɛ babisankobi banyɔ, ɔkasale leyooto niale Lea, ɔnyɔɔfa leyooto niale Rahel. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea anu kaamɛ labla buɛɛ, kafɔɔ Rahel lalɛ sekpeele kaakɔ biala. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Nioso Yakob labɔmbɔ Rahel ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kamabla ɔkpɛ nta fɔ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ fan-yɔ obisankobi lɛfɔ Rahel fantɛɛ n-yɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Ninfɛ di Laban labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Dilɛ dilenke alɛ kayɔ nwɔ nta fɔ fan-yɔ, alɛ kayɔ nwɔ nta osuɔtɔ bamba. Siɛ di ɔkyɛ nii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Nioso Yakob labla ɔkpɛ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ alɛ aayɔ Rahel, ote ko diate nwɔ fɛ ayi asɛɛ ko dile ta lɛbɔmbɔ le aawɛ aatɔɔ ni osie kanya oso.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Ninfɛ di Yakob latɔkɔ Laban alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɔ ɔsɔfɔ nii fatɛɛ, diekye obe nii ntoowo, komiɛ nlɛ munko nwɔ bute.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Nioso Laban lawa ɔsanko ɔyɔ alesaa aakyakako batii bamuu ninfa. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ di kale laloo nii, Laban layɔ obisankobi nɔɔ Lea aata Yakob, ni manko Yakob baalate nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Ni di Laban layɔ ɔlanle sankobi nɔɔ Silfa aata obisankobi nɔɔ Lea alɛ ale nwɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Obe wɔ kaale lasɛ nii, Lea di Yakob lanya. Nioso Yakob lakaalɛ Laban alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obe lɛsaa fɛɛbla mi nkpo nɛ? Diele Rahel labla ɔkpɛ lata fɔ nlɛ kɔyɔ? Ni be lɛsaa oso nfɛ fɛɛkyɔnkyɔ mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Ni di Laban ladiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Di okpoo loo ɔsaabla kanya yi, man-yɔ obi bisɔ baata kɔsa fiɛ di ɔnɔɔfole. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Nioso afɔ yɛntɛ nawɔkyi wɔ mmle ɔsanko ɔyɔ ɔsaabla, ni kamayɔ obisɔnle kafɔɔ nta fɔ, nse fabakple fambla ɔkpɛ fantɛɛ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ bamba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakob latuna di ɔlaa nwu suoto. Nioso aaloo ni nawɔkyi nwu nkpo ɔsaabla ku Lea yi, ni di Laban layɔ Rahel obisankobi nɔɔ kafɔɔ aatɔɔ aayɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Ni di Laban layɔ ɔlanle sankobi nɔɔ Bilha aata obisankobi nɔɔ Rahel alɛ ale nwɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Ninfɛ di Yakob late ku Rahel kafɔɔ nɛ, aabɔmbɔ Rahel aalenkee Lea. Ninfɛ di Yakob lakple aabla ɔkpɛ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ bamba aata Laban nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakob Babi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Obe wɔ di SAATE nwu lanya alɛ Yakob dilɔɔbɔmbɔ ni Lea yi, ni aatɔɔ aakyako babi olofo nɛ, kafɔɔ Rahel layibla ɔlɛma. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lea labalaka lɛmɛ ni aalofo obisuɔtɔbi nɛ. Ninfɛ aatɔɔ leyooto alɛ Ruben nɛ. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ta di Saate ntɔɔnyɛɛ ni nyaami oso, lefũ lenu nlɛ ɔsa nii nfɛ mabɔmbɔ mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 29:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Aakple aalaka lɛmɛ, ni aalofo osuɔtɔbi bamba nɛ. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;SAATE nwu ntookple ɛɛtɛɛ osuɔtɔbi wɔ mmle kafɔɔ, diekye aanu alɛ batabɔmbɔ mi,&gt;&gt; nioso aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Simeon.<verse eid="GEN 29:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Aakple aalaka lɛmɛ, ni aalofo osuɔtɔbi bamba nɛ. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nunua ɔsa nii nfɛ manuankaa mi di suoto diekye ntoolofo babisuɔtɔbi batiɛ lɛtɔɔ.&gt;&gt; Ninfɛ aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Lewi nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Aakple aalaka lɛmɛ, ni aalofo osuɔtɔbi bamba nɛ. Ninfɛ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nunua kamatansa Saate nwu,&gt;&gt; nioso aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Yuda. Ninfɛ aadiɛ babi olofo nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Di obe wɔ di Rahel lanya alɛ oloolofo obi kuonwii ata ni Yakob yi, diakple nwɔ onunsɛɛ di obilɛma suoto, ni aatɔkɔ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tɛɛ babi nlofo, se diele nkpo kamakpi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Ninfɛ di Yakob lanya ɔblɔ aakpeeko Rahel, ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle Yaa wɔ nienii fɔ ni olofofɔtɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnya kpɛmblatɛ nii Bilha, tenko nwɔ aalaka lɛmɛ aalofo babi atɛɛ, alɛ ami kafɔɔ kawɛ babi diefe ni di suoto nɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Nioso aayɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Bilha aatɔɔ fɛ ɔsɔfɔ. Ninfɛ di Yakob latenko nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Ninfɛ aalaka lɛmɛ aalofo obisuɔtɔbi aatɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Ninfɛ di Rahel labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yaa lɛtɛɛ lɛbɛ, eenu mi sɛlɔ ɛɛtɛɛ obisuɔtɔbi.&gt;&gt; Ta nkpo oso, ni aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Dan nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Rahel kpɛmblatɛ Bilha lakple aalaka lɛmɛ ni aalofo obisuɔtɔbi nyɔɔfa aata Yakob nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Ninfɛ di Rahel labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntɔɔkpɛ kakpɛ siene ku obiloo lelenkee. &lt;&lt;Nioso aatika obi nwu nkpo leyooto alɛ Naftali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Obe wɔ di Lea lanya alɛ oloosinwɛ obi alofo nii, ni di nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aayɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Silpa aata Yakob fɛ ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Ninfɛ di Lea kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Silpa kafɔɔ lalofo obisuɔtɔbi aata Yakob nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Ni di Lea labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Disi nlɛ mi!&gt;&gt; Ni aatika obi nwu leyooto alɛ Gad nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Lea kpɛmblatɛ Silpa lakple aalofo obisuɔtɔbi nyɔɔfa aata Yakob. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Ni di Lea labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nyu mmle di suoto kɔyɔɔ mi ni! Basanko malɛɛ mi suoto lɛyɔɔ.&gt;&gt; Nioso aatika obi nwu leyooto alɛ Aser.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Di akpaa ofeebee yi, Ruben lakyɛ kofe ni aalaawɛ ɔfa onwii manlɛɛ ni mandrake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kule ɔfa wɔ baatii lefũ beenu alɛ kule ni kolofofa</char></note> nɛ. Ni aayɔ nwu aawako ɔya Lea nɛ. Ninfɛ di Rahel lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lekoto tikɛɛ mandrake lɛfɔ nwu nkpo kowoɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni diɛpɔ fɔ alɛ feekle mi kɔsa feefũ di nnɛɛ? Ni falɛ fookple fanfũ obi nii mandrake wɔ mmle nɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Ninfɛ di Rahel latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Dilɛ, ta abate di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ miɛ kakyɛ di obi lɛfɔ mandrake nwu kanya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Nioso obe wɔ di Yakob lakye kofe aawa ni ku kɔtɔɔfɔ nwu nkpo yi, ni di Lea lakyɛ aalaakyakako nwɔ, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔkyɛ nii fabate miɛ kakyɛ, diekye lɛyɔ obi nii mandrake lɛta koto diisi lɛfɔ.&gt;&gt; Nioso aalaate di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ku kakyɛ nwu nkpo.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Yaa lanu Lea diwilɛɛ, ni aalaka lɛmɛ aalofo obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔnle aata Yakob nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Ninfɛ di Lea labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yaa ntɔɔtɛɛ koto alɛ layɔ kpɛmblatɛ nii sanko lata ɔsa nii.&gt;&gt; Nioso aatika obi nwu leyooto alɛ Isakar.<verse eid="GEN 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Lea lakple aalaka lɛmɛ ni aalofo obisuɔtɔbi kuɔnle aata Yakob nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Ni di Lea labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yaa lɛtɛɛ lɛkyɛsaa le niefũ ni kɔya. Nunua ɔsa nii nfɛ mafũ mi ku dibu, diekye ntoolofo obisuɔtɔbi kuɔnle lɛtɔɔ.&gt;&gt; Nioso aatika obi nwu leyooto alɛ Sebulun.<verse eid="GEN 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Di obe owo sɛmaa aalofo obisankobi ni aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Dina nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Ninfɛ di Yaa lanya Rahel nyaami, aanu nwɔ diwilɛɛ, ni aafukuti nwɔ olofofɔtɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Ninfɛ aalaka lɛmɛ, aalofo obisuɔtɔbi ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yaa ntootekete mi sinunsɔ di suoto.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate akyakaa mi osuɔtɔbi bamba,&gt;&gt; ni aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Yosef nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakob Babɔkɛɛ Labakpɛ Osie Kanya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Di Rahel lalofo Yosef aaloo ni sɛmaa, ni di Yakob latɔkɔ Laban alɛ, &lt;&lt;Diki mi osuku ninkple nsifi okpoo loo. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Faadiɛkoe basɔfɔ nii ku babi nii ba oso labla ɔkpɛ lata fɔ ni, ninsifi.<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Ni di Laban labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nse faale mi sibualɛ, lekoto ni faasiɛ. Diekye ntɔɔnya nlɛ, Saate ntoole mi sibualɛ ta afɔ oso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Ni aakple aabuɛ aakyakaa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɔ buɛ, koto lele fabafũ yi, kamata nta fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Ninfɛ di Yakob latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Faye mmle okle ntɔɔbla ɔkpɛ lɛta fɔ nii, ku mmle okle di bafoso lɛfɔ ntɔɔkpɛ ni di nnɛɛ nii kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Bafoso kɛɛkɛɛ ko niawɛ fɔ fiɛ lawa, kafɔɔ batɔɔkpɛ osie kanya. Kakɔ lele lakyɛ Saate nwu lawii fɔ lɛyɔɔ. Ni nunua mɔ, ɔmɛmbe di amii kamabla lɛsaa lewo nta suoto ku babi nii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Ninfɛ di Laban lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obe lɛsaa nimbla nta fɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Ninfɛ di Yakob latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Noofũ fɔ lɛsalɛsaa. Kafɔɔ lɛsaa ninwii ko komiɛ nlɛ fabla fatɛɛ, tɛɛ naatoonyu bafoso lɛfɔ nintɔɔkpa ma: <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Tɛɛ naakyi babɔkɛɛ lɛfɔ bamuu kamɛ nindiki foso biala niɛpɛpɛɛ ni ee mba niɛkpakpana ni, foso biala niɛwɔfɔ ku tie biala niɛpɛpɛɛ ni ku mba niɛkpakpana ni. Mma nimale mi letota nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Ni di kayi kamaa yi, fabafuo otofo nse lale onukwale lata fɔ. Ni obe lele nse fɛɛbanyu letota le fɛɛtɛɛ nii, tie lele fɛɛnyakoe, anampɛpɛɛ ee aakpakpana ee foso lele ninanwɔfɔ, ni faatofo falɛ oyu leyu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Ninfɛ di Laban labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Letũna fɛ mmle fatoobuɛ nii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Di dii nwu nkpo kale Laban ladiki ntiekpaa be mmuu niapɛpɛɛ ni ku mba niakpakpana ni ku batie sanko ba bamuu niapɛpɛɛ ni ku (bamuu ba di asaa fututu lakaa ni di suoto) ku bafoso wɛɛfɛɛ bamuu, ni aayɔ aata babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ alɛ atɔɔkpa ma nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Ninfɛ aatɔɔ aabla di Yakob suoto di ayi atiɛ osuku ɔkyɛ nɛ. Ni di Yakob lakple aatoonyu Laban babɔkɛɛ bule nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Ninfɛ di Yakob labudi ewosola kɔɔnle etiɛ sɛla ninle ni lɛnyanyambii, lɛkpati, ku kɔnyaa. Ninfɛ aafifiɛ sewosola nwu apoo awo aapusa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Ninfɛ aalaayɔ sewosola nwu nkpo aafifiɛ ni apoo aalaase di babɔkɛɛ nwu nkpo ntu ninyinsaa anu nɛ. Aayɔ aalaase ninfa diekye nse babɔkɛɛ nwu nkpo lɛwa ntu onyi, manyie bawo. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Nse booyie bawo di sewosola nwu nkpo beefifiɛ ni anu yi, manlofo babi ba niɛpɛpɛɛ ni ku mba niɛkpakpana nii. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Bafoso ba di Yakob latoonyu aatɔɔta ni Laban bawo lakpakpana. Nioso nse nfɛ booyie bawo yi, annyu alɛ bɛɛyɔ anu bɛɛkyɔɔ mba niɛkpakpana ni ku bawɛɛfɛɛ nwu nkpo. Nkpo di Yakob labla aawɛ bafoso dikudi aata suoto nɛ. Ni aatoodiki ma di Laban bale kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Obe lele di babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni osie koyie bawo yi, Yakob n-yɔ sewosola nwu beefifiɛ ni apoo awo aanaase di ntu ninyinsaa nwu anu, alɛ nse boolofo yi, baalofo babi di sewosola nwu letembi kanya. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Kafɔɔ nse babɔkɛɛ ba ninaa ni osie koyie bawo yi, ɔlabayɔ sewosola nwu nkpo aalaase di ntu ninyinsaa nwu anu, alɛ babɔkɛɛ nwu ninaa ni osie kakple Laban bale kafɔɔ mba ninkpe ni osie nkple Yakob bale. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Di osuku wɔ mmle suoto, ni di Yakob labakple saawɛntɛ kplɛ nɛ. Aawɛ babɔkɛɛ kpinwu, balanle, babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo ku kapubapɔnkɔ.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yakob Latoso Di Laban Ɔkyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Yakob lanu mmle di Laban babisuɔtɔbi latoobuɛ ni alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yakob ntoofũ lɛsaa biala ninkpe ni teewo, lɛsaawɛ le nimuu ninkpe nwɔ nii teewo nfũ diekye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Yakob kafɔɔ latofo alɛ manko Laban kasiɛ ntookyi.<verse eid="GEN 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kple fasifi bate lɛfɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ kasɔ suoto, kamasiɛko fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Nioso Yakob lata Rahel ku Lea kanya alɛ badie bawa kofe di nfũ di babɔkɛɛ nɔɔ n-yɛ ni. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntɔɔnya nlɛ teeye nkpa ntookyi di suoto nii, kafɔɔ teemi Yaa nsiko mi. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Biye bilɛ ntɔɔbla ɔkpɛ ku osie nii omuu lɛta teeye,<verse eid="GEN 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />kafɔɔ teeye lɛtafaa mi, aakyɛlɛnsa mi kɔkpɛnto lefosi simu. Kafɔɔ Yaa diɛta osuku abla mi dikpile. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Nse eebuɛ alɛ, &lt;Babɔkɛɛ ba niɛpɛpɛɛ ni nimale letota lɛfɔ,&gt; di babɔkɛɛ bamuu lelofo abi ya niɛpɛpɛɛ ni; nse eebuɛ alɛ, &lt;Mba di akpana ntika ni nimale letota lɛfɔ,&gt; di babɔkɛɛ bamuu lelofo abi ya niɛkpakpana ni. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Nioso Yaa ntoofũ teefɔ babɔkɛɛ ninnɛɛ ɛɛyɔ ɛɛtɛɛ.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />&lt;&lt;Di obe wɔ di babɔkɛɛ n-yie ni bawo kamɛ, lasɛ kɔlaafɔ lanya ntiekpaa be niɛpɛpɛɛ, diɛkpakpana ni ku mbe ninte ni abadi abadi koyie batiesanko. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Ni di Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ latɔkɔ mi di kɔlaafɔ nwu kamɛ alɛ, &lt;Yakob.&gt; Ni latuna nlɛ, &lt;Nnyɛɛ.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;Takatɛsa anu faanyu ntiekpaa be mmuu niɛpɛpɛɛ ni ee niɛkpakpana ni ee mbe ninte ni abadi abadi koyie batiesanko. Diekye ntɔɔnya mmle di Laban kɔbla fɔ nii. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Ami ninle Yaa wɔ niadiki suoto latuo fɔ ni di Betel, lɛba le faakpete ni nnɔnyi di difuɔ suoto faaka ntam faatɛɛ nii. Nunua lolaa suoto faadie di kasɔ ka mmle, fasifi banantii lɛfɔ kasɔ suoto.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Ninfɛ di Rahel ku Lea lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Awo kafɔɔ bukpe kalekɔ di teewo atesaa kamɛ? <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Diele onyu nfɛ oonyu wo fɛle bafɔɔ nɛ? Diele osunsũ lete eesunsũ wo, kafɔɔ atɔɔblako koto ko baata ni diisi loo ɔkpɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Nwaako asaa ya amuu di Yaa lefũ ni di teewo nfũ, awo ku babiloo ale nfɛ ale. Nioso bla fɛle mmle di Yaa latɔkɔ fɔ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Ninfɛ di Yakob layɔ babi ku basɔfɔ aatika di kapubapɔnkɔ suoto nɛ, <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />ni aatɔɔ babɔkɛɛ nɔɔ bamuu ku asaa nɔɔ ya amuu aawɛ ni di Padan Aram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mesopotamia</char></note> baale katũ ni baayefe osuku baasifi ote Isak nfũ di Kanaan kasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Di obe wɔ di Laban lasifi ni bafoso nɔɔ sinwini kanwiɛkɔ, Rahel layu ote leyo kamɛ afiɔ aayɔ. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Kafɔɔ Yakob lakyɔnkyɔ Laban Aram otii nwu, atatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ ootoso ansifi. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Nioso aatoso ku asaa nɔɔ ya amuu aawɛ nii, aataalɛ okle,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.21</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Efrat okle</char></note> aakyɔɔ Gilead kobokote anu.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Laban Lati Yakob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Di dii tiɛfa suoto baatɔkɔ Laban alɛ Yakob ntootoso. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Nioso aakpaa banantii nɔɔ, ni aati Yakob ayi akuɛnsĩ, ni aalaatũ nwɔ di Gilead kobokote kale nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Ni di Yaa lawa Laban, Aram otii nfũ ku kakyɛ nwu di kɔlaafɔ kamɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lolaa fanyu alɛ faabuɛ ɔlaa okpile kuonwii fatɔkɔ Yakob.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Yakob lapɛ lɛkpaayo nɔɔ di Gilead kale kobokote osi fiɛ di Laban labatũ nwɔ, ni di Laban ku batii nɔɔ kafɔɔ labasiɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Ni di Laban lakaalɛ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be fɛɛbla nɛ? Fɛɛkyɔnkyɔ mi, fɛɛkpaa babisankobi nii feesifiko fɛle kakpɛ beemufũ ma. <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Obe oso fɛɛkyɔnkyɔ mi feetoso leewofa kamɛ? Obe oso fatatɔkɔ mi, nindiki fɔ osuku ku suoto lɛyɔɔ ku sinu, abi ku basanku ɔsa? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Fatatɛɛ nfifiɔ babisankobi nii ku bawa nii akpoo ndiki ma osuku. Dibuusaa fɛɛbla nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Nkpe osuku alɛ kabla fɔ lɛsaa; kafɔɔ kɔsa ku kakyɛ teefɔ Yaa latɔkɔ mi alɛ, &lt;Lolaa fanyu alɛ faabuɛ ɔlaa okpile kuonwii fatɔkɔYakob.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Nunua n-ye nlɛ teefɔ leyo osifi nkle fɔ ɔkɔnsɔ. Kafɔɔ be oso feeyu afiɔ nii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakob ladiki kanya aatɔkɔ Laban alɛ, &lt;&lt;Latɔɔyɛkɛ, diekye lanyu nlɛ fabafũ babisankobi lɛfɔ di nnɛɛ nii ku osie. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Kafɔɔ otii lele ɔkyɛ fɛɛnya afiɔ lɛfɔ, diɛkaatɛ ansiɛ nkpa. Di batii loo anu, nyu afɔ omu nse lɛsaa lɛfɔ lewo nsi di asaa nii kamɛ; nse disi, faadiki.&gt;&gt; Kafɔɔ Yakob ditatofo alɛ Rahel layu afiɔ nwu.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Nioso Laban labuo Yakob lɛkpaayo kamɛ, Lea lɛkpaayo kamɛ ku basanko bakpɛmblatɛ banyɔ nwu akpaayo kamɛ kafɔɔ atanya lɛsalɛsaa. Aadie ni di Lea lɛkpaayo kamɛ ni aabuo Rahel lɛkpaayo nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Rahel niayɔ leyo nwu afiɔ, aayɔ nya aakpee di kapupɔnkɔ nɔɔ disiɛsaa kamɛ aasiɛ nya di suoto, Laban lawolaa lɛsaa biala kamɛ di lɛkpaayo nwu kamɛ aafenko kafɔɔ atanya lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="GEN 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Rahel latɔkɔ ote alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teete nii, tannya ɔblɔ, nɔmafuo ɔtaka oyila di anu lɛfɔ; diekye lɛpɛ kɔkpaa kaasɔ.&gt;&gt; Nioso Laban lawolaa kafɔɔ atanya leyo lɛma afiɔ nwu.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Ɔblɔ lafiɛ Yakob di Laban suoto osie kanya. Ni aakaalɛ Laban alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be ɔlaa kule nkpo?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ɔmɛnkpile lɛbla fiɛ foowolaa mi kaanya nkpo? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Nunua fatɔɔkpɛnkpɛ ni asaa nii amuu kamɛ, obe lɛsaa fɛɛnya dile leyo lɛfɔ batii lele? Yɔ ni fatɛ di batii lɛfɔ ku bale mi anu baawolaa kamɛ bata batii loo banyɔ.<verse eid="GEN 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />&lt;&lt;Alɛɛ afosi anyɔ ntosiɛ ni di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ nɛ. Kafutu diedie bafoso ku batie lɛfɔ kuonwii, ee mmufũ fɔ dikunumuu kuninwii nlo di babɔkɛɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Diidii ntayɔ babɔkɛɛ ba di babɔkɛɛ kplɛ labɛbɛɛ ni matuo fɔ; layɔ ma latika di suoto nii. Faabu mba di bayu layu ni ku kakũ ee kakyɛ koto faatɛɛ lata lata fɔ. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Nnya mmle diate mi ni: kufĩ lapɛ mi ku kakũ, lɛwɔɔfɔ laklee mi ku kakyɛ, sɛkyɔsĩ labudi mi di anu. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Nkpo diate alɛɛ afosi anyɔ amu lasiɛ ni di leyo lɛfɔ nɛ. Labla ɔkpɛ lefosi alɛɛ ana di babisankobi lɛfɔ banyɔ disi, alɛɛ akuɔ kafɔɔ layɔ lanyu babɔkɛɛ lɛfɔ, kafɔɔ faakyɛlɛnsa kɔkpɛnto nii lefosi simu. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Nse fɛle teemi Yaa ku Abraham Yaa ku Isak Yaa Lɛyɛkɛ ditansiɛkoe, nse nkpo faatɛɛ lasifi nnɛɛ fukuti nɛ. Kafɔɔ Yaa lanya dibuo nii ku okyiini nii ɔkpɛ ɔbla, ni kɔɔsa ku kakyɛ aasĩ ɔlaa aata fɔ nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Ni di Laban latɔkɔ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Basanko nwu, babisankobi nii bale, babi lɛma bawa nii bale, babɔkɛɛ lɛma kafɔɔ babɔkɛɛ nii bale. Asaa amuu fɔɔnya ni ale mi ale. Kafɔɔ be mablako babisankobi nii ba mmle miɛ, ee babi ba batoolofo ni? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Wa buonii kanya, ami ku afɔ, diɛbla kamaadiyilasaa dita batii loo banyɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Nioso Yakob layɔ difuɔ aase fɛle nsũ lɛtɛsaa. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Ni aatɔkɔ batii nɔɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bisiisa afuɔ awo.&gt;&gt; Nioso baasiisa nya baabla afuɔ ditii, ni baale alesaa di afuɔ ditii nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Ni di Laban lalɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Yegar Sahaduta,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.47</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yegar Sahaduta lɛsɔdiki ninle kamaadiyilasaa ditii di Aram sele nɛ.</char></note> ni di Yakob lalɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ, Galed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.47</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Galed lɛsɔdiki ninle kamaadiyilasaa ditii di Hebri sele nɛ. </char></note> nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Ni di Laban labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Afuɔ ditii le mmle ninle kamaadiyilasaa di ami ku afɔ ntɛɛ miɛ.&gt;&gt; Nkpo oso bɔɔlɛɛ lɛba nwu Galed nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Mankple manlɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Mispa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.49</char><char style="ft" closed="false">lɛsɔdiki ninle lɛba le mantika mannyunyu ni</char></note> diekye aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Saate nwu atoonyu ami ku afɔ se butɔɔbla baawo suoto. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Nse fɛɛbla babisankobi nii amumu ee fɛɛyɔ basanko bamba di babisankobi nii sɛmaa, se kuntɛ otii kuonwii nnaa wo di ɔkyɛ, nyuma falɛ Yaa ninle ami ku afɔ kamaayilatɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Laban lakple aatɔkɔ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnya afuɔ ditii ninfũ, nnya leke lɛtɛ ni ninfũ di ami ku afɔ ntɛɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Afuɔ ditii le mmle ku leke le mmle ninle kamaadiyilasaa, ni oso ami namataalɛ afuɔ ditii le mmle nwa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ makpee fɔ kubuɛ, afɔ kafɔɔ flɔbataalɛ afuɔ ditii ku leke le mmle fawa ɔkyɛ nii fabakpee mi kubuɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Abraham Yaa ku Nahor Yaa ku ote lɛma Yaa aka ata akyuu loo anyɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 31:53">Nioso Yakob laka ntam di ote Isak leyooto Lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Ni di Yakob lata ole di kobokote kale nwu aalɛɛ batii nɔɔ babale alesaa nɛ. Baaloo ni ole, kakyɛ nwu baate ninfa.<verse eid="GEN 31:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Kaleesɛ ku kuyitatũ Laban lafifiɔ bawa nɔɔ ku babisankobi akpoo, aawii ma lɛyɔɔ. Ni aadie aakple aasifi kafa nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yakob Lalolaa Suoto Aakyakako Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Yakob kafɔɔ lasifi osuku nɔɔ, ni di Yaa batɔkyɛntɛ lakyakako nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Obe wɔ di Yakob lanya ma nii, ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnya Yaa kasiɛkɔ!&gt;&gt; Nioso aatika lɛba nwu leyooto alɛ Mahanaim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mahanaim leɛsɔdiki ninle nsiɛkɔ nnyɔ</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yakob lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ aalesa katũ alɛ balaanya obilɛma Esau di Seir kasɔ suoto di Edom kale. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Aatɔkɔ ma alɛ: &lt;&lt;Nnya ɔlaa wɔ biɛtɔkɔ ni saate nii Esau bilɛ: &lt;Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Yakob alɛ, ntoosiɛ di Laban ɔkyɛ, ni lɛka ninfa diɛbase bia nua nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Nkpe banankyue ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo ku bafoso ku batie, basuɔtɔ bakpɛmblatɛ ku basanko bakpɛmblatɛ. Nunua saate nii, kɔta fɔ kanya nlɛ nyɛɛ nyaami di anu lɛfɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Obe wɔ di batɔkyɛntɛ nwu lakple baawa ni Yakob nfũ, baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Buakyɛ bualaanya obilee Esau, nioso nfɛ ɔɔwa amakyakako fɔ ku basuɔtɔ alafa ana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Nioso lɛyɛkɛ ku difu lata Yakob lasɛ batii ba niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di akyuu anyɔ, nkpo kafɔɔ aasɛ bafoso, batie, banankyue ku kapubapɔnkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Aanyu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nse Esau lɛwa ɛɛbakpɛko dikudi ninwii, ni ninwii le niebu ni katoso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Ni di Yakob lɛpɛ ɔlaa alɛ, &lt;&lt;O teemi Abraham Yaa, teemi Isak Yaa, O Saate, afɔ niatɔkɔ mi falɛ, &lt;Kple fasifi kale lɛfɔ ku batii lɛfɔ nfũ, mata ninlɛ fɔ,&gt; <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />ninsiɛko sifutulɛ ku onukwale wɔ feetuo ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ. Ɔkyɛnwoso lete niawɛ mi di obe wɔ lataalɛ ni Yordan okle, kafɔɔ nunua ntɔɔbla akudi anyɔ. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Kɔpɛ ɔlaa, diki mi di obiloo Esau nnɛɛ, diekye kɔyɛkɛ nlɛ abawa amakpɛkoe ku basɔfɔ nii ku babi nii bamuu. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Kafɔɔ feebuɛ falɛ, &lt;Nwaako mata ninlɛ fɔ, nta banantii lɛfɔ nkpɛ fɛle lekpo ɔtɛnsia wɔ manamafuo ni ɔka.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Nioso kakyɛ nwu aate ninfa, ni aadiki akyɛsaa awo di asaa nɔɔ ya ninkpe nwɔ ni kamɛ alɛ abata obilɛma Esau: <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />batie sanko alafa anyɔ ku ntiekpaa afosi anyɔ ku bafoso sanko alafa anyɔ ku akunumuu afosi anyɔ, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />kapubapɔnkɔ afosi atiɛ ku abi ku banankyue sanko afosi ana ku banankyue suɔtɔ lefosi ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo basanko afosi anyɔ ku basuɔtɔ le lefosi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Ni aayɔ ma aakpee di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nnɛɛ, dikudi biala ku nyuntɛ, ni aatɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bile mi katũ, biɛta sebo site di dikudi biala ntɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Aatɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ wɔ niale ni katũ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Se obiloo Esau lɛkyakako fɔ ɛɛkaalɛ alɛ, &lt;Owe ninle fɔ saate, ɔfɛ foofe, owe nimba babɔkɛɛ ba mmle bamuu ninle ni katũ?&gt; <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />ni faatɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ, &lt;Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Yakob nimba ma. Bakyɛle bale beekyesee saate nii Esau, Yakob nkpi wo kamaa ɔɔwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Nkpo kafɔɔ aatɔkɔ ɔnyɔɔfa ku otiɛfa ku babule ba bamuu niatikanko ni akudi nwu alɛ: &lt;&lt;Nse biɛkyakako Esau yi, bibuɛ ɔlaa nwu onwii bitɔkɔ nwɔ. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Binyu bilɛ biebuɛ bilɛ, &lt;Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Yakob nkpi wo kamaa ɔɔwa.&gt; &gt;&gt; Diekye aanyu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Mayɔɔsa nwɔ otu ku akyɛsaa ya mmle ninle ni katũ kɔkyɛnko nwɔ nii; ni sɛmaa se lɛnyɔɔ loo bia abafũ mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Nioso Yakob akyɛsaa lale nwɔ katũ, kafɔɔ kakyɛ nwu nnwɔɔ omu aate di kasiɛkɔ lɛma nwu.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakob Lakpɛ Ku Osuɔtɔ Onwii Di Peniel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Kakyɛ nwu Yakob lataka aakpaa basɔfɔ nɔɔ nwu banyɔ, basanko bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ banyɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ lefosi onwii nwu, ni baataalɛ Yabok okle nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Aataalɛsa ma okle nwu aaloo nii, ni aataalɛsa asaa nɔɔ ya ninkpe nwɔ ni amuu kafɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Nioso Yakob lete nfɛ niabu, ni di osuɔtɔ onwii lakpɛko nwɔ kale ko niasɛ. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Obe wɔ di osuɔtɔ nwu lanya alɛ oloofuo nwɔ ni olenkee, ni aakpanko Yakob lekyekensi nɛ, ta kakpɛ nwu oso lekyekensi nɔɔ lakpa. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tɛɛ nsifi, diekye kale ntɔɔsɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Kafɔɔ Yakob ladiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Namata fɔ fasifi diediki feewii mi lɛyɔɔ fiɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lɛ manlɛɛ fɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">ninfɛ aabuɛ alɛ &lt;&lt;Yakob.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Leyooto lɛfɔ dilɔbasinle Yakob, kafɔɔ Israel, diekye fatɔɔkpɛko Yaa ku batii feeleenkee ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Ni di Yakob labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lekoto tɔkɔ mi leyooto lɛfɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Kafɔɔ aadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be oso fɔɔkaalɛ mi leyooto?&gt;&gt; Ni aawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Nioso Yakob lata lɛba nwu leyooto alɛ Peniel, diekye aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntɔɔnya Yaa anu ku anu kafɔɔ lekple nkpe nkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Kufĩ latũ nwɔ fiɛ aadie di Peniel, ta lekyekensi nɔɔ oso aatookpintĩ. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Nioso diɛbase ni bia mmiɛ Israel batii diloowee okũ wɔ ninkle ni di bɔkɛɛ lekyekensi, diekye baakpanko Yakob okũ wɔ ninkaako ni lekyekensi.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s1">Yakob Ku Esau Lakyaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Ni di Yakob latakatɛsa anu aanyu, ni aanya Esau kɔwa ku basuɔtɔ alafa ana nɛ; nioso aasɛ babi aata Lea ku Rahel ku basanko bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nwu banyɔ. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Aayɔ bakpɛmblatɛ banyɔ nwu ku babi lɛma aalesa katũ, Lea ku babi latika, Rahel ku Yosef lakpi kamaa. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Yakob lale lɛma katũ, di obe wɔ nfɛ ɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ ni obilɛma aase katũ nɔɔ kaasɔ sikuɛnsĩ.<verse eid="GEN 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Kafɔɔ Esau latoso aalaaminiko nwɔ; aayɔ nnɛɛ nɔɔ aakpee nwɔ siimu ni aafĩfĩɔ nwɔ akpoo nɛ. Ni di banyɔ lɛma nwu baawi kaku nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Ni di Esau latakatɛsa anu aanyu, ni aanya basanko nwu ku babi nɛ. Ni aakaalɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bawe ninle mba mmle nɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Ni di Yakob ladiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Mma ninle babi ba diefe ni di Yaa sibualɛ ɛɛta ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Ninfɛ di basanko bakpɛmblatɛ nwu ku babi lɛma labadu baase ntũ lɛma kaasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Lea ku babi latika babase ntũ lɛma kaasɔ. Yosef ku Rahel lale bayɛntɛle, mma kafɔɔ babase ntũ lɛma kaasɔ.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esau lakaalɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Batii ku babɔkɛɛ akudi ya amuu lɛkyakako ni kasɔ mɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Ni di Yakob ladiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Di mmle kawɛ ni sibualɛ di saate nii anu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Kafɔɔ Esau latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obiloo, n-ya ninkpe mi ni mpɔ. Afɔ yɔ n-ya ninkpe fɔ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Ninfɛ di Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lekoto, oowo, se mawɛ sibualɛ di anu lɛfɔ, fũ akyɛsaa nii ya mmle. Diekye fatoofũ mi ni ku sibualɛ oso, nunua ɔnya kɔnya fɔ fɛ Yaa anu kɔnya. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Fũ akyɛsaa ya bɛɛyɔ bɛɛwako fɔ ni, diekye Yaa lewii mi lɛyɔɔ ɛɛtɛɛ asaa ya niefĩ mi nii.&gt;&gt; Ta Yakob lanyinka nwɔ ni oso, aafũ asaa nwu.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Ninfɛ di Esau labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ta buɔtɔɔkyɛ; kamatikanko fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Kafɔɔ Yakob latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Afɔ omu faye, saate nii, dikpeni buololaa babisɔ nwu ku bakɔkɛɛ balofotɛ ku abi lɛma buonyu nwaa. Nse buɔkpakpayi ma osie kanya di dii ninwii kamɛ ni babɔkɛɛ bamuu makpi. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Nioso lekoto saate nii, le kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ katũ, di ami ku babisɔ nwu ku babɔkɛɛ nwu butɛ suoto buɔbatũ saate nii di Seir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Ni di Esau labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni tɛɛ ndiɛ basuɔtɔ nii bawo di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Kafɔɔ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnwu kuofĩ, afɔ tɛɛ nwɛ sibualɛ di anu lɛfɔ, saate nii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Nioso Esau layefe osuku aakple aasifi Seir. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Kafɔɔ Yakob lasifi Sukot kasɔ, nfa aatofo leyo aata suoto, aapɛ akpaayo aata babɔkɛɛ nɔɔ. Nni oso bɔɔlɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Sukot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.17</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sukot lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ akpaayo</char></note> nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Di Yakob ladie ni di Padan Aram,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.18</char><char style="ft" closed="false">lɛsɔdiki ninle Mesopotamia nɛ</char></note> aakyɛ aalaabuo Sekem okpoo di Kanaan kasɔ ni aapɛ akpaayo di okpoo nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Ni aaya kasɔ di Sekem ote Hamor babisuɔtɔbi nfũ ku koto fututu kɔlafa, nfa aapɛ akpanta nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Nfa aapɛ oleɔta akyikye, ni aalɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ El-Elohe Israel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.20</char><char style="ft" closed="false">El-Elohe Israel lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ, Yaa, Israel batii Yaa ee Israel batii Yaa wɔ ninlenke nii.</char></note> nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s1">Dina Ku Sekem Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Dii ninwii Yakob ku Lea obisankobi Dina, lakyɛ alɛ ɔɔlaasɛɛsa basanko bawo ninkpe ni di lɛba le basi nii. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Obe wɔ di Hamor wɔ ninle ni Hiwi otii, aale ni kasɔ nwu nkpo ɔka obisuɔtɔbi Sekem lanyɔɔ nii, aayɔ osie aatenko nwɔ. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Yakob obi Dina nwu ɔlaa lakpanko nwɔ di otu, ni aatoomiɛ nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Nioso Sekem latɔkɔ ote Hamor alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kaalɛ okpeele wɔ mmle fatɛɛ n-yɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Obe wɔ di Yakob lanu alɛ bɛɛyɔ osie beetenko ni obisankobi nɔɔ Dina yi, babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ latɔɔkpa babɔkɛɛ nɔɔ leepoo kamɛ; nioso aalo kanana dialaase di obe wɔ baawa ni leyo.<verse eid="GEN 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Ni di Sekem ote, Hamor lakyɛ aalaakakatɛko Yakob nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Di Yakob babisuɔtɔbi lakple ni di babɔkɛɛ kakpakɔ babanu ni ɔlaa wɔ niawa nii. Ɔfɔɔ lasifi ma, baanya ɔblɔ osie kanya, diekye Sekem labla anunsɔsaa di Israel suoto, aayɔ osie aatenko ni Yakob obisankobi. Lɛsaale ninankaatɛ alɛ baabla nii.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Kafɔɔ Hamor latɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwaako obisuɔtɔbi nii mbɔmbɔ Dina. Lekoto biyɔ nwɔ bitɔɔ ayɔ. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Bita owo ku aye butɔɔyɔ bawo batii; biyɔ babisankobi lee bita babisuɔtɔbi loo bayɔ, di awo kafɔɔ buɔyɔ babisankobi loo buta babisuɔtɔbi lee bayɔ. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Biafuo osiɛ di kamɛ loo; kasɔ ninte ye di anu nɛ. Bisiɛ ninka suoto, biesunsũ asaa, biɛwɛ asaa kaasɔ nwu suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Ni di Sekem latɔkɔ Dina ote ku babilɛma suɔtɔbi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bile mi sibualɛ, ni mata ye lɛsaa lele biɛkaalɛ. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Bitɔkɔ mi disi asaa ku ɔkafɔɔ asaa ya ninwako ni fɛ mmle dikaatɛ ni, mata amuu nta ye. Aye biyɔ okpeele nwu bitɛɛ n-yɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Kafɔɔ ta nle aabla ni anunsɔsaa ku obilɛma sankobi Dina oso, Yakob babisuɔtɔbi lakyɔnkyɔ Sekem ku ote Hamor. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Baatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bulaafuo lɛsaa le mmle ɔbla; bulaafuo obiloo sankobi ɔyɔ ɔta osuɔtɔ wɔ ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto. Dibabla sinunsɔ ninta wo. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Buɔta ye disibu loo di osuku wɔ mmle suoto: nnwu ninle alɛ biate fɛle awo okle alɛ baakyɛlɛnsa basuɔtɔ bamuu suoto. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Ni bubayɔ babisankobi loo munta ye, di awo kafɔɔ mun-yɔ babisankobi lee. Ni bubasiɛ ye kaamɛ mumbla batii banwii ku aye. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Kafɔɔ nse bienu kasɔ biɛkyɛlɛnsa suoto yi, ni bubakpaa obiloo sankobi munsifiko.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Hamor ku obisuɔtɔbi Sekem latunako ma ku ɔlaa nwu. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Kunkye di okosopo nwu mantɛ manta ni dibu di ote leyo batii bamuu kamɛ latuna aalaabla di mmle baabuɛ nii kanya. Diekye Yakob obisankobi nwu lasiɛ nwɔ di otu. <verse eid="GEN 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Nioso Hamor ku obisuɔtɔbi Sekem lakyɛ okpoo lɛma lɛkpaka baalaakakatɛ baata okpoo lɛma basuɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />Baatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Basuɔtɔ ba mmle basiɛwo nwaa bale batawo. Bita ma basiɛ di kasɔ loo suoto, baasunsũ asaa; kasɔ mpɔ kakpete baasiɛ nii. Bubafuo babisankobi lɛma ɔyɔ, mma kafɔɔ man-yɔ bale wo. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Kafɔɔ batii ba mmle manu kasɔ mansiɛwo kaamɛ mumbla batii banwii, nse basuɔtɔ loo letuna bɛɛkyɛlɛnsa suoto fɛle mmle okle di mma bamu bɛɛbla nii. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Babɔkɛɛ sele lɛma, lɛsaawɛ lɛma ku babɔkɛɛ bamba lɛma makple wo bale. Nioso bita bunu kasɔ buta ma, baasiɛ kaamɛ loo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Basuɔtɔ ba bamuu niadie baakyɛ ni okpoo lɛkpaka nwu latuna di ɔlaa wɔ di Hamor ku obisuɔtɔbi Sekem labuɛ nii. Nioso baakyɛlɛnsa osuɔtɔ biala suoto di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Di dii tiɛfa, di nkɔ lɛma nwu latoobuo ma nii, Yakob basuɔtɔbi banyɔ, Simeon ku Lewi, bale ni Dina babilɛma suɔtɔbi layɔ mpamii lɛma baalaadieko okpoo nwu, baalo osuɔtɔ biala. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Baalo Hamor ku obisuɔtɔbi Sekem ku kapamii. Ni baakpaa Dina baadieko di Sekem leyo ni baadie di okpoo nwu nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Ninfɛ di Yakob babisuɔtɔbi bule lakyɛ okpoo nwu kamɛ di nfũ baakpi nwu nkpo latente ni baalaayɔ asaa lɛma, di nfũ baakpɔnɔfɔsa ni obilɛma sankobi nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Baayɔ batii nwu bafoso, batie, banankyue, babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo ku lɛsaa lɛma biala di okpoo nwu kamɛ ku afe lɛma. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Baayɔ lɛsaawɛ lɛma ku basanko ku babi. Baayɔ lɛsaa biala di ayo lɛma baasifiko.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Ninfɛ di Yakob latɔkɔ Simeon ku Lewi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitɔɔwako ɔlaa kplɛ di suoto nii, biɛtɛɛ ntɔɔbla otii kpile lɛta Kanaan batii ku Peres batii ba ninsi ni kaasɔ ka mmle suoto. Buɔpɔ, ni nse beesi kanya bɛɛtaka di suoto nii, ni babawɔɔsa ami ku leyo nii kamɛ batii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Kafɔɔ baadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni dikaatɛ alɛ aabla obiloo sankobi fɛle sɔnɔkpeetɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lawii Yakob Lɛyɔɔ Di Betel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Ninfɛ di Yaa latɔkɔ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kple fasifi falaasiɛ di Betel, faapɛ oleɔta akyikye ninfa fata Yaa, nnwɔ niadiki suoto aatuo fɔ ni di obe wɔ faatootoso ni di obilee Esau nfũ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Nioso Yakob latɔkɔ leyo nɔɔ batii ku batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Biyɔ bafɔɔ afiɔ ya bikle ni biyu, biekleklesa suoto lee biɛkyɛlɛnsa akpeele lee. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Ni biɛwa buosifi Betel. Nfa mapɛ oleɔta akyikye nta Yaa wɔ niatuna aatɛɛ ni di nimiina nii kamɛ ku nnwɔ niasiɛkoe ni di kaakɔ lele lakyɛ ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Nioso baayɔ bafɔɔ afiɔ ya amuu baakle ni ku atokosakasaa di atoko lɛma baata Yakob. Ni di Yakob layɔ nya aakookaa di mawogani kowoso kplɛ kunwii kalɔ di Sekem nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Ni baayefe osuku nɛ, ni di Yaa lata difu lapɛ sekpoo se simuu niamana ma siakye ni, alɛ kuonwii lɛma ditataka di Yakob ku leyo nɔɔ batii suoto.<verse eid="GEN 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Ni di Yakob ku batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni di suoto nɔɔ lalabuo Lus (ninle ni Betel) di Kanaan kasɔ. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Nfa aapɛ oleɔta akyikye, ni aalɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ El Betel,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.7</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betel lɛsɔdiki ninle Betel Yaa</char></note> diekye nfa di Yaa ladiki suoto nɔɔ aatuo nwɔ di obe wɔ aatootoso ni di obilɛma Esau nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Ninfɛ di Debora wɔ niaklee ni Rebeka ku sibisɔ nɔɔ lakpi, baakookaa nwɔ di kowoso kplɛ kunwii kalɔ di Betel okpoo kalakasɔ nɛ. Nioso baalɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Alon Bakut<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.8</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alon Bakut lɛsɔdiki ninle kowoso kplɛ kalɔ kaku owi.</char></note> nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Di Yakob lakple ni di Padan Aram,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.9</char><char style="ft" closed="false">nfa ninle Mesopotamia nɛ</char></note> Yaa lakple aadiki suoto aatuo nwɔ, ni aawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Yaa latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Leyooto lɛfɔ ninle Yakob, kafɔɔ blɔbasinlɛɛ fɔ Yakob; leyooto lɛfɔ nfɛ nimale Israel.&gt;&gt; Nioso Israel nfɛ baatɔɔlɛɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Ni di Yaa latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni nɛ; lofo, faakpɛ di lɛpɔ kamɛ. Kale ku nnle sekpoo kamadie mankye kamɛ lɛfɔ, baka kafɔɔ madie mankye suoto lɛfɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Kasɔ ka layɔ lata ni Abraham ku Isak yi, lɛyɔ ka kafɔɔ lɛta fɔ. Mayɔ kafɔɔ kasɔ ka mmle nta banantii lɛfɔ ba nikɔwa ni sɛɛmaa lɛfɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Ninfɛ di Yaa lasifi osi aadiɛ nwɔ di lɛba le aakakatɛko nwɔ ni nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Ninfɛ di Yakob layɔ difuɔ ninwii aatɛ di lɛba le di Yaa lakakatɛ ko nwɔ nii, ni aanyɛɛnɛ asaaɔta nta aakpete ninni; aakpete kafɔɔ nnɔnyi ninni suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Ni di Yakob lalɛɛ laba le di Yaa lakakatɛ ko nwɔ ni alɛ Betel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.15</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betel lɛsɔdiki ninle Yaa leyo nɛ </char></note> nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rahel Ku Isak Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Yakob ku batii nɔɔ ladie di Betel baasifi. Di obe wɔ bakyɛ ni di osuku manadibuo ni Efrat, kolofo latoonu Rahel, diawɛ nwɔ osie. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Di kolofo nwu latoonu nwɔ ni osie kanya, ɔsanko lofosatɛ nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tanyɛkɛ, diekye fatookple fɛɛwɛ obisuɔtɔbi bamba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Aatookpi, fiɛ ninwuna nɔɔ madie nii, aatika obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nwu leyooto alɛ Benoni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.18</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Benoni lɛsɔdiki ninle dibuo nii obisuɔtɔbi.</char></note> Kafɔɔ ote latika nwɔ leyooto alɛ, Benyamin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.18</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Benyamin lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ koletanɛɛ nii obisuɔtɔbi.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Nioso Rahel lakpi baakookaa nwɔ di osuku boofe ni Efrat (nfa ninle Betlehem) nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakob layɔ difuɔ aatika di ɔkya nɔɔ suoto, dite bia mmiɛ difuɔ nwu lɛtɛ Rahel ɔkya nsũ.<verse eid="GEN 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Israel lakple aayefe osuku, ni aalaapɛ akpaayo di Migdal Eder. <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Obe wɔ di Israel nfɛ nsi ni kaasɔ nwu suoto yi, obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nɔɔfo le Ruben lalaatenko ote ɔsɔnɔ wɔ manlɛɛ ni Bilha. Ni di Israel lanu ɔlaa nwu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 35:22">Lefosi babisuɔtɔbi banyɔ niawɛ Yakob:<verse eid="GEN 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Lea babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:23">Yakob obisuɔtɔbi kasale Ruben,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:23">Simeon ku Lewi ku Yuda ku Isakar ku Sebulon.<verse eid="GEN 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Rahel babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:24">Yosef ku Benyamin.<verse eid="GEN 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Rahel kpɛmblatɛ sanko Bilha babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:25">Dan ku Naftali<verse eid="GEN 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Lea kpɛmblatɛ sanko Silpa babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:26">Gad ku Aser</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:26">Yakob babisuɔtɔbi ba baalofo baatɔɔ ni di Padan Aram nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakob lakple aasifi kafa di ote Isak nfũ di Mamre, niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni Kiriat Arba (nfa ninle Hebron) nɛ. Nfa di Abraham ku Isak lasiɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isak lasiɛ nkpa alɛɛ kɔlafa afosi anɛ. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Aatɛ aabe fiɛ ninwuna ladie, aakpi aasifi aalaatũ bawa nɔɔ. Ni di babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Esau ku Yakob lakookaa nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s1">Esau Banantii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Nnya Esau (ninle ni Edom) banantii ninle mba mmle nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau ladiki basɔfɔ nɔɔ di Kanaan basanko kamɛ: Elon ninle ni Heti otii obisankobi Ada ku Ana obisankobi Oholibama, ɔwa nɔɔ ninle ni Sibeon, Hiwi otii, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />ku Ismael obisankobi Basmat, obilɛma sankobi ninle Nebaiot nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada lalofo Elifas aata Esau, Basmat lalofo Reuel, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />ni di Oholibama lalofo Yeus ku Yalam ku Kora nɛ. Mba mmle niale Esau babisuɔtɔbi ba baalofo baatɔɔ ni di Kanaan kasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Ni di Esau lakpaa basɔfɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi ku leyo nɔɔ batii, babɔkɛɛ sele nɔɔ ku babɔkɛɛ bamba bamuu ku asaa nɔɔ ya amuu aawɛ ni di Kanaan kasɔ. Ni aadie aalaasiɛ di kasɔ ka niabla ni di obilɛma suɔtɔbi Yakob suoto nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Asaa lɛma nfɛ latɛ aapɔ alɛ bamuu lɛma kakple mansiɛ lɛɛba ninwii; kasɔ ditasimpɔ kaata banyɔ lɛma ta babɔkɛɛ sele lɛma oso. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Nioso Esau (ninle ni Edom) lalasiɛ di Seir kale kobokote.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Nnya Esau, Edom batii banantii kote di Seir kobokote niale mba mmle nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Nnya Esau babisuɔtɔbi ayooto:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:10">Ada, Esau ɔsɔfɔ obisuɔtɔbi Elifas ku Basmat, Esau ɔsɔfɔ obisuɔtɔbi Reuel.<verse eid="GEN 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Elifas babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:11">Teman ku Omar ku Sefo ku Gatam ku Kenas.<verse eid="GEN 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Esau obisuɔtɔbi Elifas kafɔɔ lawɛ ɔsɔnɔ baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Timna, nnwɔɔ nialofo Amalek aatɔɔ nɛ. Mma niale Esau ɔsɔfɔ Ada bawa suɔtɔbi nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Reuel babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:13">Nahat ku Sera ku Sama ku Misa. Mma niale Esau ɔsɔfɔ Basmat bawa suɔtɔbi nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Esau ɔsɔfɔ Oholibama wɔ niale ni Ana obisankobi aale ni Sibeon ɔwa sankobi mba aalofo aata ni Esau niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:14">Yeus ku Yalam ku Kora.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Mba mmle niale baka di Esau banantii kamɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 36:15">Esau obi kasale Elifas babisuɔtɔbi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:15">Baka nwu nianle Teman ku Omar ku Sefo ku Kenas ku <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kora ku Gatam ku Amalek. Mma niale baka ba niadie baakye ni Elifas di Edom kasɔ nɛ; Ada bawa suɔtɔbi baale.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Mba mmle niale Esau obisuɔtɔbi Reuel babisuɔtɔbi nɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:17">Baka nwu niale Nahat ku Sera ku Sama ku Misa. Mma niale baka ba niadie baakye ni Reuel di Edom kasɔ nɛ; Basmat bawa suɔtɔbi baale.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Mba mmle niale Esau ɔsɔfɔ Oholibama babisuɔtɔbi nɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:18">Baka nwu niale Yeus ku Yalam ku Kora nɛ. Mma niale baka ba niadie baakye ni Esau ɔsɔfɔ Oholibama, Ana obisankobi kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Mba niale Esau (ninle ni Edom), babisuɔtɔbi, mba niale ma baka nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Mba mmle niale Seir niale ni Hor otii babisuɔtɔbi ba niasiɛ ni di kasɔ nwu suoto nɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:20">Lotan, Sobal, Sibeon, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dison, Eser ku Disan. Seir babisuɔtɔbi di Edom niale Hor batii baka nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Lotan babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:22">Hori ku Heman. Lotan obilɛma sankobi niale Timna nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Sobal babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:23">Alwan ku Manahat ku Ebal ku Sefo ku Onam nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Sibeon babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:24">Aia ku Ana. Ana wɔ mmle niakasa ntu kpankpa kataakɔ ɔnya di ɔfaafuu kamɛ di obe wɔ aatɔɔkpa ni ote babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka atoo di Sibeon nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Ana babi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:25">Dison ku Ana obisankobi Oholibama.<verse eid="GEN 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Dison babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:26">Hemdan ku Esban ku Itran ku Keran.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Eser babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:27">Bilhan ku Saawan ku Akan.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Disan babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:28">Us ku Aran.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Mba mmle niale Hor batii baka nɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:29">Lotan ku Sobal ku Sibeon ku Ana <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />ku Dison ku Eser ku Disan. Mma niale Hor batii baka di ayo lɛma kanya di Seir kasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edom Baka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Mba mmle niale baka di Edom fiɛ di Israel batii ɔka lele lale sɛka nɛ:<verse eid="GEN 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Beor obisuɔtɔbi Bela lale Edom ɔka. Okpoo nɔɔ leyooto niale Dinhaba nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Di Bela lakpi nii, Sera niakye ni Bosra obisuɔtɔbi Yobab nfɛ niale ɔka.<verse eid="GEN 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Di Yobab lakpi nii, Husam wɔ niakye ni Teman batii kasɔ nfɛ niale ɔka.<verse eid="GEN 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Di Husam lakpi nii, Bedad obisuɔtɔbi Hadad wɔ nialenkee ni Midian di Moab kale nfɛ niale ɔka. Okpoo nɔɔ baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Awit nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Di Hadad lakpi nii, Samla wɔ niakye ni Masreka nfɛ niale ɔka.<verse eid="GEN 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Di Samla lakpi nii, Saul wɔ niakye ni Rehobot di okle kotoko nfɛ niale ɔka.<verse eid="GEN 36:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Di Saul lakpi nii, Akbor obisuɔtɔbi Baal-Hanan niayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka.<verse eid="GEN 36:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Di Akbor obisuɔtɔbi Baal-Hanan lakpi nii, Hadad nfɛ niale ɔka. Okpoo nɔɔ baatɔɔlɛɛ Pau, ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ leyooto niale Mehetabel, Matred obisankobi aale, ɔya kafɔɔ niale Mesahab nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Nnya baka ba niadie baakye ni Esau kamɛ, ayooto di nfaabi ku nsiɛkɔ lɛma kanya:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:40">Timna ku Alwa ku Yetet, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibama ku Ela ku Pinon, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenas ku Teman ku Mibsar, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magdiel ku Iram. Mba mmle niale Edom baka, di mmle kanya baasiɛ ni di kasɔ ka baawɛ ni suoto nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:43">Esau niale Edom batii kote.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s1">Yosef Ku Babilɛma Suɔtɔbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakob lasiɛ di Kanaan kasɔ suoto, di nfũ di ote lasiɛ nii.<verse eid="GEN 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Nnya Yakob banantii ninle mba mmle nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Obe wɔ di Yosef lafũ ni lefosi alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ, aatootikanko babilɛma suɔtɔbi bale ni ote basɔfɔ Bilha ku Silfa babisuɔtɔbi batɔɔkpa bafoso. Yosef ntɔkɔ ote lɛma asaa kpile ya di babilɛma ntɔɔbla nii.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Israel labɔmbɔ Yosef aalenkee babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bule, diekye baalofo nwɔ baatɔɔ di obe wɔ atoobe ni kamɛ; ni aakaa akpeele wua aatɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Obe wɔ di babilɛma suɔtɔbi lanya alɛ ote lɛma mbɔmbɔ nwɔ anlenkee ni bamuu lɛma yi, baakyidi nwɔ, batatɔɔkakatɛ ko nwɔ ku sɛlɔ biene.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Dii ninwii Yosef lasɛ kɔlaafɔ, ni aatɔkɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi kɔlaafɔ nwu, mia nwu nfɛ baakyidi nwɔ baakyakaa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Binu kɔlaafɔ ko lasɛ ni: <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Buatoonii ni kamɔɔ buatɔɔtɛ ni koofe, nfanwu ɔmɔɔbuu nii niataka kuayila wlɔlɔlɔ, ni di sɛmɔɔbuu lee labamana ole mi siakyi, ni siawa kasɔ siatɔɔ nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Ni di babilɛma suɔtɔbi latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Feenyu falɛ ɔka loo fabale? Nwaako fabale sɛsaate di suoto loo?&gt;&gt; Mia nfɛ bia baakyidi nwɔ baakyakaa nɛ, ta kɔlaafɔ nɔɔ nwu nkpo ku mmle aabuɛ nioso.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Nni sɛmaa aakple aasɛ kɔlaafɔ bamba, ni aatɔkɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi nɛ. Aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Binu lo, lakple lasɛ kɔlaafɔ bamba. Di kɔlaafɔ ko mmle kamɛ, kufĩ ku kɔwɛntɛ ku awɛntrɛbi lefosi ninwii latɔɔwa kasɔ baatɔɔtɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Obe wɔ aatɔkɔ ni ote ku babilɛma suɔtɔbi kɔlaafɔ nwu yi, ni di ote lasĩ ɔlaa aatɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be kɔlaafɔ faasɛ nɛ? Ni diotuo alɛ nwaako yaafɔ ku ami ku babilee suɔtɔbi bubawa mumawa kasɔ di anu lɛfɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Nioso babilɛma suɔtɔbi anu lasɛɛ ma di suoto nɔɔ, kafɔɔ ote nnwɔɔ aatoobu kɔlaafɔ nwu nkpo disi.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baasunsũ Yosef, Baakpaa Nwɔ Baasifiko Egipte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Dii ninwii Yosef babilɛma suɔtɔbi lakpaa ote lɛma babɔkɛɛ baafenko kalekɔ di Sekem, <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />ni di Israel latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Babilee suɔtɔbi lɛkpaa babɔkɛɛ beefenko kalekɔ di Sekem. Wa ninkpee fɔ ɔkyɛ lɛma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yosef latuna alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yioo lenu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyɛ faalaanyu nse sikpe babilee suɔtɔbi ku babɔkɛɛ nwu osie, faakple fabatɔkɔ mi.&gt;&gt; Ni aakpee nwɔ aakye Hebron Ɔtaata nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Obe wɔ di Yosef lalabuo ni Sekem, <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />osuɔtɔ onwii lanyɔɔ ookyikyii di afe kamɛ, ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obe foomiɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Babiloo suɔtɔbi kowolaa. Faye lɛbale bakpe bɔɔkpa ni babɔkɛɛ lɛma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Batoodie ninfũ. &lt;Lanu baatoobuɛ alɛ, &lt;Bita busifi Dotan.&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:17">Nioso Yosef lasifi aalaanya babilɛma suɔtɔbi di Dotan ɔlɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="GEN 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Kafɔɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi lanyɔɔ kaakyonkɔ, fiɛ aabadu ma nii, batoobuɛ bɛɛtɛ alɛ babalo nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Baabuɛ baatɔkɔ bawo alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nya alaafɔsɛtɛ nwu nkpo nikɔwa nɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />&lt;&lt;Biwa biɛta bulo nwɔ nunua buofuki nwɔ bukpee di abiɔ ya mmle ninwii kamɛ, buobuɛ bulɛ bɔkɛɛ kplɛ onwii niɛbɛbɛɛ nwɔ eewee. Ni bubanyu lɛsaa le nimadie ninkye ni alaafɔ nɔɔ nwu kamɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Di Ruben lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle, ni aamiɛ alɛ oofũ Yosef nkpa di nnɛɛ lɛma nɛ. Ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitanta bualo nwɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Ni di Ruben latɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitanwii ntɔ kunwii kaasɔ. Bifuki nwɔ bikpee di dibiɔ le mmle kamɛ di ɔfaafuu wɔ mmle, kafɔɔ bitankpanko nwɔ.&gt;&gt; Ruben labuɛ nkpo alɛ aafũ nwɔ nkpa ankpaa nwɔ ankyɛnko ote.<verse eid="GEN 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Nioso obe wɔ di Yosef labadu ni babilɛma suɔtɔbi nfũ yi, baaklee akpeele nɔɔ nwu, akpeele wua nwu niefũ ni kɔya aakpee ni baadiki nwɔ di suoto. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Ni baayɔ nwɔ baafuki baakpee di dibiɔ kamɛ nɛ. Dibiɔ nwu kamɛ lakoso; ntu ditasiɛ kaamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Obe wɔ baasiɛ kaasɔ alɛ boole ni alesaa, ni baatakatɛsa anu, ni baanya Ismael batii osuku bakyɛntɛ dikudi ninwii lakye Gilead bɔɔwa. Mpu bapɔnkɔ lɛma latuka akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa, nnɔnyi ku olufui baatoofenko Egipte.<verse eid="GEN 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Ninfɛ di Yuda latɔkɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obe bubawɛ nse buolo obiloo buɔyɔ nwɔ buokookaa? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Biwa biɛta buyɔ nwɔ busunsũ buta Ismael batii ba mmle buodiɛ nwɔ olo. Akpakpa dite, obiloo suɔtɔbi ale, suoto loo simu ku ntɔ ale.&gt;&gt; Ni di babilɛma suɔtɔbi nwu latunako nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Nioso obe wɔ di Midian batii basaasunsũtɛ lawa nii, Yosef babilɛma suɔtɔbi ladiki nwɔ di dibiɔ nwu kamɛ, ni baasunsũ nwɔ baata Ismael batii ku koto fututu afosi anyɔ, ni di Midian batii nwu lakpaa nwɔ baasifiko Egipte nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Obe wɔ di Ruben lakple aakyɛ aalaanyu ni dibiɔ nwu kamɛ atanya ni Yosef kaamɛ yi, aabɛbɛɛ akpeele nɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Ni aakple aasifi babilɛma suɔtɔbi nfũ aalaatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Osuɔtɔbi nwu diesinsi di dibiɔ nwu kamɛ! Be nfɛ nimbla nunua?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Ni baalo tie, baayɔ Yosef akpeele nwu baakpee di ntɔ nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Ninfɛ baayɔ akpeele wua nwu baasifiko baalaatɔkɔ ote lɛma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Buɔnya akpeele ya mmle. Lolaanya fanyu nse obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ akpeele ale.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Aatofo nya, ni aabuɛ alɛ &lt;&lt;Obisuɔtɔbi nii akpeele ale! Bɔkɛɛ kplɛ owo niemufũ nwɔ eewee. Lefũ lenu nlɛ ɛɛbɛbɛɛ Yosef kɔkyɛɛkɔkyɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Ni di Yakob labɛbɛɛ akpeele nɔɔ, aayɔ leboko aaklee, aabla obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nwu kaku ayi kpinwu nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bamuu ku babisankobi labakpee nwɔ kɔnɛɛ kaafutu, kafɔɔ aasĩ alɛ batankpee nwɔ kɔnɛɛ kaafuto. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Oowo, mawi ninkpi nsifi nnaawɛ di obisuɔtɔbi nii nfũ kaasɔ di ɔkya kamɛ.&gt;&gt; Nioso ote lawi nwɔ nwaa.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Nni kamaa, Midian batii nwu lasunsũ Yosef di Egipte baata Potifar, Farao asaa banyuntɛ nɔɔ ɔnɔɔfotii lɛma onwii.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ku Tama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ, Yuda lasifi aadiɛ babilɛma suɔtɔbi aalaasiɛ di osuɔtɔ onwii manlɛɛ ni Hira, aakye ni Adulam ɔkyɛ. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Nfa di Yuda lanya Kanaan osuɔtɔ onwii manlɛɛ ni Sua obisankobi nɛ. Ni aayɔ nwɔ ni aatenko nwɔ nɛ; <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />ni aalaka lɛmɛ aalofo obisuɔtɔbi, ni baatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Er nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Aakple aalaka lɛmɛ aalofo obisuɔtɔbi ni baatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Onan nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Ni aakple aalaka lɛmɛ aalofo obisuɔtɔbi bamba ni baatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Sela nɛ. Kesib aawɛ fiɛ aalofo nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yuda lakaalɛ ɔsanko wɔ manlɛɛ ni Tama aata obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ kasale Er. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Kafɔɔ Er wɔ niale ni Yuda obisuɔtɔbi kasale labla okpile di Saate nwu anu; nioso Saate nwu lalo nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Ni di Yuda latɔkɔ Onan alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɔ obilee suɔtɔbi ɔsɔfɔ nwu, faatenko nwɔ faalofo babi fata obilee suɔtɔbi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Kafɔɔ Onan latofo alɛ babi nwu dilɔbale nwɔ bale; nioso nse ootenko obilɛma ɔsɔfɔ nwu yi, andiki alombi nɔɔ an-wii kaasɔ ta mmle ɔnɔmalofo ata ni obilɛma suɔtɔbi oso. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Lɛsaa le aabla ni lale lɛsaa kpile di Saate nwu anu; nioso aalo nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Ninfɛ di Yuda latɔkɔ obisɔfɔ nɔɔ Tama alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tɔɔkyɛ falaasiɛ di teefɔ leyo fɛ kpisɔfɔ dilaase di obe wɔ di obisuɔtɔbi nii Sela kamamuɔ ni.&gt;&gt; Diekye aanyu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Loo nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ abakpi fɛle babilɛma suɔtɔbi okle.&gt;&gt; Nioso Tama lasifi aalaasiɛ di ote leyo.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Di obe kpinwu sɛmaa, Yuda ɔsɔfɔ, niale ni Sua obisankobi lakpi. Di Yuda laloo ni okusii yi, nnwɔɔ ku siɛwo nɔɔ Hira wɔ niale ni Adulam otii baakyɛ Timnat di basuɔtɔ ba niatoonwiɛ ni bafoso nɔɔ sinwini nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Otii onwii latɔkɔ Tama alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔsa lɛfɔ ote kofe Timnat ɔlaanwiɛ bafoso nɔɔ sinwini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Nioso aadiki sikpisɔfɔ abula aatɛ, aayɔ anuditĩisaa aatĩi anu nɔɔ, aakakatu suoto aalaasiɛ di Enaim kasukunya ka niawɛ ni di Timnat osuku. Tama latofo alɛ Sela ntoomuɔ, kafɔɔ Yuda diiyɔ nwɔ atɔɔ alɛ ayɔ.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Obe wɔ di Yuda lanyɔɔ nii, aanyu alɛ loo sɔnɔkpeetɛ aale, diekye aatĩi anu nɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Yuda ditatofo alɛ obisɔfɔ nɔɔ diale, ni aakyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di osuku kotoko nwu aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Wa ninaatenko fɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be lɛsaa fabatɛɛ nse feetenkoe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Ninfɛ di Yuda latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kamakyesee fɔ tie kabitɛ di batie nii kamɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Ni di Tama lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Fabayɔ lɛsaa lewo fanse kamaa ninaase di obe wɔ fabakyesee mi ni tie nwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Ni di Yuda lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obe lɛsaa nin-yɔ nse kamaa nta fɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɔ lɛkɔnii le di leyooto lɛfɔ ntika ni, fɛɛpɛ ni lɛkpa feekpee ni siimu ku ɔkyɛnwoso lɛfɔ wɔ fakle ni kɔɔnɛɛ fatɛɛ.&gt;&gt; Nioso aayɔ nya aatɔɔ, ni aatenko nwɔ, ni aalaka nwɔ lɛmɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Di obe wɔ di Tama lasifi nii, aatekete anu ditĩisaa nwu aakplesa sikpisɔfɔ nɔɔ abula aaklee.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Nni sɛmaa Yuda layɔ tie kabitɛ nwu aata siɛwo nɔɔ Adulam otii nwu alɛ akyɛnko aalaafũ kamaa asesaa nɔɔ di ɔsanko nwu ɔkyɛ awako nwɔ. Kafɔɔ siɛwo nɔɔ nwu ditanya ɔsanko nwu. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Nioso aakaalɛ basuɔtɔ ba niasiɛ ni ninfa alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔfɛ di afiɔ sɔnɔkpeetɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38.21</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afiɔ sɔnɔkpeetɛ ninfũ mmle kotuo alɛ Kanaan batii lawɛ basuɔtɔ ku basanko ba ninkpee asɔnɔ manta ni afiɔ ya ninta ni kanto.</char></note> wɔ niasiɛ ni di osuku kotoko di Enaim nkpe?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Ni di basuɔtɔ nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Afiɔ sɔnɔkpeetɛ kuonwii nnaa ninfũ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Nioso aakple aasifi aalaatɔkɔ Yuda alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ninaanya ɔsanko nwu. Diɛkyakaa nii, basuɔtɔ ba ninsi ni ninfa alɛ, &lt;Afiɔ sɔnɔkpeetɛ kuonwii nnaa ninfũ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Ninfɛ di Yuda labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Aafuo asaa nwu ɔyɔ, nse diele nkpo batii kamatɔɔma wo. Nyu, ami lɛyɔ tie kabitɛ ka mmle lekyesee nwɔ, kafɔɔ faanyɔɔ fayɔ fatɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Fɛle awɛntɛ atiɛ sɛmaa, otii onwii latɔkɔ Yuda alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obisɔfɔ lɛfɔ Tama lekpee asɔnɔ, nioso nunua nfɛ alaka lɛmɛ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Ninfɛ di Yuda labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Binanfi nwɔ bidieko di okpoo bielo nwɔ biekpee nwɔ ɔtɔ bifiɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Bakle nwɔ boodieko ni yi, aakpee ɔsa nɔɔ ote otii aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Osuɔtɔ wɔ nimba ni asaa ya mmle niekpee mi lɛmɛ.&gt;&gt; Aakple aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Binyu nse bibatofo otii wɔ lɛkɔnii ku lɛkpa ku ɔkyɛnwoso ninle ni n-ya mmle.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Ninfɛ di Yuda lanya asaa nwu aatɛ nsũ ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔsanko nwu lɛbla tinini alenke mi, diekye ami ninan-yɔ nwɔ nta obisuɔtɔbi nii Sela ayɔ.&gt;&gt; Nioso Yuda ditasinkple aatenko ɔsanko nwu.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Di obe lawo aalofo nii, basuɔtɔbi atabi anyɔ aale kaafutu nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Aatoolofo nii, onwii lɛma ladiki kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ; nioso lofosatɛ nwu layɔ okũ sɛɛle aanii nwɔ kaanɛɛtũ aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnwɔ mmle niɛkasa odie nɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Kafɔɔ aakple aamɛɛsa kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, ni di obilɛma ladie aawa nɛ, ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nioso osuku wɔ mmle feefe fɛɛwa nɛ?&gt;&gt; Ni aatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Peres<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38.29</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peres lɛsɔdiki ninle obiɛ odie </char></note> nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Nni sɛmaa obilɛma wɔ baanii ni okũ sɛɛle kaanɛɛtũ nɔɔ ladie nɛ, ni baatika nwɔ leyooto alɛ Sera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38.30</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sera lɛsɔdki ninle lɛsɛɛle ee lɛkpa </char></note> nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yosef Ku Potifar Ɔsɔfɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Ninfɛ baakpaa Yosef baasifiko Egipte nɛ. Ni di Potifar wɔ ninle ni Egipte otii, aale ni ɔnɔɔfotii onwii, di mba ninyila mantoonyu ni Farao tunletɛ laya Yosef di Ismael batii ɔkyɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Saate nwu lasiɛkoYosef, asaa lalɛ nwɔ ɔkyɛ, ni aasiɛ di saate nɔɔ Egipte otii nwu leyo nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Obe wɔ di saate nɔɔ lanya alɛ Saate nwu nsiko nwɔ ni, di Saate nwu lata alɛ lɛsaa biala aatɔɔbla ni latɔɔlɛ nwɔ ni ɔkyɛ yi, <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />ni di Yosef labuo saate nɔɔ anu, ni aayɔ nwɔ aabla nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɛ. Potifar layɔ nwɔ aase di leyo nɔɔ batii kanya, ni aayɔ lɛsaa nɔɔ biala aakpee nwɔ ninnɛɛ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Diayɔ ni di obe wɔ kamɛ aayɔ nwɔ aase ni di leyo nɔɔ batii ku asaa ya amuu niawɛ nwɔ ni kanya, Saate lawii Egipte otii nwu leyo kamɛ batii lɛyɔɔ ta Yosef oso. Saate nwu lɛyɔɔ owii nwu latika di lɛsaa biala niawɛ ni Potifar, di leyo ku kofe. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Nioso Potifar layɔ lɛsaa biala niawɛ nwɔ ni aakpee di Yosef nnɛɛ. Atasin-yɔ nwu ole di lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii suoto dilenkee alesaa ya aatoole ni lete.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yosef nfɛ labawɛ suoto nwaa, aalɛ sekosopo. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Di obe owo sɛmaa, Yosef latɛ aatɔɔlɛ saate nɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ onyu, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Wa faabatenkoe!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Kafɔɔ Yosef lasĩ. Ni aatɔkɔ saate nɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Di ami nin-yɛ ni kaanya oso, saate nii diesin-yɔ nwu ole di lɛsalɛsaa kuniwii suoto di leyo le mmle kamɛ; ɛɛyɔ lɛsaa biala ninle nwɔ ni lele eekpee mi ninnɛɛ. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Otii kuonwii diɛtaka katoo alenke mi di leyo le mmle kamɛ. Lɛsaa le lete di saate nii diɛyɔ akpee mi ni ninnɛɛ ninle afɔ, diekye ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ fale. Ni lɛ nfɛ kabla lɛsaa kpile le mmle okle, mbla okpile di Yaa suoto?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Kuntɛ dii biala aatɔɔtɔkɔ Yosef yi, aasĩ ɔkyɛ ɔlaatenko nwɔ ee bia atasintɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Dii ninwii Yosef lakyɛ leyo kamɛ alɛ ɔɔlaabla ɔkpɛ nɔɔ, leyo nwu batii bakpɛmblatɛ kuonwii ditawɛ. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu lamufũ Yosef di akpeele nɔɔ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Wa faabatenkoe!&gt;&gt; Kafɔɔ Yosef ladiɛko nwɔ akpeele nɔɔ di ɔsanko nwu nnɛɛ, ni aatoso aadie leeyo nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Obe wɔ aanya alɛ atoodiɛko nwɔ ni akpeele nɔɔ ninnɛɛ, eetoso eedie ni leeyo, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />ni aalɛɛ leyo nɔɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɛ. Ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Binyu lo! Bɛɛkpaa Hebri osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle bɛɛwako wo alɛ abakpee wo sinunsɔ! Ɛɛwa nfũ alɛ ɔɔbatenkoe, kafɔɔ lɛfafaa. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Obe wɔ aanya alɛ kɔfafaa ni osie kanya, ni aadiɛkoe akpeele nɔɔ di nnɛɛ nii, aatoso aadie leeyo nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Aayɔ akpeele nɔɔ nwu aatɛ di suoto nɔɔ dialaase di obe wɔ di ɔsa, Yosef saate lawa ni leyo. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Ni aayɔ ɔlaa nwu nkpo aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ: &lt;&lt;Hebri ɔlanle wɔ faakpaa fawako wo ni lawa ɔkyɛ nii alɛ okpee mi sinunsɔ. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Kafɔɔ di obe wɔ lafafaa ni osie kanya, ni aadiɛkoe akpeele nɔɔ di nnɛɛ nii, aatoso aadie leeyo nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Obe wɔ di Yosef saate lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ di ɔsɔfɔ latɔkɔ nwɔ ni alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nkpo di ɔlanle lɛfɔ labla mi nɛ,&gt;&gt; ɔblɔ latɛ kuafiɛ nwɔ. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Nkpo oso Yosef saate layɔ Yosef aalaatɛ leeyo, di lɛbale mantɛ ni ɔka leyo batentɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:20">Kafɔɔ di Yosef lawɛ ni di leyo katenkɔ, <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Saate nwu lasiɛko nwɔ; aale nwɔ sifutulɛ, aata alɛ aabuo leyo batentɛ banyuntɛ anu. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Nioso leyo batentɛ banyuntɛ layɔ Yosef baase di leyo batentɛ bamuu kanya, baatɔɔ aayila di ɔkpɛ biala baatɔɔbla ni kanya ninfa. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Leyo batentɛ banyuntɛ nwu ditasin-yɔ nwu ole di lɛsaalɛsaa suoto di Yosef latoonyu nii, diekye Saate nwu lasiɛko Yosef, nioso lɛsaa biala aatɔɔbla ni lalɛ ɔtɔɔkyɛ.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s1">Yosef Ladiki Alaafɔ Kasɔ Aata Leyo Batentɛ Banyɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Di obe owo sɛmaa, Egipte ɔka nta nyɛɛnɛtɛ ku bloblo fiɛtɛ nɔɔ labla okpile di saate lɛma Egipte ɔka suoto. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Ni di Farao lanya ɔblɔ di banyɔ lɛma suoto, nta nyɛɛnɛtɛ nɔɔfo ku bloblo fiɛtɛ nɔɔfo nwu nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />Nioso aayɔ ma aalaatɛ leeyo katenkɔ di asaa banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ leyo. Leyo katenkɔ nwu kafɔɔ baatɛ Yosef nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Asaa banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu layɔ ma aakpee di Yosef nnɛɛ, alɛ atoonyu ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:4">Baate ni leeyo katenkɔ nwu dialaadu ni obe owo, <verse eid="GEN 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />dii ninwii kakyɛ basuɔtɔ nwu banyɔ niate ni leeyo katenkɔ, nta nyɛɛnɛtɛ ku bloblo fiɛtɛ nwu baasɛ alaafɔ ate ate. Kubiala lawɛ lɛsɔdiki nɔɔ lete.<verse eid="GEN 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Kaleesɛ di Yosef lakyɛ ni ɔkyɛ lɛma, aanya alɛ suoto ditatɔɔyɔɔ ma. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Nioso aakaalɛ Farao banɔɔfotii nwu niate ni di leyo kantenkɔ ku nnwɔɔ di saate nɔɔ leyo alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be oso bite biɔɔ nkpo miɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Batii loo banyɔ buɔsɛ alaafɔ, kafɔɔ otii kuonwii nnaa abadiki kasɔ anta wo nii.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Ni di Yosef latɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Diele Yaa ninfuo alaafɔ kasɔ odiki? Bika mi alaafɔ lee nwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Nioso ɔnɔɔfo wɔ niale ni nta nyɛɛnɛtɛ laka Yosef kɔlaafɔ nɔɔ. Aaka nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Di kɔlaafɔ nii kamɛ, lanya awosobi kowoso di anu nii, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />ɛla etiɛ niawɛ kowoso nwu. Di sɛnya labɔkɛtɛ ɔbɔkɛtɛ di sɛla nwu suoto ni di atoto labɔkɔtɛ aatika awosobi akudi ya niabe ni nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Laklee Farao opũ di kɔnɛɛ nii, ni layɔ awosobi nwu, laka nya ntu lakpete di Farao opũ kamɛ. Ni layɔ lakpee nwɔ kɔɔnɛɛ nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Ninfɛ di Yosef latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɔlaafɔ nwu kasɔ ninle alɛ, ewosola etiɛ nwu ninle ayi atiɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Di ayi atiɛ kamɛ Farao kamadiki fɔ di leyo katenkɔ, ankplesa ɔkpɛ lɛfɔ wɔ faatɔɔbla ni anta fɔ. Fabayɔ nta ku opũ fanta Farao fɛle mmle faatɔɔbla ni saa fɛ nta nyɛɛnɛtɛ. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Kafɔɔ nse asaa amuu lɛlɛ fɔ ɔkyɛ faanyuma mi faale mi sibualɛ; lɛɛ mi leyooto fata Farao aadiki mi di leyo katenkɔ. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Diekye ɔkpaa baakpaa mi osie ku osie baadieko di batii nii nfũ di Hebri kasɔ suoto, di nfũ mmle kafɔɔ nimbla lɛsalɛsaa fiɛ bɛɛbatɛ mi leeyo katenkɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Ninfɛ di bloblo fiɛtɛ nɔɔfo lanu ni Yosef kɔlaafɔ lɛsɔdiki lalɛ nii, ni aatɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Amii lasɛ kɔlaafɔ nlɛ: Bloblo nkyikyɛ ntiɛ ntika mi diisi. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Di osi kale kamɛ alesaa ateate ya amuu bɛɛfiɛ bɛɛta ni Farao nsi kaamɛ, kafɔɔ bakansiɛ latoole nya di kakyikyɛ nwu kamɛ di disi nii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Ni di Yosef latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɔlaafɔ nwu kasɔ ninle alɛ, nkyikyɛ nwu ntiɛ ninle ayi atiɛ. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Di ayi atiɛ kamɛ Farao kamata mandiki fɔ di leyo katenkɔ, anta mambudi fɔ disi, man-yɔ ditiki lɛfɔ mansaka di kowoso suoto. Bakansiɛ mmakyɔkyɔfɛ fɔ suoto sina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Dii tiɛfa nwu niale Farao lelofoyi, ni aale dii aalɛɛ banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu nɛ. Ni aadiki nta nyɛɛnɛtɛ nɔɔfo ku bloblo fiɛtɛ nɔɔfo di leyo katenkɔ aawako banɔɔfotii nɔɔ nwu anu nɛ: <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Ni aakplesa nta nyɛɛnɛtɛ nɔɔfo ɔkpɛ nɔɔ aatɔɔ, nioso aakple aatɔɔnyɛɛnɛ nta aatɔɔta Farao, <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />kafɔɔ aata baasaka bloblo fiɛtɛ nɔɔfo nwu, fɛ mmle okle di Yosef ladiki ni alaafɔ nwu kasɔ aata ma nii.<verse eid="GEN 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Kafɔɔ nta nyɛɛnɛtɛ nɔɔfo nwu ditanyuma Yosef; aayee nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s1">Yosef Ladiki Ɔka Alaafɔ Kasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Alɛɛ anyɔ amu sɛmaa, Farao lasɛ kɔlaafɔ: Di kɔlaafɔ nwu kamɛ, aayila di Nile okle kotoko, <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />nfanwu banankyue bakuɛnsĩ ba nikɔlɛ ni onyu, beemuɔ ni niadie di okle nwu kamɛ, baakyako lɛnwaakɛ owee. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Di mma nkpo sɛmaa, banankyue bakuɛnsĩ bamba wakalaa, ninɔɔlɛ ni onyu niadie di Nile okle kamɛ babayila di mba niayila ni di okle nwu kotoko ɔlɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Ni di banankyue ba niawakalaa ni, batatɔɔlɛ ni onyu lamufũ bakuɛnsĩ ba niatɔɔlɛ ni onyu, baamuɔ ni baamɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ di Farao lasɛnkɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Ni aakple aabuo di sɛkyɔsĩ kamɛ, ni aakple aasɛ kɔlaafɔ nyɔɔfa nɛ: Aanya etita epũ ekuɛnsĩ ninkpe ni suoto silɛ ni, siemuɔ nkunu di otitawoso onwii suoto. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Mmi sɛmaa, etita epũ ekuɛnsĩ fioloo siekoso ni ta kufĩ katunkɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ oso nkunu di owoso bamba suoto. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Ni di epũ fioloo nwu lamufũ epũ ekuɛnsĩ be niemuɔ ni siamɛ nɛ. Ni di Farao lasɛnkɛ nɛ; aatofo alɛ kɔlaafɔ aatɔɔsɛ.<verse eid="GEN 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Kaale lasɛ nii, aabu disi aanɔ, nioso aakpee baalɛɛ afabablatɛ ku banumbentɛ bamuu di Egipte kasɔ baawako. Ni di Farao laka ma alaafɔ nɔɔ nwu nɛ, kafɔɔ kuonwii lɛma ditafuo nya kasɔ odiki ɔtɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Ninfɛ di nta nyɛɛnɛtɛ nɔɔfo nwu latɔkɔ Farao alɛ, &lt;&lt;Miɛ, ntoonyuma ɔtanlolaa nii ɔbla nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Obe onwii kamɛ, ɔblɔ lafiɛ Farao di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ suoto, ni faatɛ ami ku bloblo fiɛtɛ nɔɔfo leeyo katenkɔ di asaa banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ leyo nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Dii ninwii kakyɛ, obiala loo lasɛ kɔlaafɔ kunwii, kɔlaafɔ biala lawɛ lɛsɔdiki nɔɔ lete. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Awo ku Hebri batii okosopo onwii niawɛ ninfa, asaa banyuntɛ kanyayilatɛ kpɛmblatɛ aale. Ni buaka nwɔ alaafɔ loo nwu, ni aatɔkɔ obiala loo kɔlaafɔ lɛsɔdiki nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Sɛlaa nwu lawa kaanya pɛpɛɛpɛ fɛ mmle aadiki kasɔ aata wo nii: faakplesa ɔkpɛ nii wɔ latɔɔbla ni faatɛɛ, kafɔɔ osuɔtɔ nyɔɔfa nnwɔɔ, faasaka nwɔ faalo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Nioso Farao lakpee alɛ balaakpaa Yosef bawako, ni baalaadiki nwɔ wla di leyo katenkɔ nɛ. Di Yosef lakpaasu disi, aakyɛlɛnsa akpeele nɔɔ aaloo nii, ni aakyɛ Farao nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Ninfɛ di Farao latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lasɛ kɔlaafɔ, kuonwii diefuo kũ kasɔ odiki. Kafɔɔ lenu alɛ nse bɛɛka fɔ kɔlaafɔ fanfuo kũ kasɔ odiki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Kafɔɔ Yosef latɔkɔ Farao alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami namafuo ɔbla, kafɔɔ Yaa kamabuɛ ɔlaa wɔ nimata otu nte ni Farao.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Ni di Farao latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Di kɔlaafɔ nii kamɛ layila di Nile okle kotoko, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />nfanwu banankyue bakuɛnsĩ ba nikɔlɛ ni onyu, beemuɔ ni niadie di okle nwu kamɛ baakyako lɛnwaakɛ owee. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Mma sɛmaa, banankyue bakuɛnsĩ bamba wakalaa lalaale niadie di okle nwu kamɛ. Diidii ninnya banankyue ba niɛlalaa ni fɛ mba mmle okle di Egipte kasɔ. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Ni di banankyue wakalaa, lalaale nwu lamufũ bakuɛnsĩ ba niamuɔ ni baakasa ni odie baamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Kafɔɔ nu baamɛ ma yi, kuonwii dilaatofo alɛ bɛɛmɛ lɛsaa; nkpo nwu baate lalaale fɛ mmle okle baate ni nɛ. Ni lasɛnkɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />&lt;&lt;Di kɔlaafɔ nyɔɔfa nii kamɛ, lanya etita epũ ekuɛnsĩ be ninkpe ni suoto silɛ ni, nka di otitawoso onwii suoto. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Mmi nkpo sɛmaa, etita epũ ekuɛnsĩ bamba fioloo, kosole ta kufĩ katunkɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ oso. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Ni di epũ fioloo nwu lamɛ epũ ekuɛnsĩ be niamuɔ ni nɛ. Laka alaafɔ ya mmle afabablatɛ, kafɔɔ kuonwii lɛma ditafuo nya kasɔ odiki ɔtɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Ninfɛ di Yosef latɔkɔ Farao alɛ, &lt;&lt;Farao ɔlaa onwii ko di alaafɔ nwu nle. Yaa nintoodiki eetuo Farao lɛsaale oomiɛ alɛ abla nii. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Banankyue bakuɛnsĩ biene nwu nle alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ, etita epũ biene ekuɛnsĩ nwu kafɔɔ nle alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ; alaafɔ nwu anyɔ lɛsɔdiki ninwii dile. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Banankyue bakuɛnsĩ kosole, lalaale nwu niadie ni sɛɛmaa nle alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ, nkpo kafɔɔ di etita epũ ekuɛnsĩ nwu kosole ta kufĩ katunkɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ nɛ: Kɔka ɔkpɛ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ dile.<verse eid="GEN 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />&lt;&lt;Dibawa kaanya fɛ mmle lɛtɔkɔ ni Farao: Yaa niediki eetuo Farao lɛsaa le oomiɛ alɛ abla nii. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Alesaa kamawɛ lɛɛpɔ kamɛ di Egipte kasɔ suoto alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Nnya kamaa kɔka kamakpɛ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ. Batii kamayee alesaa ya amuu kpinwu niawɛ ni di Egipte kasɔ, diekye kɔka nwu matɛ kunlalaasa asaa di kasɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Batii kamayee mmle baawɛ ni alesaa kpinwu kaasɔ nwu suoto, diekye kɔka ko nimakpɛ ni kanya matɛ kunwɛ osie nwaa. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Lɛsaale oso di Yaa lasɛɛsa ni Farao alaafɔ nwu di esuku ɛnyɔ ninle alɛ, Yaa ntɔɔtɛ eetika ɔlaa nwu difuɔ, nioso Yaa kamata ninwa kaanya wla.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />&lt;&lt;Nioso nunua Farao adiki otii wɔ niebe ni anu, aye ni lɛsaa, aayila di Egipte kasɔ kamuu kanya. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Di Farao adiki asaa kanyabayilatɛ di kasɔ nwu kamuu, baafũ dikyuu nɔɔnle di atitabi ya babawɛ ni di Egipte di alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ ya kamɛ babawɛ ni alesaa kpinwu. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Bafũ alesaa amuu di alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ biene ya nikɔwa ni kamɛ, baasiisa atitabi di sekpoo nwu di Farao leyooto kamɛ base bata alesaa ɔwɛ ole. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Balolaa atitabi nwu base nwaa bata kale nwu di alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ ya nikɔwa ni, di kɔka makpɛ ni di Egipte kasɔ, di mmle okle kɔɔka dilɔbalo ni batii di kale nwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Farao ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu lafũ ɔlaa nwu baakpee. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Nioso Farao lakaalɛ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bubawɛ otii fɛle Yosef okle, otii wɔ kamɛ di Yaa ninwuna nsi ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 41:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Ninfɛ di Farao latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Di Yaa ntoodiki asaa ya mmle amuu eetuo fɔ nii, kuonwii nsinnaa eebe ni anu, aye ni lɛsaa fɛle afɔ okle. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Nioso afɔ nfɛ nimayila di lɛsaa biala kanya di leyo nii, batii nii bamuu kafɔɔ manu fɔ ɔlaa. Lekpomii nii nwu lete oso mataka katoo nlenke fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 41:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosef Layila Di Egipte Asaa Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Nioso Farao latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kanunua ntɔɔyɔ fɔ lese di Egipte kasɔ kamuu kanya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Ni di Farao ladiki lɛkɔnii di leyooto nɔɔ ntika ni lɛɛnɛɛbi nɔɔ aakpee Yosef lɛɛnɛɛbi nɛ. Aakpee nwɔ akpeele wua baayɔ dibula fututu baakaa ni, ni aayɔ kotosɛɛle kɔnyɛnɛ aakpee nwɔ siimu nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Ni aatɔɔ aasiɛ di keke wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni kamɛ, fɛ nnwɔɔ nfɛ ninle ni otii nyɔɔfa wɔ baata ni dibu fɛle ɔka nɛ. Ni baatii latooyiisa kudu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bita osuku!&gt;&gt; Nioso aayɔ nwɔ aase di lɛsaa biala kanya di Egipte kasɔ kamuu suoto.<verse eid="GEN 41:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle Farao, kafɔɔ kuonwii nnaa osuku ambla lɛsaalɛsaa di Egipte kasɔ kamuu suoto se faatuna.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Ninfɛ di Farao lata Yosef leyooto fɔle alɛ Safnat Panea nɛ. Ni aayɔ oletatɛ di On, Potifera obisankobi Asnat aatɔɔ aayɔ fɛ ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ nɛ. Nioso Yosef lakyɛ aakyi Egipte kasɔ kamuu suoto.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Alɛɛ afosi atiɛ di Yosef lafũ fia aakyako ɔkpɛ ɔbla ɔta Egipte ɔka Farao. Di Yosef lakyɛ ni di Farao anu, aasifi aalaakyi Egipte kasɔ nwu kamuu. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ ya niatikanko ni bawo, kasɔ lalɛ baawɛ alesaa kpinwu. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yosef lafũ atitabi amuu aasiisa di sekpoo nwu di alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ ya kamɛ baawɛ ni alesaa kpinwu di Egipte kasɔ. Aata baasiisa atitabi ya baakpɛ ni di okpoo biala niamana siakyi ni baatɛ ninfa. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yosef lasiisa atitabi kpinwu fɛle lekpo ɔtɛnsia; lɛpɔ ninya oso nfɛ aadiɛ nya nsũ ɔtɛ, diekye nfɛ aapɔ aalenkee mmle aaklapoosa nya nii.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Potifera, oletatɛ di On, obisankobi Asnat lalofo babisuɔtɔbi banyɔ aata Yosef fiɛ di alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ ya di kɔka labakpɛ ni lawa. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yosef latika obi nɔɔ kasale leyooto alɛ Manase ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Diekye Yaa ntɔɔtɛɛ leyee dibuo nii nimuu ku teemi leyo batii bamuu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Yosef latika obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nyɔɔfa leyooto alɛ Efraim ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Diekye Yaa ntɔɔtɛɛ lɛwɛ babi di kasɔ ka suoto diobuo mi nii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ ya di alesaa lalɛ ni di Egipte kasɔ ntooloo, <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />ni di alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ ya di kɔka makpɛ ni lakye kasɔ nɛ, fɛ mmle okle di Yosef labuɛ nii. Kɔka lakpɛ di nsɔ bamba mmuu, kafɔɔ alesaa lawɛ di Egipte kasɔ kamuu suoto. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Obe wɔ di Egipte batii bamuu lakyako ni kɔka onu, ni di bamuu lɛma lawi baakpee Farao alɛ ata ma alesaa nɛ. Ni di Farao latɔkɔ Egipte batii bamuu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitɔɔkyɛ Yosef nfũ, biɛbla lɛsaa lele ɛɛtɔkɔ ye alɛ bibla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 41:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Obe wɔ di kɔka nwu lakpɛ kuakyaka ni kale nwu kamuu yi, ni di Yosef lasɛkɛtɛ atitabi ntɛkɔ nwu aasunsũ atitabi aata Egipte batii nɛ, diekye kɔka nwu kanya latɛ kuawɛ osie di Egipte kasɔ kamuu suoto. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Ni di nnle mmuu lawa Egipte babaya atitabi di Yosef nfũ nɛ, diekye kɔka nwu kanya latɛ kuawɛ osie di kayi kamuu kamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s1">Yosef Babilɛma Lakyɛ Egipte Baalaaya Atitabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Obe wɔ di Yakob lanu alɛ atitabi nkpe ni di Egipte kasɔ yi, ni aakaalɛ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obe oso bisi bionyu bawo di anu nkpo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Aakple aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lenu alɛ atitabi nkpe di Egipte. Bikyɛ nfa biɛlaaya awo biwako wo, di mmle buasiɛ ni nkpa munaakpi ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Nioso Yosef babilɛma suɔtɔbi lefosi nwu lakyɛ baalaaya atitabi di Egipte. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Kafɔɔ Yakob ditatuna alɛ Benyamin, Yosef obilɛma bisɔnle atikanko babilɛma, diekye aatɔɔyɛkɛ alɛ lɛsaa kpile lewo kamanaabla nwɔ. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Nioso Israel babi lasiɛ di batii ba niakyɛ Egipte baalaaya ni atitabi kamɛ. Diekye kɔka lawɛ di Kanaan kasɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Yosef niale Egipte kasɔ nwu kanyayilatɛ, otii wɔ niatoosunsũ ni atitabi aatɔɔta ni batii bamuu. Nioso obe wɔ di Yosef babilɛma lakyɛ baalaabuo nii, baawakosa suoto kasɔ, baase ntũ kaasɔ baatɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Kafɔɔ di Yosef lanya ni babilɛma suɔtɔbi, aatofo ma, kafɔɔ aabla fɛ aaye ma, aakakatɛko ma osie osie. Ninfɛ aakaalɛ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔfɛ biekye?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kanaan kasɔ buokye buɔwa atitabi ɔya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Kuntɛ Yosef latofo babilɛma yi, mma batatofo nwɔ. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Ni aanyuma alaafɔ nɔɔ ya aasɛ ni di suoto lɛma nɛ, ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔtɛtɛɛ biɛwa wo! Biɛwa bilɛ biɔbanyu nse bubafuo suoto loo ɔta nse kakpɛ ledieko wo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Oowo, saate nii! Atitabi di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lɛwa ɔya. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Otii onwii babisuɔtɔbi bule. Batii biene di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nle, diele ɔtɛtɛɛ buɔwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Oowo, biɛwa bilɛ biɔbanyu nse bubafuo suoto loo ɔta nse kakpɛ ledieko wo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Kafɔɔ baadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ yi, osuɔtɔ onwii ninsi ni di Kanaan babisuɔtɔbi bule, babilɛma suɔtɔbi lefosi banyɔ buale. Obisɔnle nkpe di teewo ɔkyɛ, onwii kafɔɔ nsinnaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Ni di Yosef latɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔlaa wɔ lɛtɔkɔ ye ni nte nkpo: Ɔtɛtɛɛ biɛwa! <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Nwaako di Farao lɛnya asi ni nkpa, Nnya mmle babasɔ ye mannyu ni: bilɔbadie ninfũ bisifi diediki obilee osuɔtɔbi bisɔnle nwu lɛwa ninfũ fiɛ. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Bikpee obilee onwii kaamɛ lee aalaakpaa obilee suɔtɔbi nwu awako; kamayɔ babule lee ntɛ leeyoo katenkɔ, munnyu nse nwaako ɔlaa biobuɛ. Nse biɛwako nwɔ, ni di Farao lɛnya asi ni nkpa, ni ɔwa biɛwa wo ɔtɛtɛɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Ni di Yosef lamufũ bamuu lɛma aasiɛsa ayi atiɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Di dii tiɛfa, Yosef latɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bibla di mmle lɛtɔkɔ ye ni kanya biɛwɛ nkpa, diekye otii wɔ ninyɛkɛ ni Yaa nle: <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Nse batii biene bile, ni bidiɛ obilee suɔtɔbi onwii asiɛ di leyo katenkɔ, di babule lee bitɔɔkyɛ biɛlaayɔ atitabi bikyɛnko leyo lee batii ba di kɔka kolo ni. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Kafɔɔ nse biokple minwa nfũ biɛkpaa osuɔtɔbi lee bisɔnle biwakoe, mmle kamafũ ɔlaa nwu nnu ni, di mmle minaakpi ni.&gt;&gt; Ni baatuna alɛ bababla di nkpo kanya nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Ni baabuɛ nimma nimma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwaako obiloo suɔtɔbi oso bɔɔnanfi wo kootoko nɛ. Buanya dibuo le kamɛ aasiɛ ni di obe wɔ aatootikiti wo ni lekoto di nkpa nɔɔ disi, kafɔɔ butanu; nni oso di dibuo le mmle kɔwa wo di suoto nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Ruben ladiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntatɔkɔ ye nlɛ bitambla okpile di osuɔtɔbi nwu suoto? Kafɔɔ bitanu! Bitɔɔnya, nunua dikpeni buofũ ntɔ nɔɔ letoko nanfi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Batatofo alɛ Yosef konu ma sele, diekye otii niatoodiki kasɔ aatɔɔta ma di sele lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Ni di Yosef ladiɛ ma aasifi aalaawi kaku, kafɔɔ aakple aawa aabakakatɛko ma. Ni aata baamufũ Simeon baanii di anu lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosef Babilɛma Lakple Baasifi Kanaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Ninfɛ di Yosef latɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ bayiisa bakotoku lɛma ku atitabi, baakplesa obiala lɛma koto futuutu batika ma di atitabi nwu osi di bakotoku lɛma kamɛ. Aatɔkɔ ma kafɔɔ alɛ bata ma alesaa ya babale ni di osuku. Baabla nkpo baata ma ni sɛmaa, <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />ni baanii atoo lɛma baatika di babɔkɛɛ lɛma ba nintuka ni atoo suoto, ni baasifi nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 42:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Di lɛba le baate ni ku kakyɛ, onwii lɛma lafukuti kotoku nɔɔ alɛ ookusii atitabi anta bɔkɛɛ nɔɔ wɔ nintuka ni atoo, ni aanya koto fututu nɔɔ di atitabi osi di kotoku kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Ni aatɔkɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Beekplesa koto fututu nii bɛɛtɛɛ, nya kũ di kotoku nii kamɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Ɔfɔɔ lasifi ma, baamunikĩi baanyu bawo ku ditũtũkũ baabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obe ninle nle mmle di Yaa lɛbla wo ni nɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Obe wɔ baabuo ni ote lɛma Yakob nfũ di Kanaan kasɔ, baatɔkɔ nwɔ ɔlaa wɔ omuu niawa ma ni di suoto. Baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />&lt;&lt;Osuɔtɔ wɔ ninle ni saate di kasɔ nwu suoto lakakatɛ ko wo osie osie aabla wo fɛle kasɔ nwu buɔwa ɔtɛtɛɛ. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Kafɔɔ buatɔkɔ nwɔ bulɛ, &lt;Batii biene bule; diele ɔtɛtɛɛ buɔwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Lefosi basuɔtɔbi banyɔ buale, ote loo onwii. Onwii nsinnaa, obisɔnle kafɔɔ nkpe ku teewo di Kanaan kasɔ.&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />&lt;&lt;Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ wɔ ninle ni saate di kasɔ nwu suoto latɔkɔ wo alɛ, &lt;Nnya nle mmle mayɔ ntofo nse batii biene bile ni: Bidiɛ obilee suɔtɔbi onwii di ɔkyɛ nii ninfũ, biɛyɔ atitabi bikyɛnko leyo lee batii ba di kɔka kolo ni. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Kafɔɔ bikpaa obilee bisɔnle biwakoe nintofo nlɛ diele ɔtɛtɛɛ biɛwa kafɔɔ batii biene bile ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:34">Ni madiki obilee suɔtɔbi nta ye, minsunsũ asaa di kasɔ loo suoto.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Baanyɛɛnɛ ni atitabi di bakotoku lɛma, obiala lɛma koto fututu dikudi lasiɛ di kotoku nɔɔ kamɛ! Di mma ku ote lɛma baanya ni koto akudi nwu, difu lapɛ ma. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Ni di ote lɛma Yakob latɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitɔɔta babi nii leyu. Yosef nsinnaa, Simeon nsinnaa, nunua biomiɛ bilɛ bikpaa Benyamin kafɔɔ. Ami nfɛ nikonu dibuo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Ninfɛ di Ruben latɔkɔ ote alɛ, &lt;&lt;Faafuo babi nii nwu banyɔ olo nse ninkplesa Benyamin nwako fɔ. Yɔ nwɔ fakpee mi ninnɛɛ, makplesa nwɔ nwako.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Kafɔɔ Yakob labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obisuɔtɔbi nii dilɔbatikanko ye akyɛ; diekye obilɛma ntookpi lete nɔɔ nintoobu nɛ. Nse lɛsaa lɛlaabla nwɔ di osuku wɔ biofe nii, bibatɛɛ nkpi ku disi pule nsifi kasɔ kamɛ ku sɛnyaami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s1">Yosef Babilɛma Lakple Baakyɛ Egipte Ku Benyamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Kɔka lanwini kuatɔɔkpɛ osie kanya di kasɔ nwu. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Nioso obe wɔ baale atitabi ya baakyeko ni Egipte kasɔ baaloo nii, Yakob latɔkɔ babi suɔtɔbi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bikple bikyɛ biɛlaaya atitabi awo biwako.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Kafɔɔ Yuda latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Osuɔtɔ wɔ niasunsũ atitabi aata wo ni lafunaa wo osie kanya alɛ, &lt;Nse biɛkpaa obilee suɔtɔbi bisɔnle biwako, ni bitanwa mi anu.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Nioso, nse fabata obiloo suɔtɔbi bisɔnle ntikanko wo, ni bubakyɛ munaaya atitabi munwako fɔ. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Kafɔɔ nse flɔbatɔɔ atikanko wo, ni bulɔbakyɛ nfa, diekye osuɔtɔ nwu latɔkɔ wo alɛ, &lt;Bitanwa mi anu nse biɛkpaa obilee suɔtɔbi bisɔnle biwako.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Ninfɛ di Israel lakaalɛ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be oso biatɔkɔ osuɔtɔ nwu bilɛ bikpe obilɛma suɔtɔbi bamba, biɛta dibuo le mmle kɔwa mi di suoto?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Osuɔtɔ nwu niakaalɛ awo bamu suoto ku leyo loo batii disi. Aakaalɛ wo alɛ, &lt;Teeye lekple akpe nkpa? Biekple bikpe obilɛma suɔtɔbi bamba?&gt; Ni buodiki kanya di sɛlaa nwu suoto nɛ. Lɛ bubatofo bulɛ abatɔkɔ wo alɛ, &lt;Bikpaa obilee suɔtɔbi nwu biwako ninfũ&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Ninfɛ di Yuda latɔkɔ ote Israel alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tɛɛ nkpaa osuɔtɔbi nwu nsifiko nunua, di awo ku afɔ ku babiloo dilɔbakpi ni. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Ami omu mayila nwɔ kamaa nlɛ abakple anwa; kaalɛ mi ɔlaa nse ninkple ko nwɔ nwako. Nse ninkple ko nwɔ nwako fɔ yi, ni mafũ lɛpɔɔ olo ntika di suoto di nkpa nii mmuu kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Nse diele obe buɔlalaasa, nse butɔɔkyɛ nfa sɛnyɔ buokple.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Ninfɛ di ote lɛma Israel latɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nse nkpo kute, ni bibla nle mmle: Biyɔ asaa nwaa ya awo ninkpe ni di kasɔ loo bikpee di bakotoku lee kamɛ bikyɛnko osuɔtɔ nwu fɛ akyɛsaa. Biyɔ nnɔnyi ku bablɔ kɛɛkɛ ku akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa ku olufui akotoa ku bablɔfɔ akotoa awo. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Biyɔ koto fututu akyuu nɔɔ anyɔ okle biklee, diekye dikpeni biekplesa koto fututu ko baayɔ baakpee ni di bakotoku lee kamɛ biɛkyɛnko ma. Loo bia kayee kaale. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Bikpaa kafɔɔ obilee suɔtɔbi nwu biekple bitɔɔkyɛ osuɔtɔ nwu nfũ. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni anya ye nyaami di osuɔtɔ nwu anu, aadiɛ obilee nwu ku Benyamin biekple biwa. Kafɔɔ ami yi, nse babi nii leloo okpi, kamasiɛ nkpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Nioso basuɔtɔ nwu layɔ akyɛsaa nwu ku koto fututu ko babaya ni atitabi nwu akyuu anyɔ, baakpaa Benyamin kafɔɔ. Ni baapɛsɛwa baasifi Egipte baalaayila di Yosef anu nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Di Yosef lanya ni Benyamin ku mma yi, ni aatɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔfo di leyo nɔɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaa basuɔtɔ ba mmle fasifiko leyo nii, lo bɔkɛɛ faawa alesaa; diekye munko ma bubale alesaa ku kakũ ka mmle.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Osuɔtɔ nwu labla fɛ mmle di Yosef latɔkɔ nwɔ nii, ni aakpaa ma aasifiko Yosef leyo nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Lɛyɛkɛ lapɛ ma di obe wɔ baakpaa ma baasifiko ni Yosef leyo. Baatoobu diisi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Koto fututu ko baayɔ baakpee ni di bakotoku loo kamɛ di nfũ loo lɛwa kasale oso bɛɛkpaa wo bɛɛwako nfũ nɛ. Oomiɛ alɛ akpɛko wo aamufũ wo fɛ balanle, aayɔ babɔkɛɛ loo ba nintuka ni atoo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Nioso baakyɛ Yosef kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔfo nwu nfũ di leyo nɔɔ nwu kayoko baalaakakatɛ ko nwɔ. <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />Ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔnɔɔfo, lekoto, buawa nfũ lɛkasale buabaya atitabi. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Kafɔɔ di lɛba le buasoosa buate ni ku kakyɛ, buafukuti ni bakotoku loo, ni di obiala loo lanya koto fututu ko aaya ni atitabi di kotoku nɔɔ kamɛ nɛ. Nioso buokplesa kũ buɔwako. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Buoye otii wɔ niayɔ koto nwu aakpee ni di bakotoku loo kamɛ. Buɔwako kafɔɔ koto bamba bubaya ni atitabi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Binya otu, bitanyɛkɛ. Yaa lee ku teeye Yaa niata ye koto di bakotoku lee kamɛ; ami niafũ koto lee nwu.&gt;&gt; Ni aalaakpaa Simeon aawako ma nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu lakpaa ma aasifiko Yosef leyo, aalaata ma ntu baafoto nkpaa lɛma, ni aata babɔkɛɛ lɛma ba nintuka ni atoo alesaa nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Ni baalolaa akyɛsaa lɛma nwu baatɛ Yosef ɔwabee ku kakũ nwu nɛ. Diekye baanu alɛ ku nnwɔɔ babale alesaa ninfa.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Obe wɔ di Yosef lawa ni leyo, ni baayɔ akyɛsaa ya baawako ni leyo baatɔɔ, ni baawa kasɔ baase ntũ kaasɔ di anu nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Ni aakaalɛ ma mmle bate nii, ni aakple aakaalɛ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lɛ di teeye nɔɔfo nwu ɔlaa biatɔkɔ mi ni nte? Eekple akpe nkpa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Ni baatuna alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teewo kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lekple akpe nkpa, akpe osie.&gt;&gt; Ni baawa kasɔ di dibu kanya baatɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Aanyunyu ma aafenko nii, aanya obilɛma suɔtɔbi Benyamin, ɔyabi nɔɔ, ni aakaalɛ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Osuɔtɔbi lee bisɔnle ninle nwɔ nɛ, nnwɔ ɔlaa biatɔkɔ mi ni nɛ?&gt;&gt; Ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obi nii suɔtɔbi, Yaa ale fɔ sibualɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Di Yosef lanya ni obilɛma suɔtɔbi diakpanko nwɔ di otu, ni aapɛsɛwa aadie di anu lɛma aalaamiɛ lɛba le aawi ni kaku nɛ. Ni aasifi kawofakɔ di leyo nɔɔ kamɛ aalaawi kaku ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 43:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Aafoto nnumɛɛ di anu nɔɔ aaloo nii, ni aadie aawa nɛ, aamufũ suoto nɔɔ aaklee, ni aatɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bisɛ alesaa nwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 43:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Ninfɛ baata Yosef ale nwɔ lete, baata babilɛma suɔtɔbi ale lete, baata Egipte batii ba kafɔɔ ninle ni alesaa ninfa kafɔɔ ale lete, diekye Egipte batii ninle alesaa ku Hebri batii, ta alɛ diyududusaa dile dita ma ni oso. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Diabla babilɛma suɔtɔbi nwu ɔkpɛ; batoonyu bawo di anu di mmle kanya baasiɛsa ma ni di sɛnɔɔfo kanya di Yosef anu, diayɔ ni di ɔnɔɔfole dialaase ni di obisɔnle. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Obe wɔ baatɔɔsɛ ma ni alesaa di Yosef opunu suoto yi, Benyamin ale lapɔ akyuu anɔɔ aalenkee obiala ale. Nioso baale, baanyi, baanya suoto lɛyɔɔ ku nnwɔɔ.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s1">Opũ Wɔ Niayu Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Ninfɛ di Yosef latɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔfo nɔɔ alɛ: &lt;&lt;Yiisa basuɔtɔ nwu bakotoku ku atitabi pɔ di mmle babafuo ni otuka, faayɔ obiala lɛma koto fakpee di kotoku nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Faayɔ koto fututu nii opũ nwu ku atitabi nɔɔ koto fututu fakpee di obisɔnle kotoku kamɛ.&gt;&gt; Nioso aabla fɛ mmle di Yosef latɔkɔ nwɔ nii.<verse eid="GEN 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Kaleesɛ kuyitatũ, basuɔtɔ nwu layefe osuku ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma ba nintuka ni atoo baatoosifi okpoo lɛma. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Di obe wɔ manadikyɛ ni kakyonkɔ di okpoo nwu, Yosef latɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔfo nɔɔ nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ti basuɔtɔ nwu nunua, nse fɛɛwɛ ma faakaalɛ ma falɛ, &lt;Be oso biɛyɔ dikpile biɛta dibiene koto? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Diele opũ wɔ mmle kamɛ di saate nii n-yɔ anyi ntu, an-yɔ nwu kafɔɔ ampɛ sɛbɔ nɛ? Lɛsaa kpile ninle nle mmle biɛbla ni nɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Obe wɔ di kpɛmblatɛ nwu lalaawɛ ma nii, aatɔkɔ ma fɛ mmle alɛ atɔkɔ ma nii. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Kafɔɔ baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be oso di saate loo kabuɛ sɛlaa se mmle nkpo? Nle mmle dikyɛ di okyo, alɛ buabla lɛsaa fɛ nle mmle okle! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Bia buakplesa koto fututu ko buanya ni di bakotoku loo kamɛ di Kanaan kasɔ buawako. Ni be oso nfɛ buayu koto fututu ee koto sɛɛle di saate lee leyo? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Nse fɛɛnya nwu di onwii loo ɔkyɛ, faalo nwɔ; ni babule loo kafɔɔ bubakple balanle munta saate loo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu latuna alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yioo, kulɛ, mabla fɛ mmle feebuɛ nii. Otii lele ɔkyɛ lɛnya opũ nwu nkpo makple mi ɔlanle; ole ku onwii dilɔbawɛ di babule lee suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Obiala lɛma lapɛsɛwa aasoosa kotoku nɔɔ aatɛ kaasɔ aafukuti kanya. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Ninfɛ di kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔfo nwu lakyako opũ nwu owolaa nɛ. Aakye kasɔ ku ɔnɔɔfole aalaayɛntɛ ku obisɔnle. Ni aanya opũ nwu di Benyamin kotoku kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Nkpo oso baabɛbɛɛ akpeele lɛma. Ni baakplesa atoo baatika di babɔkɛɛ lɛma ba nintuka ni atoo suoto baakple baasifi okpoo kplɛ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yosef lakple aawɛ leeyo fiɛ di Yuda ku babilɛma suɔtɔbi lawa babapɛ akunkyi kaasɔ di anu nɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Ni di Yosef lakaalɛ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be lɛsaa biɛbla nkpo nɛ? Bieye bilɛ osuɔtɔ fɛ ami okle mpɛ sɛbɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Ni di Yuda ladiki kanya alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be ninkpe wo mumbuɛ muntɔkɔ saate loo? Be buobuɛ? Lɛ nfɛ buale lɛbɛ? Yaa nintoodiki bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ sikpile kayi. Awo ku nnwɔ kotoku kamɛ bɛɛnya ni opũ nwu, saate loo balanle nfɛ bule.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Kafɔɔ Yosef labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaoo, ami nɔmafuo lɛsaa le mmle ɔbla! Osuɔtɔ wɔ kotoku kamɛ bɛɛnya ni opũ nwu lete nimale mi ɔlanle. Aye ba niebu nii bikple bitɔɔkyɛ teeye nfũ ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Latikiti Lekoto Di Benyamin Disi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Ninfɛ di Yuda lakpukuti aatɛɛtɛɛ Yosef aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ: &lt;&lt;Lekoto, saate nii, ta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ abuɛ ɔlaa onwii atɔkɔ saate nii. Tannya ɔblɔ faakpeeko kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, kuntɛ minko Farao omu bikyɛkyɛ. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Afɔ saate nii faakaalɛ bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ falɛ, &lt;Teeye ee obilɛma osuɔtɔbi bamba lekple akpe ye?&gt; <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Buadiki kanya bulɛ, &lt;Bukpe kote ko nintoobe ni, akpe obisuɔtɔbi baalofo baatɔɔ ni di sɛnɔɔfo nɔɔ kamɛ. Obilɛma suɔtɔbi ntookpi, lete nɔɔ nfɛ ninle ɔya obisuɔtɔbi wɔ niebu ni nɛ, ote kafɔɔ mbɔmbɔ nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />&lt;&lt;Ni faatɔkɔ wo falɛ, &lt;Bikpaa nwɔ biwakoe di ami omu nnyɔɔ.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Ni buatɔkɔ fɔ bulɛ, &lt;Osuɔtɔbi nwu dilɔbafuo odie odiɛ ote; nse eedie eediɛ nwɔ, ote nwu makpi.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Kafɔɔ faatɔkɔ wo falɛ, &lt;Nse biɛkpaa obilee suɔtɔbi bisɔnle biwako, ni bitanwa mi anu.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Buakple buasifi ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, teemi nfũ yi, buatɔkɔ nwɔ ɔlaa wɔ di afɔ saate nii labuɛ nii.<verse eid="GEN 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />&lt;&lt;Ni di teewo latɔkɔ wo alɛ, &lt;Bikple bikyɛ biɛlaaya atitabi awo biwako.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Kafɔɔ buatɔkɔ nwɔ bulɛ, &lt;Bulɔbafuo okple ɔkyɛ. Fiɛ bubakyɛ nii, diediki obiloo suɔtɔbi bisɔnle letikanko wo. Bulɔbafuo osuɔtɔ nwu anu ɔnya nse osuɔtɔbi loo bisɔnle diesi wo kaamɛ.&gt;<verse eid="GEN 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />&lt;&lt;Ninfɛ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ teemi latɔkɔ wo alɛ, &lt;Biye bilɛ babisuɔtɔbi banyɔ di ɔsɔfɔ nii lalofo aatɛɛ. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Onwii ntoosifi eediɛ mi, ni labuɛ nlɛ, &lt;&lt;Bɔkɛɛ kplɛ owo labɛbɛɛ nwɔ kɔkyɛɛkɔkyɛɛ.&gt;&gt; Diayɔ ni di obe nwu kamaa ninsinnyɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Nse biɛkpaa nnwɔ mmle kafɔɔ biesifiko di ɔlaa kpile owo lɛwa nwɔ di suoto, ni bibata disi fututu nii mbuo di ɔkya kamɛ ku sɛnyaami.&gt;<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />&lt;&lt;Nioso nunua, nse lɛkyɛ teemi kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nfũ, di osuɔtɔbi nwu di teemi mbɔmbɔ ni nwaa, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />ɛɛnya alɛ osuɔtɔbi nwu diesiwo kaamɛ yi, ni abakpi. Ni awo bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ mata teewo disi fututu nwu mbuo di ɔkya kamɛ ku sɛnyaami. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Ami kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ niayila kamaa latɔkɔ teemi nlɛ, malolaa osuɔtɔbi nwu nnyu nwaa. Latɔkɔ nwɔ nlɛ, &lt;Nse ninkpleko nwɔ nwako fɔ, ni teete, lekpi fɔ lɛpɔɔ di nkpa nii mmuu kamɛ!&gt;<verse eid="GEN 44:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />&lt;&lt;Nioso lekoto, ta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ asiɛ ninfũ fɛ saate nii ɔlanle di osuɔtɔbi nwu disi, faata osuɔtɔbi nwu akple asifi manko babilɛma suɔtɔbi. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Lɛ makple nsifi teemi nfũ alɛ osuɔtɔbi nwu dietikanko mi? Oowo! Tantɛɛ lanya mmle di teemi mabuo ni sɛnyaami ku anu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s1">Yosef Ladiki Suoto Aatuo Babilɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Yosef ditasinfuo otu okpee di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ bamuu anu, ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bamuu lee bidiesa suoto kayi di anu nii!&gt;&gt; Nioso kuonwii ditasinwɛ fiɛ di Yosef ladiki suoto aatuo babilɛma suɔtɔbi. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Ni afaa kaku osie kanya diata alɛ Egipte batii lanu nwɔ kaku nwu, Farao leyo batii kafɔɔ lanu nwu ole.<verse eid="GEN 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yosef latɔkɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle Yosef nɛ! Teemi lekple akpe nkpa?&gt;&gt; Kafɔɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi ditafuo kanya ɔbɛ, diekye lɛyɛkɛ lapɛ ma ta baanyɔɔ ni oso.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Ninfɛ di Yosef latɔkɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitɛɛtɛɛ mi.&gt;&gt; Obe wɔ baatɛɛ nwɔ baaloo nii, ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle obilee suɔtɔbi Yosef, nnwɔ biasunsũ biakyesee ni Egipte nɛ! <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Kafɔɔ nunua binya otu, bitanta diabuo ye suoto alɛ biasunsũ mi biata batii ba niakpaa mi baawako ni nfũ, diekye mmle kafũ ni batii nkpa oso di Yaa lakyesee mi aalesa ye katũ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Diekye alɛɛ anyɔ nfɛ di kɔka kɔkpɛ ni di kasɔ ka mmle nɛ, nioso kubakple kunkpɛ alɛɛ anɔɔ di afe ɔkpɛ ku alesaa ɔyɔ dilɔbawɛ nii. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Kafɔɔ Yaa lakyesee mi aalesa ye katũ, alɛ kanyu nlɛ batii lee basɛɛ biebu biesiɛ kaasɔ ka mmle, nfũ ye nkpa di didiki kplɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />&lt;&lt;Nioso, Yaa niakyesee mi nfũ, diele aye. Ɛɛblɛɛ fɛ kote ɛɛta Farao, ku saate ɛɛta leyo nɔɔ batii bamuu kanyayilatɛ ku tunletɛ di Egipte kasɔ kamuu suoto. <verse eid="GEN 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Nunua bikple bisifi wla, biɛlaatɔkɔ teemi bilɛ, &lt;Obi suɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Yosef alɛ: Yaa ntɔɔblɛɛ saate di Egipte kasɔ kamuu suoto. Sifi fawa ɔkyɛ nii; tanlalaasa obe. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Basiɛ di Gosen kasɔ fakaakoe, afɔ ku babi lɛfɔ ku bawa lɛfɔ, bafoso ku batie ku banankyue ku asaa ya ninkpe fɔ ni amuu. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Manyu ye kanya ninfa, diekye alɛɛ anɔɔ amu nikɔwa di kɔka makpɛ nii. Nse diele nkpo ni dipii kamamufũ afɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ ku asaa ya ninkpe fɔ ni amuu.&gt;<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />&lt;&lt;Aye bamu biɔnya, nkpo kafɔɔ di obiloo suɔtɔbi Benyamin kɔnya alɛ, ami Yosef omu nikokakatɛ nta ye nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Bitɔkɔ teemi dibu le nimuu bɛɛtɛɛ ni di Egipte kasɔ ku lɛsaa biala biɛnya ni. Bikpaa teemi biwakoe wla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Ninfɛ aayɔ nnɛɛ nɔɔ aaminisa obilɛma suɔtɔbi Benyamin aawi kaku, ni di Benyamin kafɔɔ laminiko nwɔ aatoowi kaku nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Ninfɛ aafĩfĩɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi bamuu akpoo aawi kaku nɛ. Nni sɛmaa babilɛma suɔtɔbi lakakatɛ ko nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Obe wɔ di Farao lanu ni di leyo nɔɔ alɛ Yosef babilɛma suɔtɔbi ntɔɔwa nii, suoto layɔɔ Farao ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Ni di Farao latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tɔkɔ babilee suɔtɔbi falɛ, &lt;Babla mmle: Biyɔ atoo lee bitika di babɔkɛɛ lee ba nintuka ni atoo suoto biekple bisifi Kanaan kasɔ, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />biɛlaakpaa teeye ku leyo lee batii biwakoe. Mata ye kasɔ ka ninlɛ ni nwaa di Egipte, minya kasɔ nwu lɛlɛ ɔmɛnɛfɛ.&gt;<verse eid="GEN 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />&lt;&lt;Tɔkɔ babilee suɔtɔbi kafɔɔ falɛ, &lt;Bibla mmle: Biyɔ bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni bawo di Egipte kasɔ bikpaa babi lee ku basɔfɔ lee, biɛkpaa teeye biɛwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Bitannyu bilɛ biɔyɔ asaa lee amuu minwako, diekye asaa nwaa ya amuu ninkpe ni di Egipte maleye ale.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Nioso Israel babi labla nkpo. Yosef lata ma bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi nii, fɛ mmle di Farao labuɛ nii, ni aata ma kafɔɔ alesaa ya babale ni di osuku nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Aata obiala lɛma dibula fɔle, kafɔɔ Benyamin nnwɔɔ aatɔɔ koto fututu akudi alafa atiɛ ku abula sɛkpa sɛnɔɔ. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Nnya asaa ya aakyesee ni ote: aakpee atoo ya di Egipte asaa nwaa nsi ni kaamɛ aatukasa babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo basuɔtɔ lefosi. Aayɔ atitabi ku bloblo ku asaa bamba ya di ote maklee ni osuku aatukasa babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo basanko lefosi. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Ninfɛ aadiki babilɛma suɔtɔbi osuku nɛ, baatoosifi nii, aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitanlɔ di osuku lo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Nioso baadie di Egipte baawa Kanaan kasɔ di ote lɛma Yakob nfũ. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Ni baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yosef lekple akpe nkpa! Nwaako, nnwɔɔ ninle kanyayilatɛ di Egipte kasɔ kamuu suoto nɛ.&gt;&gt; Diabla Yakob ɔkpɛ; atafũ ma anu. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ baatɔkɔ nwɔ ni sɛlaa se simuu di Yosef labuɛ aatɔkɔ ma nii, aanya ni bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni, di Yosef lakyesee alɛ babatuka nwɔ ku leyo nɔɔ batii ku atoo nɔɔ bawako ni Egipte kasɔ, ni di ɔnyɛɛ lakple kuabuo ote lɛma Yakob nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Ni di Israel labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntoofũ lenu! Obisuɔtɔbi nii Yosef lekple akpe nkpa. Makyɛ nnaanyɔɔ fiɛ ninkpi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s1">Yakob Ku Leyo Nɔɔ Batii Lasifi Egipte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Nioso Yakob layefe osuku ku leyo nɔɔ batii ku asaa nɔɔ amuu niale nwɔ ni ale, obe wɔ aadu ni Beerseba, aata oleɔta aata ote Isak Yaa.<verse eid="GEN 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Ninfɛ di Yaa lakakatɛ ko Israel ku kakyɛ di odiki otuo kamɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yakob! Yakob!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Ni aatuna alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nnyɛɛ ninfũ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Ni di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ami ninle Yaa, teete lɛfɔ Yaa, tanyɛkɛ Egipte kasɔ ɔkyɛ, diekye mabla fɔ kale kplɛ ninfa. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Makyɛ Egipte kasɔ nwu ku afɔ, nwaako kafɔɔ makplesa fɔ nwako kasɔ lɛfɔ suoto. Yosef kɔnɛɛ kumu kafɔɔ nimatĩi fɔ anu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Ninfɛ di Yakob ladie di Beerseba, ni di Israel babisuɔtɔbi lakpaa ote lɛma Yakob ku babi ku basɔfɔ lɛma di bakeke ba di Farao lakyesee alɛ balatuka nwɔ ni nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Nioso Yakob ku banantii nɔɔ lasifi Egipte kasɔ. Baakpaa babɔkɛɛ sele lɛma bamuu, ku asaa ya amuu niawɛ ma ni di Kanaan kasɔ baasifiko. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Aakpaa babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ku bawa suɔtɔbi ku babisankobi ku bawa sankobi ku banantii nɔɔ bamuu aasifiko Egipte kasɔ.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Nnya Israel babisuɔtɔbi ayooto (Yakob ku banantii nɔɔ) ba niasifi ni Egipte kasɔ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 46:8" />
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 46:8">Ruben niale Yakob obi kasale.<verse eid="GEN 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Ruben babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:9">Hanok, Palu, Hesron ku Karmi.<verse eid="GEN 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Simeon babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:10">Yemuel, Yamin, Ohad, Yakin, Sohar ku Saul wɔ nianle ni Kanaan ɔsanko obisuɔtɔbi.<verse eid="GEN 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Lewi babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:11">Gerson, Kohat ku Merari.<verse eid="GEN 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Yuda babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:12">Er, Onan, Sela, Peres ku Serah (kafɔɔ Er ku Onan lakpi di Kanaan kasɔ).</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:12">Peres babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="GEN 46:12">Hosron ku Hamul.<verse eid="GEN 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Isakar babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:13">Tola, Puwa, Yahub ku Simron.<verse eid="GEN 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Sebulun babisuɔtɔbi nianle:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:14">Sered, Elon ku Yahleel.<verse eid="GEN 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Mba mmle niale Lea babisuɔtɔbi ba aalofo aata ni Yakob di Paddam Aram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Misopoamia</char></note>, di obisankobi Dina nkyakaa ni nɛ. Babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi nɔɔ bamuu labla afosi atiɛ babi batiɛ.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Gad babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:16">Sifon, Hagi, Suni, Esbon, Eri, Arodi ku Areli.<verse eid="GEN 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Aser babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:17">Yimna, Isua, Isui ku Beria.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:17">Obilɛma sankobi niale Sera.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:17">Beria babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:17">Heber ku Malkiel.<verse eid="GEN 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Mba mmle niale babi ba di Silpa lalofo aata ni Yakob nɛ, nnwɔ di Laban layɔ aata ni obisankobi nɔɔ Lea, bamuu labla lefosi batii bakuɔ.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Yakob ɔsɔfɔ Rahel babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:19">Yosef ku Benyamin. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Potifera, oletatɛ di On obisankobi Asenat lalofo Manase ku Efraim aata Yosef di Egipte kasɔ.<verse eid="GEN 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Benyamin babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:21">Bela, Beker, Asbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Ros, Mupim, Hup ku Ard.<verse eid="GEN 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Mba mmle niale babisuɔtɔbi ba di Rahel lalofo aata ni Yakob nɛ, bamuu labla lefosi batii bana.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Dan obisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:23">Husim.<verse eid="GEN 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Naftali babisuɔtɔbi niale:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:24">Yahseel, Guni, Yeser ku Silem.<verse eid="GEN 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Mba mmle niale babisuɔtɔbi ba di Bilha lalofo aata ni Yakob nɛ, nnwɔ di Laban layɔ aata ni obisankobi nɔɔ Rahel, bamuu labla batii bakuɛnsĩ.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Batii ba bamuu niasifi ni Egipte kasɔ ku Yakob, baale nwɔ ni kafutu kamɛ kamu banantii, di babisɔfɔ nɔɔ ditasiɛ ni kaamɛ labla afosi akuɔ batii bakuɔ. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Ku babisuɔtɔbi ba banyɔ baalofo baata ni Yosef di Egipte kasɔ, nioso Yakob leyo kamɛ batii ba niasifi ni Egipte bamuu labla batii afosi akuɛnsĩ.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakob lakyesee Yuda alɛ ale nwɔ katũ aalaakaalɛ Yosef osuku wɔ babafe mansifi ni Gosen. Obe wɔ baabuo ni Gosen kasɔ, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yosef lata baayɔ bakeke nɔɔ ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni baawako nwɔ, ni aakyɛ aalaakyakako ote Israel di Gosen nɛ. Obe wɔ di Yosef lakyɔɔ ni ɔkyɔɔ di anu nɔɔ, ni aayɔ nnɛɛ nɔɔ aaminisa ote, aafaa kaku aawi aaklɛsa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 46:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Ninfɛ di Israel latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nunua nfɛ kafuo okpi, diekye ami omu ntɔɔnya nlɛ feekple fakpe nkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Ni di Yosef latɔkɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi ku ote leyo kamɛ batii alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɔkyɛ ninaatɔkɔ Farao nlɛ, &lt;Babiloo suɔtɔbi ku teemi leyo kamɛ batii ba ninsi ni di Kanaan kasɔ ntɔɔwa ɔkyɛ nii. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Babɔkɛɛbakpatɛ di batii nwu nle; bɔɔkpa babɔkɛɛ sele lɛma, bɛɛwako bafoso ku batie ku banankyue lɛma ku lɛsaa biala ninkpe ma nii.&gt; <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Nse Farao lɛlɛɛ ye ɛɛkaalɛ ye alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be ninle ɔkpɛ wɔ biɔbla ni?&gt; <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />bitɔkɔ nwɔ bilɛ, &lt;Diayɔ ni di sibisɔ loo obe kamɛ di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lakyako babɔkɛɛ ɔkpa, fɛ mmle di bawa loo labla nii.&gt; Ni abata ye osuku minsiɛ di Gosen kasɔ, diekye babɔkɛɛbakpatɛ lɛbla diyududusaa bɛɛta Egipte batii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Yosef lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ Farao alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teemi ku babiloo suɔtɔbi ku bafoso ku batie ku banankyue lɛma ku lɛsaa biala nikpe ma ni, ntookye Kanaan kasɔ bɛɛwa bakpe di Gosen kasɔ nunua.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Aakpaa babilɛma suɔtɔbi banɔɔ aalaadiki ma aatuo Farao.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Ninfɛ di Farao lakaalɛ babilɛma suɔtɔbi nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Be ninle ɔkpɛ wɔ biɔbla ni?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">&lt;&lt;Ni baatɔkɔ Farao alɛ, &lt;&lt;Babɔkɛɛbakpatɛ di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nle, fɛ mmle okle di bawa loo labla nii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Baakple baatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Buɔwa bulɛ bubasiɛ ninfũ kɛɛkɛ, diekye kɔka lɛtɛ kukpe osie di Kanaan kasɔ, sɛfa kɔnle kafɔɔ nsinnaa di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ babɔkɛɛ kawee nii. Nioso nunua lekoto, ta bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ basiɛ di Gosen kasɔ suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Ninfɛ di Farao latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teefɔ ku babilee suɔtɔbi ntɔɔwa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ, <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Egipte kasɔ kamuu nsi fɔ ninnɛɛ; ta Teefɔ ku babilee suɔtɔbi basiɛ di kasɔ nwu lɛba nwaa suoto. Ta ma basiɛ di Gosen kasɔ. Nse kafɔɔ faye owo kaamɛ lɛma aye ni babɔkɛɛ ɔkpa nwaa, ni faayɔ babɔkɛɛ sele nii bamu fakpee nwɔ ninnɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Ninfɛ di Yosef lakpaa ote Yakob aalaasɛɛsa Farao nɛ. Di Yakob lasɛɛsa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47.7</char><char style="ft" closed="false">lawii lɛyɔɔ</char></note> Farao aaloo nii, <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />ninfɛ di Farao lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Alɛɛ asɛ fatoofũ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Ninfɛ di Yakob latɔkɔ Farao alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntɔɔkyɛ lekyi alɛɛ kɔlafa afosi atiɛ. Alɛɛ nii diikaatɛ ku bawa nii ale ya baakyɛ baakyi nii, kafɔɔ ntɔɔtɛ lɛnya kayi di nkpa nii kamɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Nni kamaa, Yakob lawii Farao lɛyɔɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47.10</char><char style="ft" closed="false">aaklaa</char></note>, ni aakyɛ di anu nɔɔ aasifi nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Nioso Yosef lata ote ku babilɛma suɔtɔbi lasiɛ di Egipte, di kasɔ ka ninlɛ ni nwaa di Rameses, fɛ mmle di Farao latɔkɔ nwɔ nii. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yosef kafɔɔ lata ote ku babilɛma suɔtɔbi ku ote leyo kamɛ batii bamuu alesaa di babi lɛma lɛpɔ kanya.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kɔka Lakpɛ Di Egipte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Alesaa kuanwii ditasinwɛ di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto, diekye kɔka nwu kanya latɛ kuawɛ osie; nioso Egipte batii ku Kanaan batii (laklee baakoso) ta kɔka nwu oso. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yosef lasiisa koto ko kumuu niawɛ ni di Egipte kasɔ ku Kanaan kasɔ baayɔ baaya ni atitabi aasifiko Farao leyo. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Obe wɔ di koto ntooloo ni di Egipte kasɔ ku Kanaan kasɔ yi, Egipte batii bamuu lawa Yosef ɔkyɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ato loo ntooloo. Lɛ oso buakpi di anu lɛfɔ nkpo? Ta wo alesaa bule.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Ninfɛ di Yosef latɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Biyɔ babɔkɛɛ sele lee bibakyɛlɛnsa ninta ye atitabi, ta kooto lee ntooloo ni oso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Nioso baayɔ babɔkɛɛ sele lɛma baawako Yosef, ni aata ma alesaa aakyɛlɛnsa aafũ bapɔnkɔ, bafoso, batie, banankyue ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo di ɔkyɛ lɛma nɛ. Ni aafũ babɔkɛɛ sele lɛma bamuu, aayɔ alesaa anyu ma kanya di lɛlɛɛ nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Di lɛlɛɛ nwu lafe nii, baawa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di lɛlɛɛ le niakyi diawa ni kamɛ babatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bulɔbafuo ɔlaa wɔ mmle ɔyɔ owofasa saate loo, nwaako di ato nsinnaa wo, babɔkɛɛ sele loo kafɔɔ bale fɔ nfɛ bale. Lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii diesimbu dite saate loo, diediki suoto loo ku nsɔ loo. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Be oso buakpi di anu lɛfɔ, awo ku nsɔ loo? Ya wo ku kasɔ loo, faatawo alesaa, di awo ku kasɔ loo buole balanle buta Farao. Ta wo atitabi mmle buasiɛ ni nkpa alɛ bulakpi ni, di kasɔ nwu dilɔbakple ni diputu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Nioso Yosef laya kasɔ nwu kamuu di Egipte aata Farao. Egipte batii bamuu lasunsũ afe lɛma, diekye kɔka nwu kanya latɛ kuawɛ osie kuata ma. Nioso kasɔ nwu lakple Farao kale. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Ninfɛ di Yosef labla batii nwu bamuu balanle di Egipte kasɔ, diayɔ ni di disi le, dialaase di disi le. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Kafɔɔ ataya olebatatɛ kasɔ, diekye baatoofũ alesaa di Farao nfũ obe lele, nioso alesaa ya di Farao lata ma ni lapɔ. Nkpo oso batasunsũ nsɔ lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 47:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Ninfɛ di Yosef latɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bikyɔɔ mi atoko, miɛ ntɔɔya ye ni ku kasɔ lee lɛta ni Farao yi, nnya atitabi ya bibalaapɛ ni di aafe. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Kafɔɔ nse biefee atita nwu, biyɔ dikyuu ninwii di akyuu anɔɔ kamɛ biwako Farao. Biɛyɔ akyuu ana di akyuu anɔɔ nwu kamɛ bitɛ di suoto, aabla atitabi ya bibapɛ ni di afe lee ku alesaa ata aye bamu ku ayo lee kamɛ batii ku babi lee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Ni baabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Fatoofũ wo nkpa. Ta buwɛ sibualɛ di anu lɛfɔ, saate loo; bubale balanle munta Farao.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 47:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Nioso Yosef layɔ aabla kufiofa di Egipte kasɔ kamuu suoto kute bia miɛ, alɛ alesaa dikyuu ninwii di akyuu anɔɔ kamɛ nle Farao lele. Olebatatɛ kasɔ lete ko nintale Farao kale.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Nioso Israel batii lasiɛ di Gosen kasɔ di Egipte kasɔ suoto. Baawɛ asaa ninfa, baalofo, baakpɛ di lɛpɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 47:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakob lasiɛ di Egipte kasɔ lefosi alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ, nioso alɛɛ ya aasiɛ ni nkpa labla alɛɛ kɔlafa afosi ana alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Di obe nfɛ kowo di Yakob makpi nii, aalɛɛ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yosef ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nse fabale mi sibualɛ se mmle yi, ni yɔ kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ fatika mi di kutĩ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47.29</char><char style="ft" closed="false">nle mmle kotuo ntam ɔka</char></note> faaka ntam falɛ fababla mi dibiene, fanle onukwale fantɛɛ. Tankookaa mi di Egipte kasɔ, <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />kafɔɔ se lekpi lesifi bate nii nfũ, tuka mi fadieko di Egipte kasɔ falaakokaa di lɛbale baakookaa ma ni.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Ni di Yosef latuna alɛ, &lt;&lt;Mabla fɛ mmle feebuɛ nii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Ni di Yakob labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka ntam fatɛɛ.&gt;&gt; Ninfɛ di Yosef laka ntam aatɔɔ nɛ, ni di Israel lawakosa disi kasɔ di atensaa nɔɔ disi aatansa Yaa nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s1">Yakob Lawii Manase Ku Efraim Lɛyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Di obe owo sɛmaa, baatɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teefɔ kofiɛ.&gt;&gt; Nioso aakpaa babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nwu banyɔ Manase ku Efraim baakyɛ ote ɔkyɛ. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ Yakob alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Yosef ntɔɔwa fɔ ɔsɛɛsa,&gt;&gt; aakpee kɔnyaabe aataka aasiɛ di atensaa nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="GEN 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Ninfɛ di Yakob latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni ladiki suoto aatuo mi di Lus di Kanaan kasɔ, ni aawii mi lɛyɔɔ <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, &lt;Mata fɔ fanlofo, fankpɛ di lɛpɔ kamɛ. Mabla fɔ kale kplɛ batii, mayɔ kafɔɔ kasɔ ka mmle nta banantii lɛfɔ ba nikɔwa fɔ ni sɛɛmaa, kambla kalema dinaa ni kaloo.&gt;<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />&lt;&lt;Ni nunua, babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ banyɔ ba baalofo baata fɔ ni di Egipte fiɛ lawa ni ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ di Egipte mabla mi bale; Efraim ku Manase makple mi bale fɛ mmle okle di Ruben ku Simeon nle mi ni bale. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Babi lele feekple feelofo ma kaamaa male bale fɔ; babale kasɔ nwu atesaa di ntɛɛ be di babilɛma suɔtɔbi male nii. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Obe wɔ latookple ni di Padan Aram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48.7</char><char style="ft" closed="false">lɛsɔdiki ninle Mesopotamia</char></note> latɔwa ni Kanaan kasɔ yi, ɔnyaamilaa nii, Rahel lakpi di Kanaan kasɔ bukyɛ ni osuku, nfɛ kɔtɛɛtɛɛ ni Efrat. Nioso lakookaa nwɔ ninfa di osuku lɔɔkɔ di Efrat&gt;&gt; (ninle ni Betlehem).<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Obe wɔ di Israel lanya ni Yosef babisuɔtɔbi, ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bawe nɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Ni di Yosef latɔkɔ ote alɛ, &lt;&lt;Mma ninle babisuɔtɔbi ba di Yaa lɛtɛɛ ni di Egipte ninfũ nɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Ninfɛ di Israel latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Kpaa ma fawakoe nin-wii ma lɛyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Anu nfɛ latobiɛ Israel ta lebe oso, atasintɔɔnya nwaa. Nioso Yosef lakpaa ma aakaakosa ote, ni aaminiko ma aafĩfĩɔ ma akpoo nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Ni di Israel latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntanyu nlɛ kakple nnya fɔ anu, kafɔɔ nunua Yaa ntɔɔtɛɛ lɛnya babi lɛfɔ kafɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Ninfɛ di Yosef latekete ma di Israel atĩ, ni aase katũ kaasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Ni di Yosef lakpaa basuɔtɔbi banyɔ nwu, Efraim di koletanɛɛ nɔɔ di Israel kɔmɛntukyɛ, Manase di kɔmɛntunɛɛ nɔɔ di Israel koletanɛɛkyɛ, ni akpukutisa ma aakaakosa ote nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Kafɔɔ Israel layɔ koletanɛɛ nɔɔ aatika di Efraim disi, nu di nnwɔɔ niale obisɔnle, aasanasa nnɛɛ nɔɔ, kɔmɛntunɛɛ nɔɔ latika di Manase disi, nu di nnwɔɔ niale obi kasale.<verse eid="GEN 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Ni aawii Yosef lɛyɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">&lt;&lt;Yaa wɔ anu di bate nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">Abraham ku Isak lakyɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">Yaa wɔ niale ko mi ni katũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">di nkpa nii mmuu disiɛbi diɛbase ni di miɛ dii le mmle,<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ wɔ niadiki mi aakyeko ni akpilesaa amuu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">awii basuɔtɔbi ba mmle lɛyɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Bayɔ leyooto nii balɛɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">ku bate nii Abraham ku Isak ayooto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">baalofo base basaabase kpinwu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">di kasɔ ka mmle suoto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Obe wɔ di Yosef lanya ote kɔyɔ koletanɛɛ nɔɔ antika ni di Efraim disi yi, ditamɛnɛmɛnɛ nwɔ; nioso aatekete ote kɔnɛɛ di Efraim disi aatika di Manase disi. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Ninfɛ di Yosef latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Oowo, Teete, nnya nnwɔ ninle ni obi kasale; yɔ koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ fatika di disi nɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Kafɔɔ ote lasĩ ni aabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;N-ye, obi nii, n-ye lɛsaa le kɔbla nii. Manase banantii kafɔɔ makpɛ mambla batii finle. Kafɔɔ obilɛma suɔtɔbi bisɔnle mataka katoo anlenkee nwɔ, banantii nɔɔ mabla nnle akudi kpinwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Ni aawii banyɔ lɛma nwu lɛyɔɔ di dii nwu nkpo, aabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:20">&lt;&lt;Israel batii mayɔ leyooto lɛfɔ manwii batii lɛyɔɔ mambuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:20">&lt;Yaa abla ye fɛle Efraim ku Manase okle.&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 48:20">Nioso Israel layɔ Efraim aalesa Manase katũ.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Ninfɛ di Israel latɔkɔ Yosef alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nfɛ ma kpi, kafɔɔ Yaa masiɛko ye, ankpaa ye ansifiko bawa lee kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Di afɔ ninle ni babilee suɔtɔbi disi oso yi, lɛyɔ kobukote kasɔ ka lakpɛ lafũ ni di Amori batii nnɛɛ ku kapamii ku kɔtaa lɛta fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s1">Yakob Lawii Babisuɔtɔbi Lɛyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Ninfɛ di Yakob lalɛɛ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bisiisa bawo biɛwa nintɔkɔ ye lɛsaa le nimawa ye ni di suoto di ayi ya nikɔwa ni sɛɛmaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />&lt;&lt;Yakob babisuɔtɔbi, bisi bienu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">bikyɔɔ atoko bienu teeye Israel ɔlaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />&lt;&lt;Ruben, afɔ ninle obi nii kasale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">osie nii, sekosopo nii kamɛ obi kasale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">afɔ ninkpe dibu falenke ku osie wɔ ninlenke nii.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Kafɔɔ fate fɛ ntu be nikɔkpankpa nii, flɔbasinle katũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">diekye faayie di teefɔ atensaa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">faakpɔnɔfɔsa atensaa nii.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />&lt;&lt;Simeon ku Lewi nle bawo babilɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">mpamii lɛma nle akpɛsaa ya ninlalaasa ni asaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Noomiɛ nlɛ nsiɛ di nfũ bookpee ni asi baawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">noomiɛ nlɛ nsiɛ di dikudi lɛma kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">diekye baayɔ ɔblɔ baalo batii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">baafee banankyue akpɔbi di mmle ninlɛ ma ni kanya.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Bɛɛkpaani ɔblɔ lɛma nwu, diekye kuɔyakayaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">ɔblɔ lɛma nwu kafɔɔ lesii osie!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Masɛ ma nkpete di Yakob kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">nsamiisa ma kafɔɔ di Israel kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />&lt;&lt;Yuda, babilee suɔtɔbi matansa fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">fabalenkee balo lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">teefɔ babisuɔtɔbi mawakasɔ mata fɔ.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yuda kyata dibi fale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">obisuɔtɔbi nii, fatalakpa feekple fɛɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Ɛɛklɛ ate kloklo, fɛle kyatasuɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">fɛle kyatasanko, owe dikle ɔkɔnsɔ ankpee nwɔ kubuɛ?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Kayofo dilɔbaloo di Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">ee lɛkɔ didie di nkpaatũ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">diɛlaase di obe wɔ di otii wɔ nimba ni lɛwa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">nnwɔɔ di nnle mayɔ dibu manta nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Abanii bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo di nwanyi dikumii suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">annii bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo dibi kafɔɔ di nwanyi dikumii nwaa ɔla suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">abafoto abula nɔɔ di nwanyi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">anfoto akpeele nɔɔ kafɔɔ di nwanyi sɛɛle wɔ ninte ni fɛ ntɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Anu nɔɔ masɛɛ anlenkee nwanyi sɛɛle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">anyɛɛ nɔɔ mpu anlenkee nankyue nnyɛɛntu.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />&lt;&lt;Sebulon masiɛ di lekpo kotoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">nimbla seklo nyilakɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">abate kasɔ kɔmɛ anaadu Sidon.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />&lt;&lt;Isaka nle sientɛ wɔ ninte ni fɛ bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">ate ni di atoo anyɔ obo.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Nse ɛɛnya mmle di ɔnyɛɛ katɛkɔ nɔɔ nlɛ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">ku mmle di kasɔ nɔɔ nlɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">abawakosa amuusi nɔɔ kasɔ anta atoo nutũle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">an-yɔ suoto anta ɔkpɛ siene ɔbla.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />&lt;&lt;Dan makanko batii nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:16">fɛ ana bule di Israel.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Dan male kɔsaanwu di osuku lɔɔkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">anle akotia ante di nkpaa osuku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">antoonu bapɔnkɔ anankpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">ninta basiɛtɛ lɛma nnɔɔ sɛmaasɛmaa mampɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />&lt;&lt;O Saate, konyu osuku nta didiki lɛfɔ.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />&lt;&lt;Bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ dikudi madieko Gad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">kafɔɔ abadieko ma di anankpo lɛma suoto.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />&lt;&lt;Aser alesaa masiɛ lɛla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">abata alesaa nwaa ya niesiɛko ni ɔka.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />&lt;&lt;Naftali nle kafɛ ka ninsiko ni suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">anlofo ni abi biene.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />&lt;&lt;Yosef nle kolewoso ko nintika ni abi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">kolewoso ko nin-yɛ ni di okle kotoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">di sɛla nɔɔ nkata ni di oyoyiɛ.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Balo nɔɔ kɔtaa bataatɛ lataka nwɔ di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">baakpee nwɔ kubuɛ baataa nwɔ.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Kafɔɔ kɔtaa nɔɔ nyila kpinkpĩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">ambensa nnɛɛ antɔɔtaa wlawla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">diekye di Yakob Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni kɔnɛɛ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">diekye ale Bafosokpatɛ ku Difuɔnkpaa ɛɛta Israel,<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />diekye di teefɔ Yaa wɔ ninkyakaako fɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">diekye ni di Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni n-wii fɔ ni lɛyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">ku lɛyɔɔ le ninkye ni osi kaatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">ku lɛyɔɔ le ninte ni di kasɔ kalɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">ku lɛyɔɔ le niekye ni lɛnyɛɛ ku olofofɔtɔ kamɛ oso.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Teefɔ lɛyɔɔ lɛtɛ dipɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">dilenke bakofo abokote lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">dilenke n-ya niekye ni akpenkpe ya ninaa ni kaloo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">N-ya mmle amuu atikanko Yosef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">diekye nnwɔɔ ninle tunletɛ wɔ bɛɛblasa ni di babilɛma suɔtɔbi suoto nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />&lt;&lt;Benyamin nle ɔkpɛlɛle wɔ di kɔka nkle ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">anwee babɔkɛɛ ba eemufũ ni ku olesɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">kɔtɔɔfɔ ansɛ aasaa ya eefũ ni baalo nɔɔ nnɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Mba mmle bamuu ninle lefosi nfaabi nnyɔ nwu di Israel kasɔ nɛ. Nsĩ nianle sɛlaa se di ote lɛma labuɛ aatɔkɔ ma ni di obe wɔ aawii ma ni lɛyɔɔ nɛ. Awii obiala lɛma lɛyɔɔ le niasiɛko nwɔ nii.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakob Kukpi Ku Okookaa Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Ninfɛ di Yakob latɔkɔ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obe diesinkyo masifi ni bawa nii nfũ. Bikookaa mi di bawa nii ofuɔntuu di Efron wɔ ninle ni Heti otii kofe kamɛ, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />ofuɔntuu nwu nte di Makpela kofe kamɛ di Mamre di Kanaan kasɔ, nka di Abraham laya ni ku kofe nwu fɛ batii kakookaakɔ di Efron wɔ ninle ni Heti otii nfũ. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Nfa baakookaa Abraham ku ɔsɔfɔ Sara, baakookaa Isak ku ɔsɔfɔ Rebeka, nfa kafɔɔ lakookaa ɔsɔfɔ nii Lea nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Heti batii nfũ baaya kofe nwu ku ofuɔntuu nwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Obe wɔ di Yakob laloo ni ɔkakatɛ ɔta babisuɔtɔbi nwu, ni aakple aaklɛ aate di atensaa nɔɔ suoto nɛ. Ni aanwuna ninwuna nɔɔ yɛntɛle, ni aasifi bawa nɔɔ nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Ninfɛ di Yosef layɔ disi aatika di ote suoto, aawi aakpete nwɔ aafĩfĩɔ nwɔ akpoo. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Ni di Yosef latɔkɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ba ninle ni afa bablatɛ alɛ bafifia ote Israel kpi kɔfa nɛ. Nioso afa bablatɛ nwu lafifia nwɔ kɔfa baatɛ, <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />diale ayi afosi ana, diekye nkpo niale obe wɔ dikaatɛ kpi wɔ beefifia ni kɔfa kate anaadu nɛ. Ni di Egipte batii lawi nwɔ ayi afosi akuɛnsĩ nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Obe wɔ baawi nwɔ baaloo nii, Yosef latɔkɔ Farao banɔɔfo alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lekoto nse biale mi sibualɛ, bitɔkɔ Farao ɔlaa bitɛɛ. Bitɔkɔ nwɔ bilɛ, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />&lt;Teemi latɛɛ laka ntam labuɛ nlɛ, &lt;&lt;Nfɛ makpi; kookaa mi di ɔkya wɔ lakutu lata ni suoto nii kamɛ di Kanaan kasɔ.&gt;&gt; Nioso nunua tɛɛ osuku ninkyɛ ninaakookaa teemi; ninkple nnwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Ni di Farao labuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Tɔɔkyɛ falaakookaa teefɔ, fɛ mmle aata fɔ faaka ni ntam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Nioso Yosef lakyɛ alɛ ɔɔlaakookaa ote. Farao banɔɔfotii bamuu ku banɔɔfotii di leyo nɔɔ kamɛ ku banɔɔfotii bamuu di Egipte kasɔ latikanko nwɔ baakyɛ. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Yosef leyo kamɛ batii bamuu ku babilɛma suɔtɔbi ku ote banantii latikanko nwɔ baakyɛ. Babi lɛma ku bafoso ku batie ku banankyue lɛma lete niabu di Gosen kasɔ. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ kafɔɔ latikanko nwɔ baakyɛ, batii dikudi kplɛ nimu baale.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Baadu ni Atad kakpaa ka niakaako ni Yordan okle, baawi Yakob osie kanya; ni di Yosef labla ote kaku ayi akuɛnsĩ nɛ. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Obe wɔ di Kanaan batii ba niasiɛ ni ninfa lanya ma bɔɔbla ni kaku di Atad kakpaa nwu nkpo yi, ni baabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Egipte batii kɔbla kaku finle.&gt;&gt; Nioso bɔɔlɛɛ lɛba nwu ninkaako ni Yordan alɛ Abel Misraim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ Egipte batii kaku ɔbla</char></note> nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Nioso Yakob babisuɔtɔbi labla fɛ mmle di ote lɛma latɔkɔ ma nii: <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Baatuka nwɔ baasifiko Kanaan kasɔ baalaakookaa nwɔ di ofuɔntuu kamɛ di Makpela kofe, dikaako ni Mamre, di Abraham laya ni ku kofe nwu di Efron wɔ niale ni Heti otii ɔkyɛ aatɛ aata ni batii okookaa. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Aakookaa ote aaloo nii, Yosef lakple aasifi Egipte manko babilɛma suɔtɔbi ku batii ba bamuu niatikanko nwɔ baalaakookaa ni ote.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosef Lakpee Babilɛma Suɔtɔbi Kɔnɛɛ Kaafutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Obe wɔ di Yosef babilɛma suɔtɔbi lanya alɛ ote lɛma ntookpi nii yi, baabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Lɛ bubabla nse Yosef lekpee wo di otu alɛ ɔɔtawo okpile wɔ omuu buabla nwɔ ni koto?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Nioso bakpee Yosef otii baalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Teefɔ labuɛ ɔlaa wɔ mmle aatɛ fiɛ aakpi: <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />&lt;Alɛ bitɔkɔ Yosef bilɛ: Lekoto, yɔ babilee suɔtɔbi sikpile se ku amumu kpile ya baabla fɔ ni fakyɛ ma, diekye batafuo ku kɔkpaa ko baadi ni di suoto lɛfɔ.&gt; Nioso lekoto, yɔ teefɔ Yaa bakpɛmblatɛ sikpile fakyɛ ma.&gt;&gt; Obe wɔ di Yosef lanu ni ɔlaa lɛma nwu, aawi kaku.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Ninfɛ di babilɛma suɔtɔbi labapɛ akunkyi di nkpaatũ nɔɔ baabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɔ wo fabla balanle lɛfɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Kafɔɔ Yosef latɔkɔ ma alɛ, &lt;&lt;Bitanyɛkɛ. Ami nin-yɛ di Yaa kayilakɔ? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Aye biatɛ bilɛ biɔbla mi amumu, kafɔɔ Yaa lɛta diɛbakple dibiene alɛ aafũ batii kpinwu nkpa, fɛ mmle batɔɔbla ni nunua. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Nioso yi, bitanyɛkɛ. Manyu ye ku babi lee.&gt;&gt; Ni aakple aakpee ma kɔnɛɛ kaafutu aakakatɛko ma di sibilɛma kanya nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosef Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yosef lasiɛ di Egipte kasɔ manko ote leyo kamɛ batii. Aasiɛ nkpa alɛɛ kɔlafa ku lefosi <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />aanya Efram bawatɛtɛ. Aanya kafɔɔ Manase obi, Makir babi ba aalofo abatika ni di nnwɔɔ Yosef atĩ.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Ninfɛ di Yosef latɔkɔ babilɛma suɔtɔbi alɛ, &lt;&lt;Obe nii ntoowo makpi nii. Kafɔɔ nwaako Yaa mawa amadiki ye di kasɔ ka mmle suoto ansifiko kasɔ ka aabuɛ aatɛ alɛ abata ni Abraham ku Isak ku Yakob.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Ni di Yosef lata Israel babisuɔtɔbi laka ntam baabuɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwaako Yaa mawa amadiki ye, nioso dikpeni biɛyɔ akufi nii ninfũ biesifiko.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GEN 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Nioso Yosef lakpi di obe wɔ aafũ ni alɛɛ kɔlafa ku lefosi. Ni baafifia nwɔ kɔfa baalolaa nwɔ, baayɔ nwɔ baakpee di alakaa kamɛ di Egipte nɛ.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>